window.FWN_VILLAIN_CLAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_VILLAIN_CLAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":701,"title":"Chapter 701: The Undying Refined Corpses","paragraphs":["Five Bai Clan Earth Immortals immediately stepped forward to intercept the remaining Golden Immortal refined corpse.","They knew perfectly well that defeating it would not be easy.","A Golden Immortal was still a Golden Immortal.","Even as a refined corpse, the difference between its cultivation and theirs was enormous.","Boom!","The Golden Immortal corpse descended.","A terrifying fist crashed downward.","The five Earth Immortals immediately scattered.","BOOM!!!","The ground exploded. A massive crater appeared beneath them.","However, none of the five had been injured.","\"Keep it occupied!\"","One of the Bai Clan elders shouted.","That was their objective from the beginning.","They did not need to defeat the Golden Immortal corpse.","They only needed to make sure that it could not freely attack the weaker Bai Clan cultivators.","As long as they could contain it, that was enough.","And despite the enormous difference in cultivation, the five Earth Immortals were not completely helpless.","The Golden Immortal corpse possessed terrifying physical strength.","It did not fear death.","It did not hesitate.","It did not care about injuries.","Every attack it launched was direct and ruthless.","However, it also had an obvious weakness. Its intelligence was limited.","After becoming a refined corpse, its combat instincts remained.","But its ability to think, adapt, and make complicated decisions was nowhere near that of a living Golden Immortal.","The five Earth Immortals immediately took advantage of that weakness.","Boom!","One elder attacked from the front.","The Golden Immortal corpse immediately turned toward him.","At the same time—","Slash!","Another attack struck from behind.","The corpse ignored the attack and swung its arm backward.","However, by the time its attack landed, the Bai Clan elders had already retreated.","Boom!","Another technique descended from above.","Then another.","Then another.","The five Earth Immortals moved constantly.","They never remained in one place.","They never confronted the Golden Immortal corpse directly for long.","Instead, they continuously attacked, retreated, distracted it, and pulled it away from the main battlefield.","The Golden Immortal corpse roared silently.","Its attacks became increasingly violent.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Every strike shattered the ground. Several buildings collapsed.","Yet despite its terrifying power, it was unable to kill any of the five Earth Immortals.","The Bai Clan experts were simply too coordinated.","Whenever one of them was targeted, the other four immediately intervened.","And whenever the corpse attempted to break through their encirclement, another attack would force it back.","They were not trying to defeat it.","They were merely buying time.","And that was more than enough.","Meanwhile, the reinforcement provided by the Gu Master had undoubtedly made the battle more difficult for the Bai Clan.","The Shen Clan, which had previously been completely overwhelmed, finally found an opportunity to breathe.","The Earth Immortal refined corpses had joined the battlefield.","The Immortal Ascension Realm corpses had also begun attacking.","For the first time since the Bai Clan launched its assault, the Shen Clan cultivators no longer felt completely helpless.","\"Attack!\"","\"Don’t retreat!\"","\"Kill them!\"","The Shen Clan elders began shouting once again.","Their confidence slowly returned.","Previously, they had been slaughtered without any ability to resist.","But now, with the refined corpses fighting alongside them, the pressure on the Shen Clan had greatly decreased.","Some Shen Clan cultivators even began counterattacking.","However—","That was all.","The Gu Master’s appearance had made the battle harder. But it has not reversed the situation.","The refined corpses were not sweeping through the Bai Clan’s ranks and slaughtering cultivators left and right.","The Bai Clan’s experts were still stronger.","Their techniques were still superior.","Their artifacts were still better.","The Shen Clan had merely gone from being completely crushed to barely being able to resist somewhat.","And elsewhere, Bai Chu finally clashed with the two Golden Immortal refined corpses.","The first corpse appeared before him.","Bai Chu raised his Saint Grade Sword.","A terrifying sword light shot forward.","Slash!","The attack cut directly toward the Golden Immortal corpse.","The corpse immediately raised its arm.","BOOM!!!","The attack collided with its body.","The Golden Immortal corpse was forced several steps backward.","A deep wound appeared across its arm. However, Bai Chu did not have time to continue his attack.","Boom!","The second Golden Immortal corpse had already arrived. Its fist crashed toward Bai Chu.","Bai Chu’s expression remained calm.","The Saint Grade Sword moved.","The attack that had been aimed at the first corpse instantly changed.","From offense—","To defense.","Clang!!!","The sword blocked the incoming fist. A terrifying shockwave erupted.","Bai Chu was pushed backward.","Before he could stabilize himself, the first Golden Immortal corpse attacked again.","Boom!","One corpse attacked from the front.","The other attacked from behind.","They showed no hesitation.","No fear.","No concern for their own safety.","They attacked relentlessly.","Again and again.","Bai Chu’s sword moved continuously.","Clang! Clang! Clang!","Each collision produced terrifying shockwaves.","The ground beneath them gradually collapsed.","Buildings in the surrounding area were destroyed by the overflowing energy.","However, the two refined corpses continued advancing.","They did not slow down.","They did not hesitate.","That was the terrifying nature of refined corpses.","They were already dead.","Pain meant nothing to them.","Fear meant nothing to them.","As long as their master gave the command, they would continue attacking until their bodies were completely destroyed.","Bai Chu’s eyes narrowed.","Then—","Slash!","A small sword light flashed. The attack struck the first Golden Immortal corpse.","A wound appeared across its shoulder.","However, the corpse did not even react.","It continued attacking.","Boom!","Bai Chu blocked another strike.","Then—","Slash!","Another sword light struck the second corpse.","A deep wound appeared across its chest. Still, there was no reaction.","The Gu Master watched from a distance.","A sneer appeared on his face.","Bai Chu’s attacks were landing. However, they were not causing any meaningful damage.","The wounds were simply not deep enough. And even when they were injured, the refined corpses did not care.","Blood did not matter.","Pain did not matter.","Unless Bai Chu could completely destroy their bodies or inflict truly devastating damage, such injuries were meaningless.","More importantly, his refined corpses possessed terrifying regenerative abilities.","He didn’t think that those small attacks would amount to anything.","The Gu Master’s smile widened.","\"You’re just wasting your time.\"","Bai Chu continued moving.","Slash!","Another sword light struck one of the corpses.","The Gu Master merely watched with amusement.","In his eyes, Bai Chu was wasting both his Qi and his strength.","The refined corpses could continue fighting for an extremely long time. But Bai Chu was different.","His stamina was limited.","The longer the battle continued, the more disadvantageous it would become for him.","And eventually, he would fall.","The Gu Master’s gaze became increasingly greedy.","Bai Chu!","The Saint Grade Sword!","Both would soon belong to him.","However, as Bai Chu continued defending against the two Golden Immortal corpses, a faint smile slowly appeared on his face.","Bai Chu’s eyes were on the Saint Grade Sword in his hand.","Could these refined corpses’ regeneration really compare to that of the Half-Qilin?","The answer was obvious.","No!","The Half-Qilin possessed an absurdly powerful bloodline.","Its vitality was monstrous.","Even after suffering serious injuries, it had been capable of recovering at an astonishing speed.","Yet even the Half-Qilin’s regeneration had been weakened after being wounded by this sword.","The wounds inflicted by the Saint Grade Sword did not simply heal as easily as ordinary injuries.","The sword itself carried a terrifying power. A power capable of suppressing the regenerative abilities of those it wounded.","If even the Half-Qilin had been affected by it—","How could these refined corpses possibly be an exception?","Bai Chu had already tested it.","The small wounds he had inflicted might appear insignificant.","However, he had not been attacking randomly.","Every strike had been deliberate.","Every wound had been a test.","And the result had already become clear.","Their regeneration was indeed powerful. But it was slowing down.","The Gu Master had yet to notice. And that was good news.","Bai Chu glanced toward the Gu Master.","A faint smile appeared on his face.","It seemed that the Gu Master was completely oblivious.","He still believed that his refined corpses were recovering normally.","He still believed that Bai Chu was merely wasting his Qi.","He still believed that the longer the battle continued, the more advantage he would gain.","But Bai Chu knew better.","His attacks were not meaningless.","Every sword strike was weakening the refined corpses.","Every wound was reducing their ability to recover.","And as those injuries continued to accumulate—","Their terrifying regenerative abilities would eventually become useless.","Boom!","The first Golden Immortal corpse attacked again.","Bai Chu raised his sword.","Clang!!!","The attack was blocked. The second corpse immediately followed.","Boom!","Bai Chu retreated.","Then—","Slash!","Another sword light flashed. A new wound appeared across the corpse’s chest.","The Gu Master sneered.","\"Keep attacking.\"","His voice echoed toward the two refined corpses.","\"Don’t give him a chance to breathe.\"","The two corpses immediately increased their attacks.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Their fists descended relentlessly.","Bai Chu’s body moved continuously.","Sometimes defending.","Sometimes retreating.","Sometimes launching another seemingly insignificant attack.","To the Gu Master, every one of those attacks was a waste. But Bai Chu’s expression remained calm.","Another wound.","Then another.","Then another.","The injuries on the two Golden Immortal refined corpses gradually increased.","And although the Gu Master had not noticed it yet—","The wounds were no longer healing as quickly as before.","Bai Chu tightened his grip around the Saint Grade Sword. A cold light flashed through his eyes.","\"Let’s see how long you can keep regenerating.\""]},{"number":702,"title":"Chapter 702: Blood Gu Art","paragraphs":["The Gu Master’s smile slowly disappeared.","At first, he had not paid much attention to the wounds Bai Chu had inflicted.","To refined corpses, such injuries were meaningless.","They did not feel pain.","They did not fear death.","And most importantly, their regenerative abilities were far beyond those of ordinary cultivators.","A wound that would take a living cultivator hours or even days to recover from could often heal within moments.","That was precisely why the Gu Master had remained so confident.","However, several moments later, his expression changed.","His eyes narrowed. The wound on the first Golden Immortal corpse’s arm was still there.","It had not healed.","At least, not as quickly as it should have.","The Gu Master’s expression darkened.","He immediately focused his senses on the corpse.","Sure enough. The flesh around the wound was slowly regenerating.","However, the speed was far slower than normal.","It was almost as though something was suppressing its regenerative abilities.","The Gu Master’s pupils contracted.","\"The Saint Grade Artifact...\"","His gaze immediately landed on the sword in Bai Chu’s hand.","A cold expression appeared on his face.","He had underestimated the Saint Grade Sword.","It was not merely powerful. The injuries inflicted by the weapon carried some kind of special power.","A power that interfered with the refined corpses’ regenerative abilities.","And the situation was becoming increasingly obvious.","Slash!","Another sword light flashed. The first Golden Immortal corpse was struck across the shoulder.","A deep wound appeared.","The corpse immediately retaliated.","Boom!","Its fist crashed toward Bai Chu.","However, Bai Chu had already retreated.","The second Golden Immortal corpse immediately attacked from another direction.","Bai Chu raised his sword.","Clang!!!","The attacks collided.","A powerful shockwave swept through the surroundings.","Bai Chu’s body slid backward through the air.","However, the two refined corpses were not in much better condition.","The wounds covering their bodies continued to accumulate.","More importantly, their movements were gradually becoming sluggish.","The Gu Master’s expression became increasingly ugly.","Although refined corpses did not feel pain, damage was still damage.","Their bodies could only function properly if their internal structures remained intact.","Normally, this would not matter. Their regenerative abilities would immediately repair any injuries.","However, with the Saint Grade Sword suppressing that regeneration, the damage was beginning to accumulate.","The first corpse moved.","Its arm was slightly slower than before.","The second corpse attempted to launch another attack.","However, its damaged shoulder visibly affected its movement.","Bai Chu noticed everything.","A faint smile appeared on his face.","The Gu Master clenched his fists.","\"Damn it!\"","He had originally believed that the two Golden Immortal refined corpses would eventually exhaust Bai Chu.","Instead, the situation was slowly beginning to turn against them.","If this continued, the two refined corpses might actually lose.","The Gu Master’s eyes became cold.","A sinister expression appeared on his face.","\"So what if you can suppress their regeneration?\"","He slowly raised one hand.","The Gu Master looked down at his palm.","Without hesitation—","Slash!","A sharp blade flashed.","Blood immediately splattered through the air.","The Gu Master had directly cut open his own palm.","However, his expression did not change in the slightest.","Dark crimson blood flowed from the wound. An eerie and sinister aura spread through the air.","The Bai Clan experts immediately sensed something unusual.","Bai Chu narrowed his eyes.","The Gu Master slowly extended his bleeding hand.","Then—","\"Blood Gu Art!\"","Buzz!","A strange light suddenly appeared around his palm.","The blood flowing from his hand did not fall to the ground.","Instead, it rose into the air.","One drop after another.","They gathered together.","Then suddenly—","Whoosh!","The blood shot toward the two Golden Immortal refined corpses.","Splash!","The first corpse was covered in blood.","The second immediately received the same treatment.","BOOM!!!","A terrifying aura suddenly erupted from the two corpses.","The Gu Master’s blood rapidly seeped into their bodies.","Dark crimson lines spread across their skin.","Their dull eyes suddenly became bloodshot.","A violent aura erupted.","ROAR!!!","The two Golden Immortal refined corpses released terrifying roars.","Their previous sluggishness disappeared.","The wounds that had slowed their movements remained.","However, the aura surrounding their bodies had increased dramatically.","Bai Chu’s expression finally became serious.","The Gu Master’s sinister laughter echoed across the battlefield.","\"Hahaha!\"","His face was slightly pale from the blood loss.","However, his eyes were filled with excitement.","\"Do you really think that is enough to defeat my refined corpses?\"","The two corpses suddenly disappeared.","Bai Chu’s pupils contracted.","\"So fast!\"","Boom!","A fist suddenly appeared before him.","Bai Chu immediately raised his Saint Grade Sword.","CLANG!!!","A terrifying force exploded against the blade.","Bai Chu’s body was sent flying backward.","Before he could stabilize himself—","Boom!","The second Golden Immortal corpse appeared behind him.","Its attack descended without hesitation.","Bai Chu quickly turned.","The Saint Grade Sword moved.","BOOM!!!","Another terrifying collision erupted.","Bai Chu was forced downward.","The ground beneath him instantly collapsed.","A massive crater appeared.","The Gu Master’s smile widened.","The two Golden Immortal corpses did not give Bai Chu even a moment to breathe.","Boom!","One attacked from the front.","Boom!","The other attacked from above.","Their movements had become far more violent.","Far more powerful.","And far more reckless.","Bai Chu blocked one attack.","Before he could counterattack, the second corpse had already arrived.","Clang! Clang! Clang!","The Saint Grade Sword moved continuously.","Terrifying shockwaves erupted across the battlefield.","This time, Bai Chu could no longer casually launch small attacks.","The pressure from the two Golden Immortal refined corpses had increased dramatically.","Their attacks came one after another.","His arms trembled slightly. The second corpse immediately attacked.","Bai Chu was forced to retreat again.","The Gu Master watched everything with a cold smile.","\"Good!\"","The power of the refined corpses had increased significantly after absorbing his blood.","Although the Saint Grade Sword could still suppress their regenerative abilities that no longer mattered as much.","As long as they could overwhelm Bai Chu before the accumulated injuries became too severe, the battle would end.","Meanwhile, Bai Chu slid backward through the air.","His clothes were slightly damaged.","His expression had become considerably more serious.","The two Golden Immortal refined corpses stood before him.","Dark crimson lines covered their bodies.","Their bloodshot eyes were fixed firmly on Bai Chu.","The Gu Master’s blood had made them far more violent than before.","Their strength had increased.","Their speed had increased.","Even their attacks had become more ferocious.","Bai Chu slowly tightened his grip around the Saint Grade Sword.","His figure suddenly flickered.","\"Nine Shadows Flowing Light Sword!\"","Whoosh!","Bai Chu instantly disappeared.","Nine figures appeared across the battlefield.","For a moment, even the Gu Master’s expression changed. However, he already knew about it from the intel.","The nine figures moved simultaneously.","They surrounded the two Golden Immortal refined corpses.","Sword lights flashed from every direction.","Slash! Slash! Slash!","The two corpses immediately reacted.","Boom!","One corpse punched toward a shadow.","Its fist passed directly through it.","The shadow disappeared.","The other corpse turned.","Boom!","Another shadow was destroyed.","Then another.","Then another.","The battlefield became filled with flashing figures.","The two refined corpses attacked wildly.","For a brief moment, Bai Chu successfully confused them.","However, it did not last long.","Boom!","A terrifying fist swept through the air.","Three shadows disappeared instantly.","The other Golden Immortal corpse moved.","Its bloodshot eyes suddenly locked onto one particular figure.","The real Bai Chu.","Whoosh!","The corpse instantly charged forward.","Bai Chu’s pupils narrowed.","(So quickly?)","The two corpses attacked simultaneously.","Bai Chu immediately retreated.","The Nine Shadows Flowing Light Sword was indeed a powerful technique.","However, against opponents who were this powerful, its effects were limited.","The refined corpses’ overwhelming speed and destructive power allowed them to destroy the shadows almost instantly.","Using the technique repeatedly would only waste more Qi.","Bai Chu’s eyes became calm.","Rather than wasting his strength on a technique that could only buy him a brief moment—","He would conserve his Qi.","His previous strategy was also no longer useful.","The Gu Master’s blood had made the two refined corpses too powerful.","Their attacks had become too fierce.","Bai Chu could no longer slowly weaken them while calmly defending.","If that was the case—","\"I can only use my trump card.\"","The two Golden Immortal corpses charged again.","Boom!","Bai Chu raised his sword.","However, instead of immediately attacking, he began accumulating his Qi.","The Saint Grade Sword trembled.","Buzz!","A terrifying sword intent began gathering around him. The Gu Master’s expression gradually changed.","\"What is he doing?\"","The air began to shake.","A terrifying amount of Qi began flowing toward the Saint Grade Sword.","Buzz! Buzz!","The sword trembled violently.","Bai Chu’s aura continued rising.","Higher and higher.","The Gu Master’s expression finally changed.","\"N-No...\"","His eyes widened.","The terrifying pressure gathering around the sword caused even him to feel a chill run down his spine.","This was definitely not an ordinary technique. nor was it a Heaven Grade technique.","A Heaven Grade technique could not possibly create such terrifying pressure.","The Gu Master’s face gradually turned pale.","\"Saint Grade...\"","The moment those words left his mouth, Bai Chu opened his eyes.","A terrifying light flashed within them.","\"Fate Severing Slash!\"","BOOM!!!","The Saint Grade Sword descended.","Then a terrifying sword light erupted.","The entire sky was split apart.","The ground below Bai Chu collapsed.","The sword light tore across the battlefield with unstoppable momentum.","The Gu Master’s pupils contracted.","\"Retreat!\"","The two Golden Immortal refined corpses reacted instantly.","However—","One of them was too slow.","The terrifying sword light swept across its body.","There was no explosion.","No chance to resist.","The Golden Immortal refined corpse simply disappeared.","Not even a trace of dust remained.","The Gu Master’s expression froze.","One of his Golden Immortal refined corpses was gone!","Completely destroyed!","The sword light continued forward.","The remaining Golden Immortal corpse immediately dodged.","The Gu Master himself also moved without hesitation.","BOOM!!!","The terrifying attack swept past them. A massive portion of the Shen Clan behind them vanished.","The earth was split apart.","A deep scar stretched across the battlefield.","The Gu Master slowly turned his head.","Cold sweat covered his forehead.","His eyes were filled with disbelief.","If that attack had struck him, he did not even want to imagine what would have happened.","The same was true for the remaining Golden Immortal refined corpse.","Although it had managed to escape, the Gu Master knew perfectly well that it would not have survived if it had been hit directly.","The Gu Master’s face gradually became ugly.","A Saint Grade Sword.","And now—","A Saint Grade technique!","He had completely underestimated Bai Chu.","The excitement and greed in his eyes slowly disappeared.","For the first time since the battle began, the Gu Master felt something else.","Fear!","Bai Chu stood in the distance.","The Saint Grade Sword remained raised in his hand.","His breathing had become slightly heavier.","That attack had consumed a tremendous amount of Qi.","However, the result was obvious. One Golden Immortal refined corpse had been completely erased.","As for the remaining Golden Immortal Corpse, he doesn’t need to use his Fate Severing Slash.","He, alone is more than enough!"]},{"number":703,"title":"Chapter 703: The Strategic Retreat","paragraphs":["The Gu Master’s expression became increasingly ugly.","The situation had changed completely.","Just moments ago, he had been standing above the battlefield, convinced that everything was under his control.","Three Golden Immortal refined corpses.","Fifteen Earth Immortal refined corpses.","Several Immortal Ascension Realm refined corpses.","Such a force should have been more than enough to crush the Bai Clan.","Yet now, one of his Golden Immortal refined corpses had been completely erased.","Not defeated.","Not damaged.","Erased!","Not even a trace of its body remained.","And that was only the beginning.","The Gu Master quickly swept his divine sense across the battlefield.","His expression darkened further.","The second Golden Immortal refined corpse was still being held back by the five Bai Clan Earth Immortals.","Even though it possessed overwhelming physical strength, it had been unable to break free from their coordinated attacks.","Their objective had always been simple.","Keep it occupied. And so far, they have succeeded.","Meanwhile, the situation on the other fronts was no better.","Boom!","An Earth Immortal refined corpse was blasted backward.","Before it could regain its balance, two Bai Clan Earth Immortals attacked simultaneously.","BOOM!!!","The corpse crashed into the ground.","Elsewhere—","Slash!","A Bai Clan expert’s artifact cut across the body of another refined corpse.","The corpse immediately attempted to retaliate.","However, three more attacks descended at the same time.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Its body was buried beneath the rubble.","The Immortal Ascension Realm battlefield was equally unfavorable.","Although the refined corpses did not fear death and continued attacking relentlessly, the Bai Clan cultivators were simply too well-equipped.","Now, the situation was similar to how it had been before the Gu Master intervened.","The Shen Clan side was being slaughtered once again.","The Gu Master’s forces were losing.","On every front!","The Shen Clan cultivators gradually fell into despair.","The situation had returned to how it had been before the Gu Master intervened.","Previously, the Gu Master’s refined corpses had at least given them hope.","They had believed that the terrifying army of corpses would change everything.","Yet reality had proven otherwise.","The refined corpses could not feel fear.","They could not feel despair.","They could not feel regret.","But the Shen Clan cultivators could.","And now, they were terrified.","Boom!","Another Shen Clan cultivator was sent flying.","Before he could even stabilize himself, a Bai Clan expert appeared before him.","Slash!","Blood splattered through the air.","The cultivator’s body fell from the sky.","Elsewhere, another group of Shen Clan cultivators desperately tried to resist.","However, the result was no different.","The Bai Clan experts broke through their defenses.","One after another, the Shen Clan cultivators fell.","They weren’t some nameless Shen Clan members either.","Many of them were famous across the Empire and had their names carved into the list of the Top 100 strongest.","Yet even so, right now, they were being killed like powerless chickens.","The brief confidence they had regained after the Gu Master’s intervention had completely disappeared.","\"Retreat!\"","\"Fall back!\"","\"We can’t stop them!\"","Panicked voices echoed throughout the Shen Clan.","However, there was nowhere to retreat.","The Bai Clan’s flying ship remained above them.","And the Bai Clan cultivators had already surrounded the entire area.","The Shen Clan was trapped.","Shen Wuheng stood among the chaos.","His face had become deathly pale.","His body trembled slightly as he watched one Shen Clan cultivator after another fall.","His heart was filled with disbelief.","Then—","Regret!","Deep regret.","Back then, when these powerful cultivators had approached the Shen Clan, Shen Wuheng had believed that fortune had finally favored him.","They were powerful.","They possessed methods that Shen Wuheng could not even comprehend.","Golden Immortal refined corpses.","Earth Immortal refined corpses.","An army capable of destroying countless forces throughout the Eastern Continent.","With such people standing behind the Shen Clan, what did they have to fear?","Shen Wuheng had truly believed that this was his opportunity.","His chance to rise.","His chance to lead the Shen Clan to an unprecedented height.","Perhaps one day, the Shen Clan would become the absolute power of the Desolate Heaven Empire.","Perhaps even the Bai Clan would have no choice but to bow before them.","At the time, Shen Wuheng had believed that the Bai Clan was powerful.","But power could be surpassed.","As long as the Shen Clan had powerful enough allies, they could eventually stand above the Bai Clan.","That was what he had believed.","But now, reality had slapped him across the face.","Shen Wuheng watched helplessly as several members of his clan were killed mercilessly.","His fists slowly clenched.","No matter who stood behind them—","No matter how powerful their backers were—","The Bai Clan was simply too powerful.","Far more powerful than he had ever imagined.","Even with the Gu Master’s terrifying army of refined corpses supporting them, they still could not resist.","Even with Golden Immortal refined corpses—","They still could not reverse the situation.","The Shen Clan had believed that they had finally found someone capable of standing against the Bai Clan.","Instead, they had merely discovered how terrifying the Bai Clan truly was.","Shen Wuheng’s lips trembled.","\"If only...\"","His voice was barely audible.","\"If only I hadn’t...\"","If only he had not agreed to cooperate with those people.","If only he had not allowed greed and ambition to blind him.","If only he had not provoked the Bai Clan.","If only he had never touched Bai Xueqing.","Perhaps—","The Shen Clan would still exist peacefully.","Perhaps the clan would not be facing destruction today.","But what was the use of thinking about that now?","Shen Wuheng slowly closed his eyes.","There was no medicine for regret.","The moment he had chosen this path, there had already been no turning back.","The Gu Master’s face also gradually turned pale.","\"Damn it...\"","His fists slowly clenched.","He had completely underestimated the Bai Clan.","Originally, he had believed that the Shen Clan’s destruction would merely provide him with additional corpses.","He had never imagined that his own refined corpses would begin falling instead.","And now, the situation was becoming dangerous.","The Gu Master’s eyes flickered.","Unlike his junior brother, he had never been fond of personally fighting powerful opponents.","Yes!","He was a Golden Immortal.","However, that did not mean he enjoyed placing himself in danger.","His strength lay in controlling refined corpses.","Why fight personally when others could fight for him?","Why risk his own life when his corpses could die in his place?","His junior brother had been different.","That fool had been far too confident in his own strength.","And now, judging by everything that had happened, he was most likely dead.","The Gu Master had no intention of following the same path.","His gaze immediately landed on Bai Chu.","The moment their eyes met, his heart trembled.","Bai Chu still held the Saint Grade Sword.","The terrifying power of Fate Severing Slash was still fresh in his mind.","The Gu Master did not know how many times Bai Chu could use that technique.","Once?","Twice?","Perhaps more?","He had no intention of staying behind to find out.","The Gu Master’s expression gradually became cold.","\"This battle is no longer worth continuing.\"","That was not fleeing.","It was—","A strategic retreat.","Once he returned and reported what had happened, he could gather stronger forces.","Perhaps even obtain additional refined corpses.","At that time, the Bai Clan would pay the price.","The Gu Master’s figure slowly began moving backward.","He intended to leave without attracting too much attention.","However, Bai Chu’s eyes immediately narrowed.","He had been watching the Gu Master from the very beginning.","The moment the man attempted to retreat—","Bai Chu moved.","Whoosh!","His figure instantly disappeared.","The Gu Master’s expression changed drastically.","\"Damn it!\"","He immediately accelerated.","However, a sharp sword intent suddenly descended from above.","The Gu Master’s pupils contracted.","Without hesitation, he moved to the side.","Slash!","A terrifying sword light swept past him.","The ground behind him was instantly split apart.","Bai Chu appeared in the distance.","The Saint Grade Sword pointed directly toward him.","\"Trying to leave?\"","The Gu Master’s expression darkened.","\"I have no interest in fighting you today.\"","Bai Chu smiled faintly.","\"Unfortunately...\"","His grip tightened around the sword.","\"I do!\"","The Gu Master’s face became ugly.","He had no intention of personally fighting Bai Chu, especially not after witnessing Fate Severing Slash.","His eyes rapidly scanned the battlefield.","Then—","\"Come!\"","Whoosh!","The remaining two Golden Immortal refined corpses immediately reacted.","The one being held back by the five Earth Immortals suddenly abandoned its attempts to attack them.","Its body shot toward the Gu Master.","At the same time, the other Golden Immortal refined corpse also moved.","The five Bai Clan Earth Immortals immediately realized what was happening.","\"Stop it!\"","Boom!","Several attacks descended.","However, the Golden Immortal corpse completely ignored them.","It allowed the attacks to strike its body as it rushed toward its master.","Cracks appeared across its flesh, yet it did not slow down.","Within moments, it arrived beside the Gu Master.","The remaining Golden Immortal refined corpse also returned.","The Gu Master stood between them.","\"You two.\"","The two Golden Immortal refined corpses turned toward him.","Their bloodshot eyes remained completely emotionless.","\"Stop them!\"","The Bai Clan experts immediately understood.","The Gu Master was planning to sacrifice them.","The five Earth Immortals moved forward.","Bai Chu’s expression also became cold.","However, the Gu Master merely laughed.","\"Hahaha! You want to kill me?\"","He slowly retreated.","\"Then first deal with them.\"","He was planning to sacrifice his remaining Golden Immortal and other corpses as well to escape.","However, the Gu Master quickly suppressed his frustration.","A Golden Immortal refined corpse was valuable. But compared to his own life, it was nothing.","As long as he survived, he could always obtain more corpses.","Boom!","The two Golden Immortal refined corpses erupted with all their remaining strength.","The Bai Clan experts immediately responded.","Slash! Slash!","Meanwhile, the Gu Master turned around.","Without the slightest hesitation—","He fled!","He tore open the void and his figure transformed into a streak of light as he shot toward the horizon."]},{"number":704,"title":"Chapter 704: The Gu Master’s Escape","paragraphs":["The Bai Clan experts immediately wanted to pursue him.","However—","Boom!","The remaining Immortal refined corpses stood directly in their path.","They had already received their master’s final command.","Stop them!","And until that command was fulfilled, they would continue fighting.","The Bai Clan experts had no choice but to deal with them first.","Bai Tianheng’s expression was cold.","His eyes remained fixed on the distant streak of light disappearing beyond the horizon.","The Gu Master was still a Golden Immortal.","Right now, only Bai Chu was a match for him and he was in a fight with Golden Immortal Corpse.","To successfully pursue and capture him, the Bai Clan would need at least another Golden Immortal-level expert.","Alternatively, several Earth Immortals could work together to slow him down.","However, that was impossible at the moment.","The Bai Clan’s Earth Immortals were also occupied.","And the remaining Golden Immortal refined corpses were blocking their path.","By the time they dealt with them, the Gu Master would already be long gone.","Bai Tianheng slowly exhaled.","\"Forget him.\"","His voice echoed across the battlefield.","\"We’ll deal with these corpses first.\"","The Bai Clan experts immediately understood.","Although they had allowed the Gu Master to escape, his departure had changed the situation completely.","The moment their master disappeared, the refined corpses became far less threatening.","They were still powerful.","But without someone actively controlling and coordinating them, they were nothing more than brainless puppets.","Boom!","Bai Chu raised his Saint Grade Sword.","A terrifying sword light descended.","The Golden Immortal refined corpse blocking him immediately raised its arms.","BOOM!!!","The corpse was sent flying backward.","At the same time, the five Earth Immortals attacking the other Golden Immortal corpse increased the intensity of their attacks.","Without the Gu Master’s control, the corpse became even easier to predict.","It no longer received instructions.","It could only rely on its remaining instincts and its final command.","The five Bai Clan Earth Immortals immediately took advantage of that.","\"Attack!\"","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Several powerful techniques descended simultaneously.","The Golden Immortal corpse attempted to retaliate.","However, the five Earth Immortals continuously moved around it.","Without the Gu Master’s coordination, it became increasingly difficult for the corpse to deal with them.","Meanwhile, the other battlefields were already coming to an end.","The Earth Immortal refined corpses were gradually surrounded.","One after another, they were destroyed.","The Immortal Ascension Realm refined corpses lasted even less time.","Without proper commands and coordination, they were quickly overwhelmed.","And as the refined corpses fell, the Shen Clan’s expressions became increasingly desperate.","Their final backer had fled.","The terrifying Gu Master who had appeared with three Golden Immortal refined corpses had abandoned them without hesitation.","Their supposed savior had run away.","Shen Clan cultivators stared blankly at the battlefield.","Their hearts gradually sank.","The Bai Clan had been difficult enough to resist before.","Now, even the Gu Master’s refined corpse army had been defeated.","How could they possibly continue fighting?","Boom!","Another Earth Immortal refined corpse crashed to the ground.","Its body was covered in cracks.","Several Bai Clan experts immediately attacked.","BOOM!!!","The corpse was completely destroyed.","That final scene seemed to break the Shen Clan’s remaining courage.","One cultivator slowly lowered his weapon.","Then—","Clang!","His sword fell to the ground.","\"I-I surrender...\"","His voice was filled with despair.","Then another Shen Clan member dropped his weapon.","\"I surrender too!\"","\"I don’t want to die! Please spare me!\"","One after another, the Shen Clan cultivators began kneeling.","The Bai Clan experts remained alert. However, they did not immediately attack those who surrendered.","Seeing that those who surrendered were not killed, even more Shen Clan cultivators abandoned their weapons.","\"I-I also surrender!\"","\"Please spare my life!\"","\"We surrender!\"","Within moments, large numbers of Shen Clan cultivators had fallen to their knees.","Of course—","Not everyone was willing to surrender.","Some continued fighting desperately.","Some attempted to escape.","Others chose to make one final attack.","The Bai Clan showed them no mercy.","Boom! Slash!","One after another, the remaining cultivators who continued resisting were eliminated.","The Shen Clan had either surrendered or died.","Shen Wuheng stood in the middle of the ruined battlefield.","Around him were destroyed buildings.","Countless corpses.","Broken artifacts.","And kneeling Shen Clan cultivators.","His face was pale.","His expression was filled with despair.","The Shen Clan had lost.","There was no longer any possibility of turning the situation around.","Their powerful backer had fled.","The refined corpse army had been defeated.","And the Bai Clan still stood above them.","Shen Wuheng slowly looked toward Bai Chu.","The Saint Grade Sword remained in Bai Chu’s hand.","Even from a distance, Shen Wuheng could feel the terrifying pressure it emitted.","His body trembled slightly.","In the end—","He slowly lowered his head.","Then he stepped forward.","The surrounding Bai Clan cultivators immediately became alert.","However, Shen Wuheng did not attack.","Instead—","He slowly fell to his knees.","\"I surrender!\"","His voice was hoarse. The remaining Shen Clan cultivators stared at their Clan Leader.","Even Shen Wuheng had surrendered.","The Shen Clan was truly finished.","Shen Wuheng then immediately raised his head and looked toward Bai Tianheng.","\"Bai Tianheng!\"","Shen Wuheng hurriedly spoke.","\"I know what you want.\"","His voice carried a trace of desperation.","\"I can take you to where your daughter is.\"","The surrounding Bai Clan experts immediately turned their attention toward him. Shen Wuheng continued quickly.","\"I will lead you there immediately.\"","His fists clenched tightly.","\"I only ask that the Bai Clan show mercy.\"","At that moment, Shen Wuheng had completely abandoned any remaining dignity.","As long as he could survive, nothing else mattered.","However, just as he finished speaking—","\"No need!\"","The sudden voice echoed across the battlefield.","Shen Wuheng froze.","Everyone instinctively looked toward the source of the voice.","Then—","Rip!","The space above the ruined Shen Clan suddenly tore apart.","A massive spatial crack appeared.","Terrifying spatial fluctuations spread throughout the surroundings.","A figure slowly stepped out from the spatial crack.","Bai Zihan!","Behind him stood several familiar figures.","Bai Ren and others including the Gu Master, Bai Xueqing and Qinglan.","The moment Bai Tianheng saw the person standing beside them, his expression changed completely.","\"Xueqing’er!\"","His figure disappeared.","Whoosh!","In the next instant, Bai Tianheng appeared directly before Bai Xueqing.","His eyes rapidly scanned her from head to toe.","\"Are you hurt?\"","Bai Xueqing shook her head.","\"I’m fine, Father.\"","Bai Tianheng remained silent for several moments. Then he finally released a long breath.","Relief filled his eyes.","There were no signs that she had been harmed.","Bai Xueqing stood there completely unharmed.","Only then did Bai Tianheng’s tense heart finally relax.","Meanwhile, Shen Wuheng remained completely frozen.","It was as though someone had poured a bucket of ice-cold water over his head.","Bai Xueqing... was already here.","Looks like the Bai Clan had really known about her true location.","They had known about the Shen Clan’s plan from the very beginning.","Shen Wuheng’s body trembled slightly.","That meant the people guarding Bai Xueqing—","His eyes slowly widened.","Shen Liang!","His son had been there.","Along with the other Shen Clan experts.","If Bai Zihan had personally appeared here with Bai Xueqing, then there was only one possible explanation.","They were dead.","Shen Wuheng’s lips moved slightly yet no words came out.","For a brief moment, grief surged within his heart.","But his grief lasts for mere seconds because he doesn’t have time to worry about Shen Liang. His own fate was still unknown.","Shen Wuheng quickly raised his head.","His gaze landed directly on Bai Zihan.","The person who held the fate of the Shen Clan in his hands. Without hesitation, Shen Wuheng lowered his head.","\"Clan Leader Bai!\"","His voice was filled with desperation.","\"Please show mercy!\"","Shen Wuheng clenched his fists.","\"We had no choice!\"","His voice became increasingly desperate.","He suddenly turned and pointed toward the captured Gu Master.","\"They possessed terrifying strength!\"","Shen Wuheng hurriedly continued.","\"Golden Immortals! They could control Golden Immortal refined corpses! How could the Shen Clan possibly resist them?\"","His voice trembled.","\"They forced us to cooperate. We had no choice but to follow their commands!\"","Shen Wuheng looked toward Bai Zihan. His eyes were filled with pleading.","\"Clan Leader Bai, please understand! The Shen Clan never wanted to become your enemy!\"","\"We were forced into this situation!\"","Several Shen Clan cultivators immediately nodded.","\"That’s right!\"","\"We had no choice!\"","\"They were too powerful!\"","\"If we had refused them, they would have killed us!\"","Shen Wuheng quickly seized the opportunity.","\"We were simply trying to survive. We were controlled by forces far stronger than ourselves.\"","\"Please, Clan Leader Bai! Be magnanimous!\"","His voice echoed throughout the battlefield.","\"We have already paid a terrible price!\"","Shen Wuheng raised his head slightly.","His eyes swept across the ruined Shen Clan.","More than eighty percent of the Shen Clan had already been destroyed.","\"More than eighty percent of our clan is already gone!\"","Shen Wuheng’s voice became hoarse.","\"Please... Spare the remaining members.\"","\"We are willing to submit. We are willing to serve the Bai Clan. We only ask that you spare those who remain.\"","The surviving Shen Clan cultivators immediately lowered their heads.","\"Please spare us, Clan Leader Bai!\"","\"Please show mercy!\"","Their voices echoed throughout the ruined battlefield.","For a moment, Bai Zihan said nothing.","He merely looked at Shen Wuheng.","Then Bai Zihan slowly smiled.","Shen Wuheng’s eyes brightened slightly.","However, the next words immediately froze his expression.","\"What does that have to do with me?\"","Bai Zihan looked at him calmly.","\"You claim that you were forced. You claim that you had no choice. So what?\"","Shen Wuheng’s lips trembled.","\"Clan Leader Bai, I—\"","Bai Zihan interrupted him.","\"The moment the Shen Clan dared to move against the Bai Clan...\"","His voice echoed clearly throughout the battlefield.","\"...your fate was already decided.\"","Shen Wuheng’s pupils contracted.","\"Clan Leader Bai!\"","He immediately raised his head.","Panic filled his eyes.","\"P-Please!\"","Bai Zihan ignored him.","He slowly looked across the remaining Shen Clan cultivators.","Many were still kneeling.","Many were trembling.","Some were desperately looking at him.","Hoping.","Praying.","Begging for mercy.","However, Bai Zihan’s expression did not change.","\"Everyone.\"","The Bai Clan experts immediately turned toward him.","Bai Zihan’s eyes swept across the Shen Clan.","His voice was calm yet the moment his words fell—","The expressions of every Shen Clan cultivator changed.","\"Destroy them!\""]},{"number":705,"title":"Chapter 705: Shen Clans’ Destruction","paragraphs":["The surviving Shen Clan cultivators’ faces turned pale.","\"No! Wait!\"","\"We already surrendered!!!\"","Panic immediately spread through the crowd.","However, the Bai Clan experts had already moved.","Swish!","A Shen Clan elder attempted to flee.","A Bai Clan expert immediately appeared before him.","Slash!","Blood splattered through the air.","Another Shen Clan cultivator desperately raised his weapon.","\"I’ll fight you!\"","However—","BOOM!!!","His body was instantly blasted backward.","The entire battlefield descended into chaos once again.","The Shen Clan cultivators who had believed that surrender would save them finally realized the truth.","There would be no mercy.","The moment they had chosen to stand against the Bai Clan, their fate had already been sealed.","\"No!\"","Shen Wuheng stared at the scene before him.","His eyes gradually became bloodshot.","The remaining members of the Shen Clan were being slaughtered.","One after another.","His clan.","His people.","The foundation that the Shen Clan had built over countless years.","Everything was disappearing before his eyes.","Shen Wuheng’s body trembled violently.","He slowly raised his head. His gaze locked onto Bai Zihan.","The pleading in his eyes disappeared.","In its place—","Hatred!","\"Bai Zihan!\"","His voice suddenly echoed across the battlefield.","Shen Wuheng’s bloodshot eyes were fixed firmly on Bai Zihan.","His entire body trembled with rage.","Everything was gone.","His son was most likely dead.","The Shen Clan was being destroyed.","And now, even the remaining members who had surrendered were being slaughtered.","The foundation his ancestors had built over countless years was disappearing before his eyes.","How could he possibly accept that?","\"Die!\"","BOOM!!!","Shen Wuheng suddenly moved.","His Great Ascension Realm aura erupted without restraint.","The surrounding air exploded.","Several Bai Clan experts immediately reacted.","\"Stop him!\"","Powerful auras erupted as they prepared to intercept Shen Wuheng.","However, Bai Zihan calmly raised his hand.","\"There is no need.\"","The Bai Clan experts immediately stopped.","Shen Wuheng was already charging toward him.","His expression was completely distorted.","\"I’ll kill you!\"","A powerful artifact appeared in his hand.","Shen Wuheng poured all of his remaining Qi into it.","Buzz!","The artifact trembled violently.","A terrifying attack immediately descended toward Bai Zihan.","BOOM!!!","The ground beneath Bai Zihan shattered.","However, Bai Zihan did not move.","The attack arrived before him.","BOOM!!!","Bai Zihan was hit by the attack. However, it did not even scratch his clothes, much less injure him.","Before Shen Wuheng could react—","Bai Zihan appeared directly before him.","\"What?\"","Bang!","Bai Zihan’s fist struck Shen Wuheng directly in the stomach.","\"Ugh!\"","Shen Wuheng’s body bent forward.","The artifact in his hand nearly fell.","However, before he could regain his balance—","Bang!","A kick struck his chest.","BOOM!!!","Shen Wuheng was sent flying backward.","His body crashed through several ruined buildings.","Shen Wuheng was a Great Ascension Realm expert.","One of the strongest cultivators in the entire Desolate Heaven Empire. Yet before Bai Zihan, he looked completely helpless.","Shen Wuheng quickly pushed himself out of the rubble.","Blood flowed from the corner of his mouth.","His eyes were filled with disbelief.","He knew Bai Zihan was powerful.","Everyone knew that.","But—","How could the difference between them be so great when they were in the same cultivation realm?","Shen Wuheng gritted his teeth.","\"Again!\"","Boom!","He charged forward once more.","His artifact flashed.","Several powerful attacks descended simultaneously.","Bai Zihan merely smiled.","Then—","Whoosh!","His figure flickered.","The first attack missed.","The second missed.","Then the third.","Shen Wuheng attacked continuously.","However, he could not even touch Bai Zihan.","Bai Zihan moved calmly through the attacks.","Sometimes stepping to the side.","Sometimes leaning backward.","Sometimes disappearing and reappearing behind Shen Wuheng.","It was as though he was deliberately playing with him.","\"Too slow!\"","Shen Wuheng turned.","Bai Zihan was already behind him.","Bang!","A kick struck Shen Wuheng’s back.","\"Ugh!\"","His body stumbled forward.","Before he could turn—","Bang!","A fist struck his face.","Blood splattered through the air.","Bang!","Another punch landed on his chest.","Crack!","The sound of breaking bones echoed.","\"AHHH!\"","Shen Wuheng screamed.","His body was sent crashing into the ground.","BOOM!!!","A massive crater appeared.","Bai Zihan slowly descended.","Shen Wuheng struggled to stand.","His clothes were torn.","Blood covered his face.","Several bones had already been broken, yet he still glared at Bai Zihan with hatred.","\"Why...\"","His voice trembled.","\"Why are you so powerful?\"","Bai Zihan looked at him calmly.","\"You chose the wrong enemy.\"","Shen Wuheng’s expression froze.","For a moment, he finally understood.","There was no possibility of victory.","From the very beginning, there never had been. Despair gradually appeared once again in Shen Wuheng’s eyes.","He was going to die.","The Shen Clan was going to disappear.","Everything was over.","However, the despair in his eyes gradually transformed into madness.","Shen Wuheng suddenly began laughing.","\"Hahaha...\"","His laughter was hoarse.","Bai Zihan raised an eyebrow.","Shen Wuheng slowly raised his head.","Blood covered his face. Yet there was a sinister smile on his lips.","\"Bai Zihan...\"","His voice was weak.","However, it was filled with hatred.","\"Do you really think you’ve won?\"","Shen Wuheng laughed again.","\"You destroyed the Shen Clan. So what?\"","His eyes gradually became bloodshot.","\"The people you have offended are far more powerful than you can possibly imagine!\"","The surrounding Bai Clan experts frowned.","Shen Wuheng continued.","\"That person was only one of the weaker ones among them.\"","His voice became increasingly sinister.","\"There are people far stronger than him. People with powers you cannot even comprehend.\"","Bai Zihan’s eyes narrowed slightly.","Shen Wuheng laughed.","His voice echoed across the battlefield.","\"One day, the Bai Clan will also be destroyed!\"","His eyes were filled with madness.","\"Everything you have built will disappear. The same way the Shen Clan is disappearing today!\"","\"And when that day comes—\"","Shen Wuheng suddenly laughed wildly.","\"Hahaha!\"","Bai Zihan looked at him indifferently.","Shen Wuheng’s wild laughter gradually faded.","The battlefield around them continued to tremble.","Screams echoed in the distance.","One after another, the remaining Shen Clan cultivators continued to fall.","However, Shen Wuheng no longer seemed to care.","He had already accepted his fate.","He was going to die.","The Shen Clan was going to be destroyed.","Everything was over.","Then—","Bai Zihan suddenly spoke.","\"You know...\"","Shen Wuheng’s expression changed slightly.","Bai Zihan looked at him calmly.","\"Perhaps I can still spare you.\"","Silence!","Shen Wuheng froze.","For a moment, he thought he had misheard.","His bloodshot eyes slowly widened.","\"What?\"","Bai Zihan continued.","\"I said...\"","His voice remained calm.","\"Perhaps I can spare your life and your clan as well.\"","The madness in Shen Wuheng’s eyes suddenly disappeared.","Hope!","A tiny trace of hope suddenly appeared.","His body trembled.","\"R-Really?\"","His voice was almost a whisper.","The same man who had just been laughing wildly while waiting for death was suddenly looking at Bai Zihan with expectation.","Bai Zihan watched the change in his expression.","Then—","He smiled.","\"Haha... I was just kidding.\"","Shen Wuheng froze.","For a moment, Shen Wuheng’s mind went completely blank.","The hope that had just appeared in his eyes disappeared.","His expression slowly twisted.","\"Bai Zihan...\"","His voice trembled.","Then suddenly—","\"BAI ZIHAN!\"","BOOM!!!","Shen Wuheng’s furious roar echoed across the battlefield.","\"You are deliberately messing with me!\"","Bai Zihan merely smiled.","\"Yes!\"","That single word almost caused Shen Wuheng to spit out blood.","His body trembled violently.","His face alternated between red and pale.","He had already accepted death.","He had already prepared himself for the end.","Then Bai Zihan had suddenly given him hope.","Even if it had only lasted for a few moments, it had been enough.","Enough for him to imagine that he might survive.","Enough for him to wonder whether there was still a future.","Enough for him to instinctively cling to life once again.","And then—","Bai Zihan had taken it all away.","Shen Wuheng stared at him.","His eyes were filled with hatred.","\"You...\"","He could barely speak.","Bai Zihan looked at him with an amused expression.","\"What’s wrong?\"","Shen Wuheng clenched his fists.","His nails dug deeply into his palms.","\"You bastard!\"","Bai Zihan’s smile widened slightly.","That was precisely the point.","If he had killed Shen Wuheng immediately after the man had accepted his death, what would have been the fun in that?","Death itself was simple and quick.","Shen Wuheng had already prepared himself for it.","He had already accepted that the Shen Clan was finished.","But hope—","Hope was different.","Give someone who had accepted death a reason to live.","Let them believe that there might still be a chance.","Then take that chance away.","That was far more devastating.","It was like giving a dying man a cup of water—","Allowing him to see it.","Allowing him to believe that he could drink it.","Only to pull it away at the very last moment.","Shen Wuheng had finally accepted death.","Then Bai Zihan’s words had pulled him back from that despair.","For a brief moment, hope had returned.","And when that hope was destroyed, the despair became even greater than before.","Shen Wuheng’s body slowly collapsed to his knees.","His breathing became heavy.","His eyes were unfocused.","He had thought that he was ready to die.","But after Bai Zihan had given him hope—","Even for just a moment—","He suddenly realized that he did not want to die.","That was the cruelest part.","Bai Zihan slowly stepped closer.","Shen Wuheng looked up at him.","His face was pale.","Bai Zihan looked down at him.","\"Now...\"","His voice was calm.","\"Are you ready to die?\"","Shen Wuheng’s body trembled violently.","\"I-I...\"","Before he could finish—","Slash!","A cold sword light flashed.","Shen Wuheng’s body froze as his head fell to the ground.","Bai Zihan calmly withdrew his sword.","He had only asked.","He wasn’t interested in the answer either way."]},{"number":706,"title":"Chapter 706: The Hidden Threat of the Central Continent","paragraphs":["The Shen Clan’s destruction soon reached its final stage.","Almost every cultivator who had participated in the battle against the Bai Clan was killed.","As long as they had taken up arms against the Bai Clan—","As long as they had chosen to participate in the fight—","They were shown no mercy.","One after another, the remaining Shen Clan cultivators fell.","When the dust finally settled, none of them remained standing.","The battle continued for several more minutes.","Then—","Silence.","The Shen Clan, once one of the most powerful forces in the Desolate Heaven Empire, had completely fallen.","The enormous Shen Clan estate had become nothing more than ruins.","The Shen Clan was finished.","From this day onward, the Shen Clan would become nothing more than a name from the past.","Meanwhile, a groan suddenly echoed from within the ruins.","The Gu Master’s eyelids slowly moved.","Then—","His eyes opened.","For a moment, his expression was blank.","His mind had not yet fully recovered.","Then the memories came rushing back.","Pain.","Terrifying pain.","The kind of pain that had made him wish for death.","The Gu Master’s body immediately trembled.","His eyes widened.","He instinctively tried to move.","However, the moment he did, he discovered that his cultivation had been sealed.","His expression instantly changed.","He quickly looked around.","\"This place...\"","His pupils contracted.","He recognized it.","The Shen Clan!","But...","Everything had changed.","The magnificent buildings were gone.","The halls had collapsed.","The ground was covered in enormous craters.","Everywhere he looked, there was nothing but destruction and death.","The Gu Master’s heart sank.","Then he suddenly thought of someone.","His senior brother.","And the refined corpse army.","\"No...\"","The Gu Master’s face turned pale.","His senior brother was powerful.","He controlled several terrifying refined corpses.","Golden Immortal refined corpses.","Earth Immortal refined corpses.","Such a force should have been more than enough to deal with the Bai Clan.","There was no way—","He refused to believe it.","He refused to believe that his senior brother and the refined corpse army could have lost to the Bai Clan.","Then—","\"Oh, you’re awake!\"","The Gu Master’s body froze.","A familiar voice entered his ears.","He slowly turned his head.","Bai Zihan was standing not far away.","A grin had already appeared on his face.","The moment the Gu Master saw him, his heart trembled.","Bai Zihan slowly walked toward him.","\"Then...\"","He stopped in front of the Gu Master.","\"Are you ready to tell me what you know?\"","The Gu Master’s lips trembled.","His eyes instinctively swept across the ruined surroundings once more.","The Shen Clan was gone.","And judging from Bai Zihan’s expression, his senior brother’s plan had also failed.","The realization caused his heart to sink completely.","There was no one left to rely on.","No one was coming to save him.","And worse, he remembered exactly what Bai Ren had done to him before.","The pain!","The desperate feeling of wanting everything to end.","The Gu Master’s face immediately turned pale.","\"No!\"","He hurriedly shook his head.","\"I-I’ll talk!\"","Bai Zihan raised an eyebrow.","The Gu Master swallowed hard.","\"I’ll tell you everything I know!\"","His voice trembled.","\"Just... don’t do that again.\"","Bai Zihan’s grin widened.","\"Good!\"","The Gu Master lowered his head.","At that moment, he had completely given up any thought of resistance.","Meanwhile, Bai Zihan’s expression gradually became thoughtful.","He had already learned one thing about the cultivation world.","When you defeated one enemy—","Another, more powerful one might appear.","Bai Zihan had already ruined the plans of this so-called Lord.","There was no way that the other party would simply let the matter end here.","Sooner or later, they would send someone else.","Perhaps they would send someone more powerful.","Or perhaps the Lord himself might eventually come.","If that happened, Bai Zihan needed to be prepared.","And the best way to prepare was simple.","Know your enemy.","Bai Zihan looked at the Gu Master.","\"Tell me about your organization and where it is.\"","The Gu Master hesitated briefly.","However, when he saw Bai Zihan’s expression, he immediately answered.","\"We are from the Central Continent and we are all Gu Masters. However, we do not have a fixed headquarters.\"","\"We are scattered throughout the Central Continent. Most of us remain hidden.\"","Bai Zihan’s eyes flickered.","Hidden?","He did not even need to ask why.","The moment he heard those words, Bai Zihan instinctively thought of Feilian’s previous reaction.","The Gu Masters were most likely being hunted even today.","And considering the sinister methods they used—","Refining living cultivators into corpses.","Using Gu insects and blood techniques.","It was not difficult to understand why.","\"Why were you here?\"","The Gu Master’s body stiffened.","\"Do you want to experience that pain again?\"","The Gu Master’s face instantly turned pale.","\"No!\"","He immediately shook his head.","\"I’ll answer!\"","The Gu Master took a deep breath.","Then he slowly lowered his head.","\"Our mission...\"","His voice became quieter.","\"Was to bring the Heavenly Physique back to the Lord.\"","Bai Zihan’s expression changed slightly.","\"The Heavenly Physique?\"","Bai Zihan’s eyes narrowed.","He immediately understood who the Gu Master was referring to.","Bai Xueqing and Jin Yuelin.","One possessed the Heavenly Ice Body, while the other possessed the Heavenly Poison Body.","No wonder they had kidnapped Bai Xueqing and demanded Jin Yuelin.","They wanted both.","The Gu Master nodded.","\"Yes! The Lord told us that the Desolate Heaven Empire has Heavenly Physique and that the Bai Clan has two of them.\"","\"How did The Lord know?\"","Bai Zihan asked.","\"I-I don’t know.\"","Bai Zihan didn’t expect the boss to explain that to their servant.","\"Why?\"","The Gu Master shook his head.","\"I don’t know.\"","Bai Zihan frowned.","The Gu Master quickly continued.","\"I am telling the truth. The Lord personally gave us the order.\"","\"Our task was only to bring the Heavenly Physiques back alive. As for what the Lord wants with them...\"","His voice became hesitant.","\"I don’t know.\"","Bai Zihan stared at him silently.","The Gu Master immediately lowered his head.","\"I truly don’t know.\"","Looking at him, Bai Zihan could tell that the Gu Master did not appear to be lying.","Bai Zihan’s gaze became colder.","\"Then tell me.\"","His eyes narrowed.","\"Who exactly is this Lord?\"","The Gu Master’s body stiffened.","A trace of hesitation appeared on his face.","\"I-I don’t know...\"","Bai Zihan’s expression changed.","\"I don’t know everything, but I will tell you everything I know!\"","Bai Zihan looked at him silently.","The Gu Master swallowed hard.","\"The Lord...\"","His voice became cautious.","\"He is the leader of our organization. The leader of all the Gu Masters to be exact.\"","The Gu Master’s expression became complicated.","\"None of us know exactly how powerful the Lord truly is or who exactly he is.\"","His voice lowered.","\"But...\"","A trace of fear appeared in his eyes.","\"I once saw him casually kill a Supreme Immortal.\"","Bai Zihan’s expression changed.","To be able to kill a Supreme Immortal—and to be a Gu Master himself—one could only imagine just how powerful he must be.","The Gu Master continued.","\"The Supreme Immortal tried to resist, but the Lord killed him effortlessly. And afterward...\"","His body trembled slightly.","\"He refined the Supreme Immortal’s corpse.\"","If the Lord truly possessed the ability to kill Supreme Immortals and refine their corpses, then the situation was far more dangerous than Bai Zihan had initially imagined.","Bai Zihan could not help but picture it.","A single Supreme Immortal refined corpse was already terrifying.","What if there were several?","Or even an entire army?","If the Lord truly possessed such a force, how could the Bai Clan possibly resist?","Forget the Bai Clan.","Even if the entire Eastern Continent united—","Perhaps even the entire Central Glorious Continent united—","They would still be doomed against such an enemy.","Bai Zihan slowly narrowed his eyes.","However, after thinking about it carefully, he gradually calmed down.","The Lord was undoubtedly powerful.","But—","Why was he hiding?","If he truly possessed absolute strength, there would be no reason for him to remain hidden within the Central Glorious Continent.","Perhaps the Central Glorious Continent possessed powerful cultivators who could kill him.","If the Lord openly revealed himself and began refining powerful cultivators into corpses, those supreme experts would not simply stand by and watch.","They would hunt him down.","That was likely the reason the Gu Masters remained hidden.","The Lord was powerful. But he was not invincible.","At least—","Not yet.","Bai Zihan’s gaze flickered.","The real problem was the Heavenly Physiques he wanted to obtain.","Once the Lord obtained them, everything could change.","A single Heavenly Physique was already enough to produce a genius capable of standing at the peak of the cultivation world.","And the Lord was searching for more than one.","Bai Xueqing.","Jin Yuelin.","Perhaps there were others.","What exactly was he planning to do with them?","Bai Zihan did not know.","But one thing was certain.","If the Lord truly succeeded in obtaining several Heavenly Physiques, the strength he gained afterward could be unimaginable.","Perhaps he could reach the Immortal Emperor Realm.","Or perhaps even surpass it!"]},{"number":707,"title":"Chapter 707: The Reward That Came at the Right Time","paragraphs":["Bai Zihan continued questioning the Gu Master.","However, after asking several more questions, he quickly realized that there was nothing else important the man knew.","The Gu Master was merely a low-ranking member of the organization.","He knew very little about the Lord or the organization’s deeper secrets.","For now, Bai Zihan decided to spare his life.","After all, he was still interested in learning more about the Gu Masters and their methods.","The Gu Master himself could serve as a useful source of information.","By this point, the Bai Clan had also finished collecting the Shen Clan’s treasures.","Whether they were artifacts possessed by the Shen Clan cultivators or the resources stored within their treasury, everything had been taken.","Not a single valuable item was left behind.","The Shen Clan was certainly wealthy.","However, compared to the Bai Clan’s enormous wealth, the treasures they had obtained from the Shen Clan were barely noticeable.","It could only be considered a small addition to the Bai Clan’s already massive treasury.","After everything was settled, Bai Zihan looked across the ruined Shen Clan estate.","They had already achieved their objective.","There was no reason to remain here any longer.","\"Let’s return to the clan.\"","Bai Zihan’s voice echoed across the battlefield.","The Bai Clan experts immediately nodded.","\"Yes, Clan Leader!\"","With that, the Bai Clan began preparing to leave.","The battle was over.","The Shen Clan had been destroyed.","Bai Xueqing had been rescued.","It was time to return to the Bai Clan.","Bai Zihan’s attention gradually shifted toward the System.","Now that Bai Xueqing had been rescued, the mission should have been completed.","And naturally, the corresponding reward should have already been issued.","However, the reward itself was not what Bai Zihan was most curious about.","There was something else he wanted to know.","\"Hey, System.\"","Bai Zihan silently called out.","\"You can hear me, right?\"","As always—","Silence!","The System remained completely quiet.","Bai Zihan frowned.","Until now, he had always regarded the System as nothing more than a mysterious machine.","It provided him with rewards for completing certain achievements.","It allowed him to purchase various items through the System Store.","Apart from that, it had never shown any obvious signs of intelligence.","But obviously it wasn’t.","Previously, it actively helped resist Qin Lingxiao’s charm.","Now, the System suddenly issued the urgent mission to rescue Bai Xueqing, and it had also provided him with her exact location.","That alone was enough to make Bai Zihan suspicious.","How could a simple system know where Bai Xueqing was?","And more importantly, why had it issued such an urgent mission?","It had actively pushed him to save Bai Xueqing.","That meant the System knew everything that was happening around the world or at least around him.","It definitely possessed some kind of consciousness.","Bai Zihan had thought about these questions many times.","But he had never been able to come up with a satisfactory answer.","Now that everything had finally settled down, he decided to question the System directly.","\"System!\"","Bai Zihan tried again.","\"You should be able to hear me.\"","Silence!","\"...\"","Bai Zihan’s expression darkened.","\"Don’t pretend you can’t hear me.\"","Still nothing.","Bai Zihan narrowed his eyes.","\"Come on. At least give me some kind of response.\"","Silence!","Bai Zihan’s mouth twitched.","\"Are you pretending to be deaf again?\"","Still nothing.","\"Could it be that you’re just a useless piece of machinery?\"","Silence!","Bai Zihan’s expression gradually became strange.","He had tried reasoning with it.","He had tried questioning it.","He had even tried deliberately provoking it.","Nothing worked.","\"System, you bastard. I know you’re listening. At least explain yourself!\"","Complete silence!","After a long while, Bai Zihan finally gave up.","He had tried everything he could think of.","Even deliberately insulting the System and trying to anger it had failed.","You can never wake up a person who is pretending to be asleep.","Bai Zihan could only sigh.","\"Forget it. For now, I can’t do anything about you anyway.\"","He shook his head.","\"I’ll just look at the rewards.\"","With that, Bai Zihan shifted his attention toward the System’s reward section.","The moment he opened it, numerous rewards appeared before him.","There were quite a few.","The first was naturally the urgent mission the System had issued earlier.","Then there were rewards for defeating the Gu Master and destroying the Shen Clan.","There were also several rewards for killing Shen Clan cultivators. However, those were merely minor achievements.","Most of them only rewarded him with System Points.","Now, even if he kills Immortal Ascension or Immortal Earth, only 1000 System points or so is given.","Looking at his remaining 10,000 System Points he felt quite sad. No matter how much he earned, those System Points always dried up as quickly as they came.","Bai Zihan quickly skimmed through them.","\"The rewards for defeating the Gu Master and destroying the Shen Clan are similar.\"","The rewards included a 100x Cultivation Speed Cards and Martial Enlightenment Cards.","Both were extremely useful.","The 100x Cultivation Speed Card could greatly accelerate his cultivation.","The Martial Enlightenment Cards could help him comprehend martial techniques at an astonishing speed.","However, compared to what Bai Zihan had expected from what could be major achievements, they were not particularly extraordinary.","\"Still, not bad.\"","Bai Zihan’s gaze finally landed on the reward for the first mission.","His eyes immediately brightened.","\"Now let’s hope that there is something good there.\"","[Congratulations, Host, on successfully saving Bai Xueqing!]","[Reward: Martial Art Upgrade Card x1]","The reward was a Martial Art Upgrade Card.","As its name suggested, it could directly upgrade a martial technique by one grade.","However, there was one restriction. It could only be used on martial techniques below Saint Grade.","Bai Zihan immediately gave the System a thumbs-up.","\"Not bad, System.\"","This reward was far more valuable than the others.","After all, he had been thinking about upgrading his Nine Shadows Flowing Light Sword for quite some time.","The Nine Shadows Flowing Light Sword was a Heaven Grade technique.","It had served him extremely well. But as his strength continued to increase, its limitations were gradually becoming apparent.","The shadows were easily destroyed and the speed boost from the technique was inferior to other Heaven Grade which solely focuses on speed.","Normally, he would have to spend a huge number of System Points to purchase a powerful Saint Grade martial technique from the System Store.","Then he would have to spend considerable time practicing and comprehending an entirely new technique.","Considering just how difficult it was to master Fate Severing Slash, Bai Zihan knew that other Saint-Grade Techniques would equally be extremely troublesome.","But with this Martial Art Upgrade Card, there was no need for any of that.","He could directly upgrade the Nine Shadows Flowing Light Sword by one grade.","From Heaven Grade—","To Saint Grade!","And no matter how difficult it is to comprehend Saint-Grade technique, if it was still similar to Nine Shadows Flowing Light Sword—","Considering his mastery over Nine Shadows Flowing Light Sword, it shouldn’t be difficult to grasp the essence and master it.","Bai Zihan’s eyes flickered with anticipation.","\"This reward came at exactly the right time.\"","Bai Zihan was still grinning as he thought about when to use the Martial Art Upgrade Card.","At that moment, Bai Xueqing quietly walked over.","She stood beside him for a moment without saying anything.","Her expression seemed somewhat hesitant. There was even a faint blush on her face.","Bai Zihan noticed her reaction and raised an eyebrow.","Then—","\"Brother!\"","His ears immediately perked up.","He turned toward her in surprise.","He couldn’t remember the last time Bai Xueqing had called him brother.","Considering their relationship, it was already quite good that they had not become enemies.","Yet now, she had actually taken the initiative to call him brother.","Bai Zihan’s eyes flickered with amusement.","\"Oh, my dear sister.\"","He smiled.","\"What is it?\"","Since he was in a good mood after receiving the reward, he decided to humor her a little.","Bai Xueqing bit her lips. The blush on her face became even more obvious.","For a moment, she looked somewhat embarrassed.","If not for their relationship as siblings, anyone seeing her expression might have thought she was about to confess her feelings.","Bai Zihan couldn’t help but find her reaction amusing.","After gathering her courage, Bai Xueqing finally spoke.","\"T-Thank you!\"","Bai Zihan blinked.","\"Thank you for saving me.\"","Her voice was quiet.","Bai Zihan stared at her for a moment before suddenly smiling.","\"That’s it?\"","Bai Xueqing looked at him.","\"All that hesitation just to thank me?\"","Her face became slightly redder.","Bai Zihan chuckled.","\"I thought you were going to say something important.\"","Bai Xueqing immediately glared at him.","\"Fine, fine. I accept your thanks.\"","Bai Xueqing bit her lips again.","She clearly wanted to say something more, but after seeing his amused expression, she finally gave up.","\"Forget it. I don’t want to argue with you today.\"","She turned around and walked away.","After taking a few steps, she quietly added—","\"Since you saved me this time, I’ll let you have the last word.\""]},{"number":708,"title":"Chapter 708: Shadowless Step!","paragraphs":["After several hours of travel, the familiar territory of the Bai Clan finally appeared in the distance.","The moment they landed—","\"Xueqing!\"","A familiar figure immediately rushed toward them.","Chu Ziyan’s face was filled with both relief and worry.","The moment she saw Bai Xueqing standing there, she immediately ran over and hugged her best friend tightly.","\"Xueqing, you scared me! I was so worried about you!\"","Bai Xueqing smiled helplessly and gently patted her back.","\"I’m fine, Ziyan.\"","Chu Ziyan finally relaxed after confirming that Bai Xueqing was truly unharmed.","Only then did she release her.","\"What happened?\"","...","Meanwhile, Bai Zihan’s gaze shifted toward the figure standing nearby.","Chu Xing!","His father-in-law.","Bai Zihan walked over.","\"Uncle Chu!\"","Chu Xing nodded.","Bai Zihan looked at him.","\"Did you take care of the matter I assigned to you?\"","A faint smile appeared on Chu Xing’s face.","\"It’s already done!\"","Bai Zihan nodded.","The destruction of the Shen Clan had never been the only matter that needed to be dealt with.","The Shen Clan also had several allies and accomplices.","Some had allied with them because they feared the Bai Clan’s retaliation.","Others had been persuaded by the Gu Master and had chosen to support the Shen Clan after being promised benefits or protection.","Regardless of their reasons, they had still chosen to stand against the Bai Clan.","Leaving them alone would only create trouble in the future.","And they might have even come to help the Shen Clan.","Therefore, Bai Zihan had already made arrangements before leaving.","Chu Xing, together with the Chu Clan and the other allied forces, had dealt with those factions.","Bai Zihan nodded with satisfaction.","Chu Xing smiled.","\"They were not particularly difficult to deal with in the first place.\"","Their forces were already much more powerful than those factions. Not to mention, the Bai Clan had also rewarded their loyal allies with pills from the Mu Clan.","Now, their strength, especially that of the Chu Clan, had increased by several times.","The current Chu Clan might even be comparable to the Li Clan or Zhao Clan.","With the Shen Clan and its allies dealt with, the Bai Clan’s immediate troubles had finally been resolved.","Now it was time to prepare for much tougher foes!","The moment the Bai Clan returned, the entire clan immediately became busy.","The destruction of the Shen Clan had been a major event.","There were countless matters that needed to be dealt with.","Now that the Shen Clan and its allies had been destroyed, it was time to shallow their businesses and whatever territory and resources they possessed.","Normally, for an event as big as eliminating one of the Top 10 forces of the Desolate Heaven Empire, one would have to give a reasonable explanation to the Emperor.","But considering it was the Bai Clan who had done this, there was no one who thought that the current Empress would go against them.","Other clans also wouldn’t demand that the current Bai Clan be condemned.","If one did, they could only imagine the consequences.","Not to mention, with the Heaven Sword Sect backing them and hard evidence of the Shen Clan kidnapping Bai Xueqing and provoking the Bai Clan in the first place, not many would think it was unjustifiable.","With King Zhanhong and his subordinates spreading the rumors, it was even more impossible for the Bai Clan to bear any blame.","The only one getting blamed and accused was the Shen Clan.","And with them destroyed, who would be foolish enough to go against the Bai Clan.","Bai Zihan looked toward the clan members around him.","\"Handle the aftermath.\"","His voice was calm.","\"Count our losses, organize the resources we obtained from the Shen Clan, and deal with the matters concerning the destroyed clans.\"","The Bai Clan members immediately nodded.","\"Yes, Clan Leader!\"","Bai Zihan did not say anything else.","\"There is something important I need to deal with.\"","With that, he turned around and headed toward his residence.","He had been thinking about one thing throughout the journey back.","The Martial Art Upgrade Card!","Now that he had finally returned, it was time to use it.","Back inside his residence, Bai Zihan immediately entered his cultivation chamber.","After ensuring that no one would disturb him, he sat down.","\"System.\"","A familiar interface appeared before him.","Bai Zihan’s gaze immediately landed on the Martial Art Upgrade Card.","Without hesitation, he selected it.","\"Use!\"","The moment his command fell—","Buzz!","The Martial Art Upgrade Card suddenly transformed into a stream of mysterious energy.","The energy entered Bai Zihan’s mind.","Boom!","His consciousness trembled.","In an instant, countless insights about the Nine Shadows Flowing Light Sword emerged within his mind.","The technique he had cultivated for so long began changing.","Its fundamental principles remained the same. However, its essence was completely different.","Bai Zihan’s eyes gradually widened.","\"Interesting...\"","The original Nine Shadows Flowing Light Sword focused on creating nine shadows.","Quantity.","Speed.","Confusion.","Those had always been the core principles of the technique.","However, the upgraded version completely abandoned the concept of creating shadows.","There was no deception.","No illusions.","No attempt to confuse the opponent with multiple figures.","Instead, Bai Zihan’s understanding of the technique underwent a fundamental transformation.","It focused on one thing alone.","Pure speed!","The nine shadows that once existed within the technique gradually disappeared from Bai Zihan’s understanding.","The Nine Shadows Flowing Light Sword had already possessed terrifying speed.","The Nine Shadows Flowing Light Sword had once relied on creating multiple shadows to confuse an opponent while attacking from different directions.","But the upgraded technique no longer needed such tricks.","It would simply make the user’s speed so terrifying that even the naked eye could no longer follow their movements.","Rather than creating nine shadows—","The user themselves would become a fleeting shadow.","One moment they could be standing directly in front of their opponent.","The next, they would already be behind them.","And before the opponent could even react, they could appear somewhere else entirely.","There was no need for illusions.","No need for deception.","The speed itself became a deception.","Once used, the user could move through the battlefield like a fleeting shadow.","Come and Go as one pleases.","An opponent might clearly see Bai Zihan rushing toward them, only to discover that he had already passed through their defensive range.","They might turn around to attack him, only to find empty air.","By the time they realized where Bai Zihan had gone, he would have already appeared somewhere else.","The technique did not create nine shadows.","Instead, every movement was so fast that it naturally left behind the illusion of a shadow.","Bai Zihan slowly clenched his fist.","\"This is much better technique, at least in terms of speed.\"","Bai Zihan slowly stood up.","A faint spatial fluctuation suddenly spread from beneath his feet.","Whoosh!","His figure vanished.","A moment later, he appeared several meters away.","Then vanished again.","Whoosh!","This time, he appeared behind the opposite wall.","Another instant passed. His figure flashed across the cultivation chamber.","Left.","Right.","Above.","Behind.","Every movement was so fast that even the faintest afterimage disappeared almost immediately.","Bai Zihan’s eyes shone with excitement.","He looked at the place where he had been standing moments ago.","A faint smile appeared on his face.","\"Then I’ll call it...\"","He paused briefly.","\"Shadowless Step!\"","Bai Zihan smiled.","\"Come and go like a fleeting shadow...\"","He looked toward the empty space before him.","\"No one can catch me.\"","There was only speed.","With this technique, Bai Zihan could freely enter and leave the battlefield.","He could approach an enemy before they could react.","Retreat before they could counterattack.","Appear from any direction.","And disappear before the opponent could even determine his location.","Most importantly, if he encounters an enemy he can’t defeat, he can run away.","Bai Zihan used the technique a couple more times and he found it as easy as breathing.","Because it had evolved from the Nine Shadows Flowing Light Sword, using it was not particularly difficult.","But Bai Zihan knew very well, he had only begun to touch its true potential.","As his comprehension deepened and his cultivation continued to rise, the speed of the Shadowless Step would become increasingly terrifying.","One day, he might truly become like a fleeting shadow.","Coming and going without a trace.","Uncatchable.","Untouchable.","\"System!\"","*************************","[ Host Info ]","Host: Bai Zihan","Age: 20","Cultivation Realm: Great Ascension (Late)","Constitution: Primordial Chaos Body","Supreme Dao Bone","Martial Arts:","Shadowless Step (Minor Mastery)","Eternal Flowing Water Sword (Greater Mastery)","Fate Severing Slash (Greater Mastery)","Heaven’s Mandate Reversal (Minor Mastery)","*************************","The Nine Shadows Flowing Light Sword (Major Mastery) on the info panel had been replaced by the Shadowless Step, and its mastery was already at Minor Mastery.","That meant he could already start using this technique in battle, though he still needed more practice to fully unleash its potential.","\"Now then, shall I train for a bit!\""]},{"number":709,"title":"Chapter 709: An Opportunity Amidst Chaos","paragraphs":["The news of the Shen Clan’s destruction spread far and wide.","Yet surprisingly—","It did not cause as much of a commotion as one might have expected.","The Shen Clan had been one of the Top Ten Forces of the Desolate Heaven Empire.","The destruction of such a powerful faction should have shaken the entire empire.","Under normal circumstances, countless forces would have discussed the matter.","There would have been outrage.","Fear!","Speculation!","Some might have even accused the Bai Clan of acting too ruthlessly.","However, none of that happened.","Or rather, even if there were people dissatisfied with the Bai Clan, they did not dare to openly express their opinions.","The reason was simple.","The current Bai Clan was no longer the same Bai Clan it had once been.","Not long ago, the Bai Clan had faced the combined forces of four powerful empires.","And they had won.","Therefore, when people heard that the Bai Clan had destroyed the Shen Clan—","Most people merely had one thought.","The Shen Clan was simply unlucky.","Of course, after learning the actual reason behind the conflict, the reactions of many people became even stranger.","The Shen Clan had kidnapped Bai Xueqing.","When this information spread, many people were left speechless.","\"Are they insane?\"","This was the reaction of countless cultivators.","The Shen Clan had actually kidnapped the sister of the Bai Clan Leader.","At that point, no one even knew what to say.","They could only conclude that the Shen Clan had sought its own death.","Many people could only shake their heads.","\"If the Shen Clan was so eager to die, what could anyone possibly say?\"","No one could defend them.","Even those forces that had always wished for the Bai Clan’s downfall could only remain silent.","What could they do?","The Li Clan and Zhao Clan had already submitted to the Bai Clan.","The Imperial Family had shown no intention of condemning the Bai Clan.","Who would dare to seek justice for the Shen Clan?","And more importantly—","Why would they?","The Shen Clan had provoked the Bai Clan first.","There was even evidence that they had kidnapped Bai Xueqing.","From the perspective of most cultivators, the Shen Clan had simply brought disaster upon themselves.","As a result, instead of discussing whether the Bai Clan should be punished, the attention of countless forces quickly shifted elsewhere.","The Shen Clan’s resources.","The Shen Clan had existed for countless years.","Over that time, they had accumulated an enormous amount of wealth and resources.","Businesses.","Mines.","Territories.","Trading routes.","Auction houses.","And countless other properties.","Although the Bai Clan had moved extremely quickly and seized the majority of the Shen Clan’s assets—","They could not possibly take everything.","After all, the Shen Clan possessed far too many businesses and resources spread throughout the Desolate Heaven Empire.","There were simply too many things to manage.","Naturally, countless forces began moving.","Some wanted to seize the Shen Clan’s former territories.","Others wanted to take over its businesses.","The competition quickly became intense.","However, everyone understood one thing.","They could compete for whatever the Bai Clan did not take.","But no one dared to touch what the Bai Clan had claimed.","That was an unspoken rule.","No one was foolish enough to provoke the Bai Clan over a few resources.","Thus, the various forces of the Desolate Heaven Empire quickly came to a silent understanding.","The Bai Clan could eat the meat.","As long as they were allowed to drink some soup, they would already be satisfied.","And fortunately for them, there was still plenty of soup left behind.","Although the Bai Clan had taken the most valuable resources and major businesses, they had no interest in personally managing every single business once controlled by the Shen Clan.","Nor did they have enough manpower to immediately take control of everything.","As a result, many of the Shen Clan’s smaller businesses and resources quickly fell into the hands of other factions.","For many forces, the destruction of the Shen Clan was not a disaster.","It was an opportunity.","***","And while countless forces throughout the Desolate Heaven Empire competed over the resources left behind by the Shen Clan—","Bai Zihan remained completely focused on his cultivation.","Inside his cultivation chamber, Bai Zihan sat cross-legged.","The Qi surrounding him surged continuously.","Since returning to the Bai Clan, Bai Zihan had devoted himself entirely to cultivation.","And this time, he was not holding back.","The 100x Cultivation Speed Card had already been activated.","Bai Zihan had also used the Martial Art Enlightenment Card.","Under the effects of the two System items, Bai Zihan’s strength increased day by day.","Bai Zihan remained inside his cultivation chamber.","Time quietly passed.","Then—","Boom!","A terrifying wave of Qi suddenly erupted from Bai Zihan’s cultivation chamber.","The Qi throughout the surrounding area violently trembled.","Inside the chamber, Bai Zihan slowly opened his eyes.","A profound light flashed within them.","\"Finally...\"","Bai Zihan slowly exhaled.","His cultivation had reached its limit within his current realm.","Rumble!","A thunderous roar suddenly echoed throughout the sky.","The entire Bai Clan trembled.","Everyone instinctively raised their heads.","Dark clouds had begun gathering above the Bai Clan.","The originally clear sky rapidly darkened.","Thick tribulation clouds continuously gathered.","They spread farther and farther.","A terrifying pressure descended from the heavens.","\"Heavenly Tribulation!\"","The Bai Clan members quickly understood what was happening.","Someone was about to break through.","Someone within the Bai Clan had reached the point of becoming an Immortal Cultivator.","Normally, such a sight would have caused an enormous commotion.","However, among the current members of the Bai Clan, it was not particularly rare.","The Bai Clan had grown rapidly during the past few years.","With their powerful cultivation techniques, abundant resources, and pills provided by the Mu Clan—","More and more cultivators had reached the peak of the Great Ascension Realm.","Almost every week or so, someone within the Bai Clan would attempt to cross the final barrier and become an Immortal Cultivator.","Therefore, the appearance of a Heavenly Tribulation was no longer something particularly unfamiliar or rare.","Yet—","This time was different.","The moment the tribulation clouds appeared, countless people within the Bai Clan immediately noticed something unusual.","The tribulation clouds were enormous.","Far larger than normal.","In fact, they were at least three times larger than the Heavenly Tribulations they had witnessed before.","The dark clouds covered a vast portion of the sky.","Lightning continuously flashed within them.","Each bolt contained a terrifying destructive aura.","The pressure descending from the heavens also felt much heavier than usual.","Many Bai Clan members unconsciously frowned.","\"This Heavenly Tribulation...\"","An elder who had already reached the Immortal Ascension Realm looked toward the sky.","His expression gradually became serious.","\"Isn’t it too powerful?\"","Another person nodded.","\"It is definitely more powerful than normal.\"","Although many people in the Bai Clan had witnessed Heavenly Tribulations before—","This one felt completely different.","The pressure alone made countless cultivators feel uncomfortable.","Even some powerful Great Ascension Realm experts felt their breathing become slightly heavier.","The tribulation clouds continued gathering.","Rumble!","Another thunderous roar echoed throughout the heavens.","This time—","The sound was even louder.","The ground itself seemed to tremble.","\"Who is undergoing the tribulation?\"","Someone finally asked.","Before anyone could answer, a powerful aura suddenly erupted from a particular residence.","Boom!","The Qi surrounding the area surged violently.","At the same time, a figure slowly emerged.","\"Clan Leader!\"","\"Bai Zihan!\"","The person undergoing the Heavenly Tribulation was none other than—","The Bai Clan Leader.","Bai Zihan slowly walked out of his residence.","His expression was calm.","He raised his head and looked toward the enormous tribulation clouds gathering above him.","Lightning flashed.","Thunder roared.","The terrifying pressure continued to descend.","However, Bai Zihan did not seem particularly concerned.","Instead, he simply looked at the sky.","\"Is this all?\"","The Heavenly Tribulation was indeed much larger than normal.","Its pressure was also significantly stronger.","However, to Bai Zihan, it was nothing particularly impressive.","The moment he felt the pressure of the tribulation clouds, a memory surfaced within his mind.","Years ago, after failing to uphold his Heavenly Vow, the Heavenly Tribulation had descended upon him.","At that time, the pressure he had felt was terrifying.","The lightning had contained an incomparably destructive aura.","Even now, Bai Zihan could still remember that feeling.","Compared to that Heavenly Tribulation, the current one seemed much weaker.","Of course, Bai Zihan knew why.","That time—","The Heavenly Tribulation had descended to kill him.","This time—","It was merely testing him.","Bai Zihan narrowed his eyes.","\"The size is impressive.\"","He looked at the enormous clouds.","\"But the pressure...\"","A faint smile appeared on his face.","\"It is nothing compared to before.\"","If the Bai Clan members heard his thoughts, they would probably be speechless.","The current Heavenly Tribulation was already making countless people nervous.","Yet Bai Zihan actually thought it was weak.","Bai Zihan calmly stepped forward.","The terrifying pressure of the heavens descended upon him.","His robes fluttered wildly.","Lightning continuously flashed above him.","However, Bai Zihan’s expression remained unchanged.","He slowly raised his head.","His eyes met the enormous tribulation clouds.","There was no fear within them.","Only calmness. And a faint trace of anticipation.","\"It has been a long time since I’ve experienced this.\"","Bai Zihan knew that he could absorb the energies contained within the Heavenly Tribulation and refine them into his own Qi.","Therefore, rather than thinking of this as a life-and-death struggle—","Bai Zihan simply treated it as another opportunity to become stronger.","Rumble!","As though responding to his words, the heavens suddenly roared.","A massive bolt of lightning flashed within the dark clouds.","The terrifying tribulation finally began to gather its power.","Countless Bai Clan members stared toward the sky.","Their expressions became serious.","Everyone knew—","The first bolt of Heavenly Tribulation was about to descend."]},{"number":710,"title":"Chapter 710: The Terrifying Power of Heavenly Tribulation","paragraphs":["Boom!","A deafening explosion suddenly echoed throughout the heavens.","A massive bolt of Heavenly Tribulation Lightning tore through the clouds.","It descended directly toward Bai Zihan.","The moment the lightning appeared, the expressions of countless Bai Clan members changed.","\"So powerful!\"","An Immortal Ascension Realm elder couldn’t help but exclaim.","He had personally undergone Heavenly Tribulation years ago.","Therefore, he understood just how powerful the first bolt was supposed to be.","However, the lightning descending toward Bai Zihan was completely different.","Its destructive aura was far more terrifying than the one he had faced.","\"It is much more powerful than mine was!\"","Another Immortal Cultivator spoke with a solemn expression.","Compared to the Heavenly Tribulation he had experienced, Bai Zihan’s was clearly on another level.","He even felt that it was comparable to the Heavenly Tribulation one would face when ascending from the Immortal Ascension Realm to the Earth Immortal Realm.","The size of the tribulation clouds alone was already terrifying.","Now, after witnessing the first bolt of lightning—","Everyone finally understood that the difference was not merely in appearance.","The Heavenly Tribulation itself was genuinely more powerful.","Countless Bai Clan members couldn’t help but become worried.","\"Has the Clan Leader made enough preparations?\"","Someone asked anxiously.","Normally, a cultivator preparing to undergo Heavenly Tribulation would spend a long time making preparations.","Defensive formations.","Defensive artifacts.","Pills.","Everything would be prepared in advance.","After all, Heavenly Tribulation was a matter of life and death.","Even the slightest mistake could result in death.","However, everyone had only just realized that Bai Zihan was about to ascend to the Immortal Realm.","There had been no time for him to make any preparations or at least they had not heard anything about it.","For many people, they did not even know that Bai Zihan had reached the peak of the Great Ascension Realm.","It seemed like only yesterday that Bai Zihan had been stuck in the Core Formation Realm.","Yet before they knew it, he was already preparing to ascend to the Immortal Realm.","Such talent was simply beyond anything they could describe.","\"What should we do?\"","The Heavenly Tribulation was simply too powerful.","Even several Immortal Cultivators had serious expressions on their faces.","However, no matter how worried they were or what they thought—","There was nothing they could do.","No one could interfere with another person’s Heavenly Tribulation.","The moment someone attempted to interfere, they would be detected by the heavens.","And they would immediately become another target of the Heavenly Tribulation.","The stronger the person interfering was, the more powerful the Heavenly Tribulation would strike that person.","If a powerful expert attempted to help Bai Zihan, they might not only fail to save him.","They could even lose their lives in vain.","Therefore, whether one was an ally or an enemy, it was better to leave the person undergoing tribulation alone.","No one dared to approach Bai Zihan.","Everyone could only stand in the distance and watch.","Watching the terrifying bolt of lightning descend.","Meanwhile, Bai Zihan remained completely calm.","The Heavenly Tribulation Lightning rapidly approached.","However, unlike what everyone expected, Bai Zihan showed no intention of moving.","He did not retreat nor did he take out his defensive artifact.","Bai Zihan simply stood there. As though waiting for the lightning to strike him.","The surrounding Bai Clan members immediately turned pale.","\"What is the Clan Leader doing?!\"","\"Why isn’t he defending himself?\"","The lightning was about to descend. Yet Bai Zihan remained motionless.","There was still no sign that he intended to resist.","Boom!","The first bolt of Heavenly Tribulation Lightning finally descended.","A blinding light illuminated the entire sky.","The terrifying lightning struck Bai Zihan directly.","BOOM!!!","A deafening explosion shook the heavens.","The ground violently trembled.","A powerful shockwave swept through the surroundings.","Countless Bai Clan members instinctively stepped back.","The place where Bai Zihan had been standing was completely swallowed by blinding Heavenly Tribulation Lightning.","Everyone stared toward the center of the lightning.","Their faces were pale.","The Clan Leader had actually taken the Heavenly Tribulation head-on.","He had not dodged.","He had not blocked.","He had simply allowed the lightning to strike him.","Many people had assumed that Bai Zihan, who was always prepared, would have made ample preparations before undergoing Heavenly Tribulation.","However, they were completely caught off guard when Bai Zihan simply stood there and allowed the Heavenly Lightning to strike him.","\"How can that be?!\"","\"Did Bai Zihan freeze in fear? That can’t be!\"","\"We need to save the Clan Leader!\"","Still—","No one moved.","Even those who were extremely worried about Bai Zihan remained where they were.","The Heavenly Tribulation had not ended.","The enormous tribulation clouds were still gathered above the Bai Clan.","Lightning continued flashing within them.","Anyone who approached now might be caught within the range of the Heavenly Tribulation.","And if someone interfered, the consequences could become disastrous.","Therefore, everyone could only wait.","Wait for the Heavenly Tribulation Lightning to disappear.","Wait to see what had happened to Bai Zihan.","The younger members of the Bai Clan clenched their fists nervously.","Some elders had grim expressions.","Even those Immortal Cultivators who had confidence in Bai Zihan couldn’t help but feel worried.","After all, this was Heavenly Tribulation which was much more powerful than normal.","Even the strongest geniuses would make careful preparations before facing it.","Yet Bai Zihan had taken the first bolt directly without any protection whatsoever.","The terrifying lightning that struck slowly began to dissipate.","However, before anyone could clearly see what had happened—","Rumble!","Another thunderous roar echoed from the heavens.","The tribulation clouds had not weakened.","Instead, they continued to churn violently.","Lightning flashed continuously within the dark clouds.","The second Heavenly Tribulation was already gathering.","Everyone’s expressions became even more serious.","They continued staring toward the place where Bai Zihan had been standing.","No one knew what condition he was in.","Was he injured?","Had he been severely wounded?","Or—","Had something even worse happened?"]},{"number":711,"title":"Chapter 711: Heavenly Lightning Strikes Bai Zihan","paragraphs":["Everyone continued staring toward the area where Bai Zihan had been struck.","The Heavenly Tribulation Lightning had yet to completely dissipate.","Crackling arcs of lightning continued dancing across the ground.","The air was filled with a terrifying destructive aura.","Then—","\"Hahaha!\"","A burst of laughter suddenly echoed from within the lightning.","Countless people immediately revealed expressions of relief.","\"That voice!\"","\"The Clan Leader!\"","\"He’s alive!\"","...","The tense atmosphere instantly eased.","Although no one could yet clearly see Bai Zihan, they had heard his voice.","And judging from that laughter, he was clearly doing quite well.","The remaining Heavenly Tribulation Lightning energy gradually disappeared from the place.","A familiar figure finally emerged.","Bai Zihan stood exactly where he had been before.","Most importantly, there was not a single sign of injury on his body.","Everyone stared at him in disbelief.","\"What...\"","\"Bai Zihan took the Heavenly Tribulation lightning and nothing happened?\"","Bai Zihan had taken the Heavenly Tribulation head-on.","Without a defensive technique.","Without a defensive artifact.","Without even attempting to block.","Yet he was completely unharmed.","There were no visible wounds.","No blood.","His aura had not weakened in the slightest.","In fact, some people could even vaguely sense that Bai Zihan’s aura had become stronger.","\"How is that possible?\"","Even the Immortal Cultivators were unable to understand what had just happened.","They had personally experienced Heavenly Tribulation.","They knew how terrifying the destructive power of Heavenly Lightning was.","Even the first bolt was not something a cultivator could simply ignore.","Yet Bai Zihan had done exactly that.","He had allowed the lightning to strike him.","And he had not suffered any injuries.","Bai Zihan slowly looked toward the sky.","The enormous tribulation clouds continued to churn.","Lightning flashed continuously within them.","\"Hahaha... Is that all you’ve got?\"","Bai Zihan looked directly at the tribulation clouds.","\"I barely felt anything.\"","Silence!","The surrounding area instantly became deathly quiet.","Countless people stared at Bai Zihan.","Did their Clan Leader just provoke the Heavenly Tribulation?","Many people immediately turned pale.","The first bolt of Heavenly Tribulation had already been powerful enough to make them nervous.","Yet Bai Zihan had actually said that he barely felt it.","Wasn’t this deliberately provoking the heavens?","However, after carefully observing Bai Zihan—","Many people gradually became silent.","Because there appeared to be some truth to his words.","Bai Zihan really did not look injured.","Not even slightly.","He looked nothing like someone who had just been struck by a terrifying bolt of Heavenly Tribulation Lightning.","Still no one could understand why Bai Zihan dared to provoke the heavens.","The Heavenly Tribulation was already powerful enough.","Why would he deliberately provoke the heavens and make the Heavenly Tribulation even stronger?","Bai Zihan continued looking toward the sky.","Unlike everyone else, he was genuinely dissatisfied with the Heavenly Tribulation Lightning.","Too weak!","That was the only thought in his mind.","The Heavenly Tribulation Lightning had indeed contained powerful energy.","However, its destructive power was insignificant to him.","His Primordial Chaos Body was simply too powerful.","The lightning had entered his body but it had barely caused him any damage.","Instead, Bai Zihan had immediately begun absorbing the energy contained within the Heavenly Tribulation.","His body rapidly refined it.","The destructive energy was transformed.","And gradually converted into pure Qi.","Bai Zihan could clearly feel his cultivation increasing.","However, it was still far from enough.","He had only just reached the limit of his current realm.","He needed a much greater amount of energy to break through.","The first bolt of Heavenly Tribulation Lightning simply wasn’t enough.","Bai Zihan narrowed his eyes.","\"Perhaps...\"","He looked toward the enormous tribulation clouds.","\"The Heavenly Lightning is simply too weak.\"","The more he thought about it, the more reasonable it seemed.","After all, the current Heavenly Tribulation was meant to test him.","It was completely different from the Heavenly Tribulation he had faced years ago.","That time—","The heavens had truly wanted to kill him.","The Heavenly Lightning had been terrifying.","Compared to that, the current Heavenly Tribulation felt almost harmless.","Bai Zihan sighed.","Then, he raised his head.","His eyes met the dark clouds.","\"If this is all you have...\"","A faint smile appeared on his face.","\"Then you’re quite disappointing.\"","The expressions of the surrounding Bai Clan members immediately changed.","\"Clan Leader!\"","Someone nearly shouted.","However, it was already too late.","Rumble!!!","The heavens suddenly roared.","The enormous tribulation clouds violently churned.","Lightning flashed continuously.","However—","This time—","The lightning was different.","A terrifying destructive aura began spreading throughout the sky.","The pressure descending from the heavens rapidly increased.","Boom!","The sky suddenly seemed to darken.","Countless Bai Clan members immediately widened their eyes.","\"It’s becoming stronger!\"","An Immortal Cultivator exclaimed.","The Heavenly Tribulation had clearly responded.","And it looked angry. Very angry!","Rumble!!!","A deafening roar echoed throughout the heavens.","Then a massive bolt of lightning descended.","The lightning was significantly larger than the previous one.","The destructive aura contained within it was also much more terrifying.","Everyone immediately turned pale.","\"Clan Leader!\"","\"Defend yourself!\"","Yet Bai Zihan did not move.","Once again, he showed no intention of dodging.","He did not take out a defensive artifact nor did he intend to use a defensive technique.","He simply stood beneath the heavens.","Waiting.","A smile appeared on his face.","\"That’s more like it.\"","BOOM!!!","The Heavenly Tribulation Lightning struck Bai Zihan directly.","A blinding explosion illuminated the entire Bai Clan.","The ground violently trembled.","Terrifying arcs of lightning spread throughout the surroundings.","The surrounding Bai Clan members immediately retreated.","However, Bai Zihan remained standing.","The terrifying lightning engulfed his entire body.","Crack! Crack!","Powerful arcs of Heavenly Lightning continuously moved across his body. Yet Bai Zihan did not scream.","He did not resist.","Instead, he closed his eyes.","The Primordial Chaos Body within him began operating.","The moment the destructive Heavenly Lightning entered his body, Bai Zihan immediately began refining it.","The violent energy was suppressed.","Then it was gradually transformed.","The destructive power contained within the Heavenly Lightning was refined into pure Qi.","Bai Zihan absorbed it directly into his body.","His cultivation immediately began increasing.","The energy from the Heavenly Lightning continued pouring into him."]},{"number":712,"title":"Chapter 712: Ascension to the Immortal Realm","paragraphs":["The energy from the Heavenly Lightning continued pouring into him.","However, the Heavenly Tribulation was clearly not satisfied with striking him just once.","Rumble!!!","The heavens roared once again.","The enormous tribulation clouds churned violently.","This time, the terrifying pressure descending from the sky became even stronger.","Countless Bai Clan members raised their heads.","Their expressions immediately changed.","\"So soon?! The energy from the second Heavenly Tribulation hasn’t even dissipated yet!\"","\"The Heavenly Tribulation is becoming stronger again!\"","\"Heaven is truly enraged right now!\"","Boom!!!","Another bolt of Heavenly Tribulation Lightning descended.","Its speed was even faster than before.","Its destructive aura was even more terrifying.","The surrounding Bai Clan members immediately turned pale.","However—","Before the lightning had even completely dissipated—","Rumble!!!","Another bolt descended.","BOOM!!!","Then another.","BOOM!!!","And another.","BOOM!!!","The Heavenly Tribulation Lightning continued striking Bai Zihan one after another.","Each bolt was more powerful than the previous one.","Terrifying lightning continuously descended from the heavens.","The entire sky seemed to have turned into a world of lightning.","Countless Bai Clan members watched in horror.","It was clear that this Heavenly Tribulation has no intention of testing Bai Zihan but rather it wants to kill him.","\"How many bolts has that been already?!\"","The Heavenly Tribulation was becoming increasingly terrifying.","Every bolt contained enough destructive power to make even Immortal Cultivators feel apprehensive.","Yet the person standing beneath the tribulation clouds showed no fear whatsoever.","Bai Zihan remained completely calm.","No, that was not entirely accurate. A faint smile appeared on his face.","He looked very pleased.","Boom!!!","Another bolt of Heavenly Lightning descended.","It struck Bai Zihan directly.","The terrifying lightning engulfed his body.","Yet Bai Zihan merely closed his eyes.","The Primordial Chaos Body within him continued operating.","The violent Heavenly Lightning entered his body.","Then it was rapidly suppressed, refined, and absorbed.","The destructive energy was transformed into pure Qi.","Bai Zihan’s cultivation continued increasing.","More!","That was the only thought in his mind.","The more powerful the Heavenly Lightning became, the more energy it contained.","And the more energy it contained, the faster Bai Zihan could increase his cultivation.","While everyone else was worried about whether Bai Zihan could survive, Bai Zihan was actually hoping that the Heavenly Tribulation would become even stronger.","Rumble!!!","Another bolt descended.","Bai Zihan opened his eyes.","A faint smile appeared on his face.","\"Again!\"","BOOM!!!","The Heavenly Lightning immediately struck him.","The energy contained within the Heavenly Tribulation was not merely increasing his cultivation.","It was also refining his body.","Crack!","A powerful arc of lightning moved across Bai Zihan’s skin.","The Heavenly Lightning entered his body.","The terrifying destructive energy continuously washed through his meridians.","Normally, such violent energy would destroy a cultivator’s body.","However, Bai Zihan’s Primordial Chaos Body was different.","The powerful lightning continuously tempered his body.","The Heavenly Lightning constantly destroyed and refined his body.","And every time the destructive energy was suppressed, his Primordial Chaos Body became slightly stronger.","Bai Zihan immediately noticed the changes.","His eyes brightened.","\"Finally, something that can refine my body.\"","Recently, Bai Zihan had been searching for powerful materials that could further temper his Primordial Chaos Body.","However, the requirements of his physique had become increasingly demanding.","Ordinary cultivation resources were no longer useful.","Even Grade-6 and Grade-7 materials were becoming increasingly difficult to use.","Not because they were useless but because they were no longer powerful enough to produce a significant effect.","Furthermore, truly valuable Grade-6 and Grade-7 materials were extremely rare.","Even with the Bai Clan’s current strength and resources, they could not easily obtain large quantities of them.","Bai Zihan could naturally use other methods to temper his body.","However, the results were far less effective.","The Primordial Chaos Body was simply too powerful.","The stronger it became, the more terrifying the resources required to further strengthen it.","At the moment, the Sun Dao Stone was one of the few treasures capable of producing a noticeable effect.","But the Sun Dao Stone alone wasn’t enough.","Therefore, the moment Bai Zihan realized that the Heavenly Lightning could also temper his body—","He became even more pleased.","Boom!!!","Another bolt descended.","Bai Zihan allowed the lightning to strike him.","The terrifying Heavenly Lightning entered his body.","Part of its energy was refined into pure Qi.","The remaining destructive energy was used to temper his physique.","Bai Zihan could clearly feel the changes.","His body was becoming stronger.","His Qi was increasing.","This Heavenly Tribulation had become the perfect source of cultivation resources.","The more powerful the lightning became, the more benefits Bai Zihan received.","\"Hahaha!\"","Bai Zihan couldn’t help but laugh.","This scene immediately caused the expressions of the surrounding Bai Clan members to become strange.","The Clan Leader—","Was actually enjoying himself?","Was he a masochist?","However, all good things eventually came to an end.","Even if the heavens truly wanted to destroy Bai Zihan, the Heavenly Tribulation could not continue forever.","There was a limit.","The lightning could not strike endlessly.","Rumble...","Eventually, the thunderous roars gradually became weaker.","Bai Zihan slowly opened his eyes.","A trace of disappointment appeared on his face.","\"That’s it?\"","The surrounding Bai Clan members nearly stumbled when they heard those words.","They had spent the entire time worrying about Bai Zihan.","Yet Bai Zihan actually looked disappointed.","Rumble!","The heavens gave one final roar.","It was almost as though they were responding to Bai Zihan.","However, no more lightning descended.","The tribulation clouds had already begun dissipating.","The terrifying pressure slowly disappeared.","The dark sky gradually returned to normal.","Bai Zihan looked toward the disappearing clouds.","Then he sighed.","\"What a shame!\"","The Heavenly Lightning had been extremely useful.","Unfortunately, the Heavenly Tribulation had finally ended.","Bai Zihan looked toward the disappearing tribulation clouds with a trace of regret.","However, a second later, his eyes suddenly widened. An idea appeared in his mind.","\"Wait...\"","Bai Zihan’s expression gradually became strange.","His own Heavenly Tribulation had ended.","But that did not mean there would be no more Heavenly Tribulations.","A faint smile slowly appeared on his face.","\"Why do I need to undergo Heavenly Tribulation myself?\"","When another Bai Clan member underwent Heavenly Tribulation, Bai Zihan could approach the tribulation.","The moment he interfered, the Heavenly Tribulation would naturally target him as well.","And because he was already an Immortal Cultivator, the Heavenly Lightning directed toward him would become even more powerful.","After all, the Heavenly Tribulation would not simply allow a powerful cultivator to interfere with another person’s ascension.","The stronger the person interfering was, the more terrifying the Heavenly Tribulation would become.","Under normal circumstances, no one would dare to do such a thing.","A powerful cultivator interfering with someone else’s Heavenly Tribulation could easily cause the Heavenly Tribulation to target them.","And in most cases, they would be killed.","However, for Bai Zihan, that was precisely what he needed.","Previously, he wouldn’t be able to do so but with his current strength, there was no need to fear the Heavenly Tribulation.","Bai Zihan’s smile gradually widened.","\"Interesting...\"","Before this, Bai Zihan might have worried about finding enough opportunities.","After all, how often would someone undergo Heavenly Tribulation?","However, he no longer needed to worry.","The Bai Clan had grown rapidly over the past few years.","More and more cultivators were reaching the peak of the Great Ascension Realm.","Almost every week, someone would attempt to break through to the Immortal Realm.","And every time someone attempted to ascend, Heavenly Tribulation would descend.","Bai Zihan could simply make use of those opportunities.","His eyes gradually brightened.","\"I should ask them to inform me whenever someone is about to undergo Heavenly Tribulation.\"","The moment he thought of this, Bai Zihan became even more satisfied.","Others feared Heavenly Tribulation.","Bai Zihan was actually looking forward to it.","However—","Before he could think further—","Boom!","A powerful aura suddenly erupted from his body.","Bai Zihan’s expression immediately changed.","The enormous amount of Heavenly Lightning he had absorbed finally began to show its effects.","The Qi within his body surged violently.","The surrounding spiritual energy immediately began gathering toward him.","Bai Zihan quickly sat down.","His eyes gradually closed.","The Qi within his body continuously circulated.","The barrier that had prevented him from advancing finally began to collapse.","Crack!","An invisible sound echoed within Bai Zihan’s body.","Then—","Boom!!!","A powerful wave of Qi erupted.","The Qi throughout the surrounding area violently trembled.","Bai Zihan’s cultivation had finally broken through.","The Qi within his body began undergoing a fundamental transformation.","The originally dense Qi gradually changed.","It became purer.","More refined.","More powerful.","A completely different type of energy began flowing through Bai Zihan’s meridians.","Immortal Qi!","Every strand of Immortal Qi contained an astonishing amount of energy.","Bai Zihan slowly opened his eyes.","A profound light flashed within them.","He slowly clenched his fist.","An overwhelming aura spread from his body.","The surrounding air trembled.","Bai Zihan looked toward his hand.","\"Immortal Realm...\"","From this moment onward, Bai Zihan was no longer merely a mortal cultivator.","He had entered an entirely new realm.","The Immortal Realm!"]},{"number":713,"title":"Chapter 713: Promise From Long Ago","paragraphs":["Before long, countless members of the Bai Clan began gathering outside his residence.","Disciples.","Elders.","Grand Elders.","Everyone wanted to personally congratulate the Clan Leader who had just entered the Immortal Realm.","\"Congratulations, Clan Leader!\"","A loud voice suddenly echoed.","The next moment, countless Bai Clan members bowed.","\"Congratulations on entering the Immortal Realm!\"","Their voices echoed throughout the Bai Clan.","\"Hahaha!\"","A burst of laughter suddenly echoed.","Several familiar figures slowly walked forward.","Bai Ren was among them.","Behind him were several of the older members of the Bai Clan.","All of them had smiles on their faces.","Bai Ren looked at Bai Zihan for several moments.","Then, he couldn’t help but shake his head.","\"Who would have thought...\"","Bai Ren sighed.","\"When I was your age, I was still struggling to break through to the Spirit Severing Realm.\"","Several of the old men behind him immediately began laughing.","\"Hahaha! Can you compare yourself to Zihan’er? He is a once-in-a-million genius.\"","\"Who would have imagined that someone barely twenty years old would already enter the Immortal Realm?\"","One of the old men gradually became emotional.","An Immortal Cultivator!","Even throughout the long history of the Desolate Heaven Empire, Immortal Cultivators had always stood at the peak.","Countless cultivators spent their entire lives attempting to reach this realm.","Many geniuses spent hundreds of years cultivating, yet they were still unable to cross that final barrier.","And now, Bai Zihan had done so at only twenty years old.","Such talent was simply unimaginable.","\"Forget the history of the Desolate Heaven Empire.\"","He looked at Bai Zihan.","\"I doubt anyone like him has ever appeared in history.\"","The surrounding Grand Elders immediately became silent.","They knew that the old man’s words were not an exaggeration.","A twenty-year-old Immortal Cultivator.","Not to mention that only four years ago, Bai Zihan had still been in the Core Formation Realm.","Yet in only four years, he had ascended from the Core Formation Realm to the Immortal Realm.","That was eight major realm breakthroughs in only four years.","Most cultivators would already consider themselves fortunate if they could break through one major realm in four years.","Yet Bai Zihan had crossed eight major realms.","Bai Zihan’s talent was simply unprecedented.","Then, another Grand Elder suddenly remembered what had happened earlier.","His expression immediately became strange.","\"His cultivation is terrifying, but that’s not even the most shocking part.\"","The Grand Elder pointed toward Bai Zihan.","\"This brat didn’t even defend himself against the Heavenly Tribulation.\"","Several people revealed strange expressions.","That was indeed true.","Bai Zihan had not merely survived the Heavenly Tribulation.","He had allowed the lightning to strike him directly without offering any resistance.","Yet the Heavenly Tribulation had been unable to do anything to him.","One of the Grand Elders couldn’t help but sigh.","\"I have lived for thousands of years.\"","He shook his head.","\"But I’ve never seen someone undergo Heavenly Tribulation like that.\"","Everyone looked toward Bai Zihan.","They could only imagine how powerful his body truly was.","The Heavenly Lightning that had made countless people terrified had failed to injure him.","Bai Zihan merely smiled.","He did not explain nor did he have to.","After the initial excitement gradually subsided, the atmosphere became much calmer.","The Bai Clan members continued looking at Bai Zihan with admiration.","\"Since the Clan Leader has successfully entered the Immortal Realm, we should hold a celebration.\"","Several people immediately nodded.","\"That’s right.\"","\"This is a major event for the Bai Clan.\"","\"We should send invitations throughout the Desolate Heaven Empire.\"","\"Let everyone know that the Clan Leader has successfully broken through to the Immortal Realm.\"","The surrounding elders nodded in agreement.","From their perspective, Bai Zihan’s breakthrough was more than enough reason for a grand celebration.","A twenty-year-old Immortal Cultivator.","Such news would undoubtedly shock the entire Desolate Heaven Empire.","It would also allow the Bai Clan to further demonstrate its strength.","However, not everyone agreed.","One of the Grand Elders slowly shook his head.","\"Is there really a need for that?\"","The Grand Elder continued.","\"The Bai Clan is already powerful and influential enough.\"","His gaze swept across the surrounding people.","\"Do we still need to deliberately demonstrate our strength?\"","The Grand Elder’s words were reasonable.","The Bai Clan’s current position was already completely different from the past.","In the past, they might have needed to display their strength.","They would have needed to show the world that the Bai Clan had a bright future.","That they possessed powerful geniuses.","That they were rapidly growing stronger.","However, that was no longer necessary.","The Bai Clan had already defeated the combined forces of four empires.","They had destroyed the Shen Clan, one of the Top Ten Forces of the Desolate Heaven Empire.","The Li Clan and Zhao Clan had submitted to them.","The Imperial Family had shown no intention of opposing them.","The current Bai Clan was already recognized as the strongest force in the Desolate Heaven Empire.","\"If it were before, I would agree with holding a grand celebration.\"","He looked toward Bai Zihan.","\"But now...\"","A faint smile appeared on his face.","\"There is no longer any need for such a grand display.\"","It was true.","The Bai Clan no longer needed to prove itself.","Everyone already knew how powerful they were.","Furthermore, the destruction of the Shen Clan had happened only recently.","The entire empire was still discussing the matter.","Holding a grand celebration immediately afterward might attract unnecessary attention.","\"It would be better to keep a low profile if possible.\"","\"After all, the Bai Clan has already attracted enough attention recently.\"","There was no need to continuously show off their strength.","The Bai Clan could simply continue developing quietly.","Several clan members nodded.","The discussion gradually became more intense.","Some supported holding a celebration.","Others believed that it was unnecessary.","Eventually, everyone turned toward one person.","Bai Zihan!","Whether the Bai Clan wanted to keep a low profile or openly demonstrate its strength, the final decision rested with him.","There was no point in continuing to debate among themselves.","It would be better to simply ask him.","\"Why are you all looking at me?\"","Bai Zihan asked.","\"Naturally, we are waiting for your decision.\"","Bai Zihan did not immediately respond.","A faint smile slowly appeared on his face. However, the smile gradually became colder.","The surrounding elders immediately noticed the change in his expression.","Bai Zihan slowly raised his head.","His gaze seemed to look toward the distant horizon.","Then, Bai Zihan finally opened his mouth.","\"A celebration?\"","He smiled faintly.","\"There is no need.\"","Several elders nodded.","However—","Before anyone could continue—","Bai Zihan spoke again.","\"Now that I have entered the Immortal Realm...\"","A cold light flashed within his eyes.","His expression gradually became indifferent.","\"I think it’s time for me to pay someone a visit.\"","The surrounding elders frowned.","\"Pay someone a visit?\"","Bai Ren asked.","\"Who?\"","Bai Zihan slowly turned toward him. A cold smile appeared on his face.","\"Mo Zun!\"","Silence!","The moment that name was spoken, the expressions of everyone present immediately changed.","Mo Zun!","The leader of the Demonic Cultivators!","And—","An old enemy of Bai Zihan.","Bai Ren slowly frowned.","\"Mo Zun...\"","His expression gradually became serious.","The surrounding elders also remained silent.","They all remembered what had happened years ago.","At that time, Bai Zihan had still been much weaker than he was now.","Yet despite knowing the dangers of entering the territory controlled by the Demonic Cultivators—","He had gone anyway.","The reason was simple. Luo Qing had been kidnapped by those bastards.","At that time, Bai Zihan had completely lost control of his emotions.","He had entered the territory of the Demonic Cultivators alone.","He had fought his way through countless enemies.","And he had even directly challenged Mo Zun.","The surrounding elders could still remember the madness in Bai Zihan’s eyes at that time.","He had been willing to risk everything.","Unfortunately, his strength at the time had been insufficient.","Mo Zun was simply too powerful.","Although Bai Zihan had managed to survive, he had been unable to defeat Mo Zun.","More importantly, he had been unable to discover what had happened to Luo Qing.","However, before leaving, Bai Zihan had made a promise.","A promise to Mo Zun.","He would return.","And when he returned—","Mo Zun would face the consequences.","Bai Ren looked toward Bai Zihan.","\"So you still haven’t forgotten.\"","Bai Zihan slowly smiled.","\"Forgotten?\"","A cold light flashed within his eyes.","\"How could I possibly forget?\"","Years had passed.","The Bai Clan had continued growing.","Bai Zihan himself had become increasingly powerful.","Their enemies had changed.","The entire Desolate Heaven Empire had changed.","However, Bai Zihan had never forgotten Luo Qing.","Nor had he forgotten Mo Zun.","He had simply been waiting.","Waiting until he possessed enough strength.","Waiting until he could personally confront Mo Zun.","And now, that day had finally arrived.","Bai Zihan slowly clenched his fist.","\"I promised him...\"","His voice was calm.","However, everyone could hear the coldness contained within it.","\"I told him that once I entered the Immortal Realm...\"","Bai Zihan raised his head.","\"I will return.\"","Actually, with the Bai Clan’s current strength, they could have dealt with the Demonic Cultivators long ago.","They possessed many powerful Immortal Cultivators.","And more importantly, they even had experts with Golden Immortal strength.","With the Bai Clan’s current power, they had long possessed the strength to confront the Demonic Cultivators.","They could even launch an attack against their entire territory.","Yet they had never done so.","The reason was simple.","Bai Zihan had been waiting.","Bai Zihan wanted to deal with Mo Zun personally.","He wanted Mo Zun to experience the same feeling of helplessness.","He wanted to make him regret kidnapping Luo Qing.","The Bai Clan could easily send powerful experts to deal with Mo Zun.","However, Bai Zihan did not want that.","This was his matter.","His promise.","His debt.","Therefore, he wanted to settle it himself.","Bai Zihan’s expression gradually became colder.","\"Besides...\"","His eyes narrowed.","\"There are still things I need to know.\"","Luo Qing!","The reason the Demonic Cultivators had kidnapped her had always remained a mystery.","Why her?","What had happened to her afterward?","Bai Zihan had never received an answer.","Bai Zihan needed answers.","He needed to know exactly what had happened."]},{"number":714,"title":"Chapter 714: Demonic Cultivator Ran Juechen","paragraphs":["Far away from the Bai Clan—","Within the hidden territory controlled by the Demonic Cultivators, the atmosphere was far from peaceful.","Ever since the Demonic Cultivators had launched their invasion on the Desolate Heaven Empire and suffered a devastating defeat, their lives had changed completely.","They had been forced into hiding.","And the reason was simple.","Mo Zun was afraid of the Bai Clan, well that is what most Demonic Cultivators thought.","Of course, none of the Demonic Cultivators had dared to openly say those words.","After all, Mo Zun was their leader.","He was the strongest Demonic Cultivator in the Desolate Heaven Empire.","However, as time passed, the dissatisfaction among the Demonic Cultivators continued to grow.","Years ago, Mo Zun had personally fought Bai Zihan.","And although Mo Zun had ultimately won that battle, he had nearly lost his life.","That battle had left a deep impression on him.","Bai Zihan had been much weaker than Mo Zun at the time.","Yet despite the difference in their cultivation, Bai Zihan had still managed to push him to the brink of death.","To avoid retaliation from the Bai Clan, Mo Zun had made a decision.","The Demonic Cultivators would hide and wait.","All Demonic Cultivators were forbidden from causing trouble and were ordered to remain within their territory until further notice from Mo Zun.","At first, the Demonic Cultivators could tolerate it.","One week?","No problem!","One month?","They could endure it.","Even one year?","They could force themselves to remain patient.","After all, their lives were more important, and they still feared Mo Zun’s strength.","However, anything longer than that?","That was beginning to push them to their limits.","Demonic Cultivators were not known for their patience.","They loved freedom.","They acted as they pleased.","They did not like restrictions.","And they especially did not like taking orders, even from their superiors.","After all, one of the reasons many of them had become Demonic Cultivators—apart from gaining strength more quickly—was because they no longer wanted to restrain themselves.","They wanted to do whatever they pleased.","Now, however, they were being forced to hide like rats.","The dissatisfaction among them continued to grow.","And gradually, some people began saying things that would have been unimaginable in the past.","\"Mo Zun is a coward!\"","Inside a dimly lit tavern, a voice suddenly echoed.","The entire tavern immediately became silent.","Several Demonic Cultivators turned toward the speaker.","A muscular man sat at a table.","His face was filled with anger.","A cup of wine was held in his hand.","\"How long are we supposed to continue hiding?\"","No one immediately answered.","The man raised the cup to his mouth and took a large drink.","However—","The moment the wine entered his mouth—","His expression immediately became even uglier.","\"Bah!\"","He spat the wine onto the ground.","Then—","Crack!","The cup shattered in his hand.","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators were startled.","The man stood up.","\"This garbage is what we have to drink now!\"","His expression was filled with anger.","\"I’ve had enough of this shitty wine!\"","A Demonic Cultivator sitting nearby sighed helplessly.","\"Ran Juechen! At least you have something to drink.\"","He looked at the shattered cup.","\"Some people don’t even have that.\"","Ran Juechen immediately turned toward him.","His anger only increased.","\"Is this what we have become?\"","His gaze swept across the tavern.","\"We are mighty Demonic Cultivators!\"","His voice gradually became louder.","\"Yet now, we are forced to hide in these miserable places like a bunch of rats!\"","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators gradually became silent.","Many of them had similar thoughts.","They had simply never dared to say them openly because they feared Mo Zun’s strength.","Now that someone else was saying it, their dissatisfaction could no longer be concealed.","Ran Juechen clenched his fists.","\"I’ve had enough!\"","His voice echoed throughout the tavern.","\"I’m no longer going to listen to Mo Zun’s nonsense!\"","The expressions of several people immediately changed.","However, before anyone could stop him—","Ran Juechen continued.","\"If he’s scared...\"","A contemptuous expression appeared on his face.","\"Then he can continue hiding!\"","His eyes flashed with a fierce light.","\"But I won’t!\"","Ran Juechen suddenly stepped forward.","\"I will leave this godforsaken place!\"","His voice echoed throughout the tavern.","\"And I’ll do whatever I please!\"","Then—","\"Well said!\"","A voice suddenly echoed.","Ran Juechen turned around.","Another Demonic Cultivator stood up.","A smile appeared on his face.","\"I’ve been thinking the same thing.\"","Another person nodded.","\"Why are we hiding?\"","\"That’s right!\"","More voices gradually appeared.","\"Are we really supposed to remain here forever? What’s the difference between this and rotting in a prison?\"","\"Mo Zun might be afraid of the Bai Clan, but that doesn’t mean we have to be!\"","The atmosphere inside the tavern immediately changed.","Ran Juechen’s expression became increasingly smug.","He raised his head.","Seeing so many people supporting him only made him more confident.","\"Exactly!\"","He slammed his palm against the table.","Boom!","The entire table shattered.","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators immediately looked toward him.","Ran Juechen sneered.","\"Why should we be afraid?\"","His voice was filled with arrogance.","\"With our strength, much less the Bai Clan—\"","A fierce light flashed within his eyes.","\"Even the entire Desolate Heaven Empire would tremble before us!\"","\"Well said!\"","\"Hahaha!\"","Several Demonic Cultivators immediately began cheering.","\"Brother Ran, we’ll support you!\"","\"That’s right! We’ve got your back!\"","Ran Juechen’s smile widened.","He could feel the excitement spreading throughout the tavern.","For years, they had been forced to suppress themselves.","Now, someone had finally openly challenged Mo Zun’s orders.","The atmosphere gradually became heated.","Ran Juechen raised his head proudly.","His expression was filled with confidence.","Then, a powerful aura slowly emerged from his body.","Boom!","The surrounding tables immediately trembled.","Several Demonic Cultivators widened their eyes.","\"What?!\"","Ran Juechen laughed.","\"Hahaha!\"","A powerful pressure swept through the tavern.","\"Since all of you are so supportive...\"","He slowly spread his arms.","\"I’ll tell you something.\"","His aura continued rising.","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators immediately felt their expressions change.","\"This aura...\"","One person swallowed.","\"No way...\"","Ran Juechen smiled arrogantly.","\"My cultivation has finally broken through.\"","Boom!","His aura erupted completely.","An overwhelming pressure swept through the entire tavern.","\"Peak Earth Immortal Realm!\"","Silence!","The next moment, the entire tavern exploded into excitement.","\"Peak Earth Immortal?!\"","\"He actually reached the Peak Earth Immortal Realm! The same realm as Mo Zun!\"","\"Hahaha! No wonder he isn’t afraid of Mo Zun!\"","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators immediately became even more excited.","An Earth Immortal was already an extremely powerful existence.","And a Peak Earth Immortal was an existence standing near the very top of the Desolate Heaven Empire.","Ran Juechen looked around smugly.","He enjoyed the shocked expressions on everyone’s faces.","\"Now do you understand?\"","Ran Juechen’s eyes flashed with arrogance.","He sneered.","\"Why should I listen to Mo Zun?\"","His gaze swept across the excited Demonic Cultivators.","\"That old man has clearly lost his mind.\"","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators immediately became silent.","However, their eyes gradually began to burn with excitement.","Ran Juechen continued.","\"He has forced us to hide like rats because he is afraid of the Bai Clan.\"","\"He has completely lost the courage that a leader of the Demonic Cultivators should possess.\"","His voice gradually became louder.","Ran Juechen raised his head.","A powerful aura continued radiating from his body.","\"Therefore...\"","His eyes flashed.","\"I think it’s time for someone else to take the throne.\"","Silence!","The next moment, the entire tavern erupted.","\"That’s right!\"","\"Brother Ran should become our leader!\"","\"Mo Zun is no longer worthy of leading us!\"","Excited voices echoed throughout the tavern.","Ran Juechen’s smile widened.","Then, he slowly raised his hand.","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators gradually became quiet.","Ran Juechen looked at everyone.","\"It’s time for me to take the throne.\"","His voice echoed throughout the tavern.","\"And lead the way for us Demonic Cultivators!\"","Boom!!!","The atmosphere immediately exploded.","\"Brother Ran should become our new leader!\"","\"Mo Zun lost his edge long ago!\"","Countless Demonic Cultivators began roaring in agreement.","They had been forced to remain hidden.","Forced to live cautiously.","For Demonic Cultivators who had always lived according to their desires—","Such a life was unbearable.","And now, someone had finally stood up.","Someone powerful enough to challenge Mo Zun.","A Peak Earth Immortal!","With Ran Juechen’s current cultivation, he was no weaker than Mo Zun.","Naturally, many Demonic Cultivators immediately became excited.","The thought of overthrowing Mo Zun no longer seemed impossible.","Instead, it seemed inevitable.","The voices within the tavern grew louder and louder.","Everyone was ready to rebel.","However—","\"Enough!\"","Ran Juechen suddenly shouted.","His powerful voice echoed throughout the tavern.","The excited Demonic Cultivators immediately became silent.","Ran Juechen slowly raised his hand.","A confident smile appeared on his face.","\"There is no need to become so excited.\"","His expression was calm.","\"I am not an unreasonable person.\"","Several Demonic Cultivators revealed strange expressions.","Ran Juechen had just declared his intention to take Mo Zun’s position.","Yet now, he was claiming to be reasonable?","Ran Juechen continued.","\"After all, Mo Zun has led the Demonic Cultivators for many years.\"","His eyes narrowed slightly.","\"Therefore, I will give him a chance.\"","Everyone listened attentively.","Ran Juechen smiled.","\"I will respectfully ask him to hand over his authority.\"","Several people nodded.","That seemed reasonable.","After all, Ran Juechen was now a Peak Earth Immortal.","There was no need to immediately fight.","If Mo Zun understood the situation and willingly stepped down, unnecessary bloodshed could be avoided.","However, Ran Juechen’s smile gradually became colder.","\"But...\"","A powerful aura flashed from his body.","\"If he refuses...\"","His eyes narrowed.","\"Then I can only resort to force!\""]},{"number":715,"title":"Chapter 715: Ran Juechen’s Ambition","paragraphs":["The surrounding Demonic Cultivators immediately became excited once again.","After all, this was the world of Demonic Cultivators, where strength determined everything.","Among Demonic Cultivators, there were no complicated rules.","There was no such thing as absolute loyalty.","No one cared about seniority.","The strong ruled.","The weak obeyed.","That was the law they followed.","If Ran Juechen was stronger than Mo Zun, then Ran Juechen had every right to take his position.","\"If Mo Zun is weaker than you, then why should he remain our leader?\"","More and more people voiced their agreement.","Ran Juechen’s confidence continued growing.","Everything was going exactly as he expected.","With his cultivation at the Peak Earth Immortal Realm—","Who could stop him?","Mo Zun?","Ran Juechen sneered internally.","Even if Mo Zun was also a Peak Earth Immortal, Ran Juechen did not fear him.","If they truly fought—","He was confident in his own strength.","Furthermore, he now had the support of countless Demonic Cultivators.","Mo Zun’s position was already unstable.","Ran Juechen slowly stood up.","\"Then—\"","He was about to continue.","However, a calm voice suddenly echoed throughout the tavern.","\"Oh?\"","The entire tavern instantly turned toward the source of the voice.","\"Do you want to rebel?\"","Ran Juechen’s expression suddenly froze.","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators also became silent.","Their expressions gradually changed.","That voice...","Everyone slowly turned toward the entrance of the tavern.","A figure stood there.","No one had noticed when he arrived.","He simply stood quietly near the entrance.","His hands were behind his back.","His expression was calm.","However, the moment Ran Juechen saw him, his pupils suddenly contracted.","The person standing at the entrance was none other than—","Mo Zun!","For several moments, no one dared to speak.","The previously excited atmosphere completely disappeared.","Just moments ago, countless people had been shouting about overthrowing Mo Zun.","Now, they didn’t even dare to breathe loudly.","After all, no matter how eager they had been, they had only been talking behind his back.","Now that Mo Zun was here in person, who would dare to say those things?","Even if they disliked his orders, he was still the strongest person there.","Mo Zun slowly looked around the tavern.","His gaze swept across every Demonic Cultivator.","No one could tell what he was thinking.","Then, his eyes finally stopped on Ran Juechen.","\"Oh, Ran Juechen.\"","His voice was calm.","\"So you want my position?\"","Ran Juechen’s expression gradually became serious.","However, after several moments, he slowly straightened his back.","He was a Peak Earth Immortal now.","Why should he fear Mo Zun?","A powerful aura slowly emerged from his body.","Ran Juechen looked directly at Mo Zun.","Then, a smile appeared on his face.","\"That’s right.\"","His words echoed throughout the completely silent tavern.","\"I do!\"","The tavern remained completely silent.","Everyone could feel the tension in the air.","However, Mo Zun did not immediately attack.","Instead, he slowly shook his head.","\"Ran Juechen.\"","His voice was calm.","\"I’ll give you another chance.\"","Mo Zun continued.","\"I will ask again.\"","His gaze remained fixed on Ran Juechen.","\"Do you want my position?\"","Everyone remained completely silent and simply watched.","After all, openly challenging the leader of the Demonic Cultivators was no small matter.","However, Ran Juechen suddenly laughed.","\"Hahaha!\"","His laughter was filled with mockery.","He thought that Mo Zun not attacking him meant that Mo Zun was wary of him.","\"Another chance?\"","He looked directly at Mo Zun.","\"Do you still think I’m the same Ran Juechen from before?\"","Boom!","A powerful aura erupted from his body.","The aura of a Peak Earth Immortal!","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators immediately felt a powerful pressure.","Ran Juechen raised his head proudly.","\"Mo Zun!\"","His eyes were filled with arrogance.","\"You should be the one taking this opportunity.\"","Mo Zun’s expression remained unchanged.","Ran Juechen sneered.","\"You have been the leader of the Demonic Cultivators for so many years.\"","His voice gradually became louder.","\"Yet what have you done recently?\"","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators became silent.","Ran Juechen pointed toward Mo Zun.","\"You led us into the Desolate Heaven Empire. We suffered a defeat. Then what?\"","His expression was filled with contempt.","\"You ordered us to hide like cowards!\"","Ran Juechen’s gaze swept across the surrounding Demonic Cultivators.","\"Look at us!\"","His voice became increasingly louder.","\"We are Demonic Cultivators!\"","\"We should be free!\"","\"We should do whatever we want!\"","\"But because of you—\"","Ran Juechen looked directly at Mo Zun.","\"We have been hiding like rats!\"","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators remained silent.","However, many of them had complicated expressions.","Because—","Although Ran Juechen’s words were straightforward—","They shared the same dissatisfaction.","Ran Juechen sneered.","\"You are a failure as the leader of the Demonic Cultivators!\"","The entire place became even quieter.","No one expected him to say those words directly.","Ran Juechen, however, showed no hesitation.","\"You have failed every Demonic Cultivator. You have failed as our leader. And now...\"","A mocking smile appeared on his face.","\"You are even afraid of a single clan!\"","Several Demonic Cultivators immediately lowered their heads.","Ran Juechen laughed.","\"Hahaha! The leader of the Demonic Cultivators, Mo Zun!\"","He spread his arms.","\"Reduced to hiding because he is afraid of the Bai Clan!\"","His eyes were filled with contempt.","\"What a joke!\"","Mo Zun quietly watched him.","His expression remained calm.","However, a strange smile slowly appeared on his face.","\"Ran Juechen!\"","Ran Juechen stopped laughing.","Mo Zun slowly tilted his head.","\"Do you truly believe that I ordered the Demonic Cultivators to hide because I was afraid of the Bai Clan?\"","Ran Juechen scoffed.","\"Isn’t that obvious?\"","His expression was filled with disdain.","\"You fought that fledgling, Bai Zihan, years ago and nearly died. And ever since then, you’ve been hiding!\"","Ran Juechen sneered.","\"Is there even a need to guess?\"","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators also looked toward Mo Zun.","They also wanted to hear his answer.","\"Kekeke...\"","A strange laugh suddenly escaped Mo Zun’s mouth.","The sound caused several Demonic Cultivators to unconsciously shiver.","Mo Zun slowly began laughing.","\"Kekekeke...\"","Ran Juechen frowned.","Mo Zun gradually stopped laughing.","\"If that is what you believe...\"","A faint smile appeared on his face.","\"Then I’ll give you an opportunity today.\"","Ran Juechen narrowed his eyes.","Mo Zun slowly raised one hand.","\"Come!\"","His voice was calm.","\"Fight me!\"","Silence!","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators widened their eyes.","Mo Zun looked directly at Ran Juechen.","\"If you defeat me...\"","His smile widened.","\"The position of the leader of the Demonic Cultivators will be yours.\"","The entire place immediately erupted in excitement.","Ran Juechen’s eyes immediately brightened.","This was exactly what he wanted.","Strength determined everything among Demonic Cultivators.","If he defeated Mo Zun—","No one would be able to question his position.","From Mo Zun’s earlier attitude, he thought that Mo Zun was just pretending to be tough.","Ran Juechen smiled.","\"You said it yourself.\"","Ran Juechen slowly stepped forward.","A terrifying aura erupted from his body.","Boom!!!","The entire ground trembled.","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators immediately retreated.","Ran Juechen’s cultivation erupted without restraint.","The powerful aura of a Peak Earth Immortal swept through the entire tavern.","The tables shook.","The cups shattered.","Even the walls began cracking.","\"Hahaha!\"","Ran Juechen laughed loudly.","\"Then don’t blame me!\"","His eyes flashed with excitement.","For years, Mo Zun had stood above them.","Now, Ran Juechen finally had the opportunity to challenge him.","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators watched excitedly.","A battle between two Peak Earth Immortals!","Such a battle would undoubtedly be spectacular.","They could not help but look forward to it.","Ran Juechen moved.","Boom!!!","His figure disappeared.","He transformed into a black streak of light and rushed directly toward Mo Zun.","A terrifying amount of Demonic Qi gathered around his fist.","Everyone watched in excitement.","A great battle was about to begin!","However—","The next moment—","Slash!","Ran Juechen’s body suddenly stopped.","His eyes widened.","The Demonic Qi surrounding him instantly disappeared.","The excited expressions of the surrounding Demonic Cultivators froze.","For several moments—","No one understood what had happened.","Then a thin line of blood appeared across Ran Juechen’s waist.","Drip! Drip!","Blood slowly fell onto the ground.","Ran Juechen slowly lowered his head.","His pupils contracted.","\"What...\"","His body suddenly separated.","Splash!","Ran Juechen’s body was split into two.","His upper body crashed onto the ground.","His lower body remained standing for a brief moment before collapsing.","Silence!","The entire place became deathly quiet.","Everyone stared at Ran Juechen’s corpse.","Their minds had completely stopped working.","A Peak Earth Immortal—","Dead?","Just like that?","They had not even seen Mo Zun move.","There had been no powerful attack.","No terrifying technique.","No great battle.","Only—","Slash!","And Ran Juechen was dead.","Mo Zun slowly looked at his corpse.","The faint smile on his face remained.","Then—","\"Kekeke...\"","His strange laughter echoed throughout the completely silent tavern.","\"Who else...\"","Mo Zun slowly raised his head.","His cold eyes swept across every Demonic Cultivator present.","\"Wants my position?\""]},{"number":716,"title":"Chapter 716: The Ambition to Conquer the Eastern Region","paragraphs":["The shock spread throughout the tavern.","No one had expected such a result.","Even if they had believed that Mo Zun would win—","No one had expected the battle to end in a single move.","Ran Juechen had been a Peak Earth Immortal!","He had stood at the same cultivation realm as Mo Zun.","At least, that was what everyone had believed.","Yet Ran Juechen had not even been able to put up the slightest resistance.","The entire tavern remained deathly silent.","Everyone stared at Ran Juechen’s corpse.","Their expressions were filled with disbelief.","A Peak Earth Immortal had been killed in a single move.","What kind of terrifying strength was that?","The people who had been cheering the loudest only moments ago immediately changed their expressions.","Their faces became filled with awkward smiles.","\"Hahaha...\"","One of them suddenly laughed nervously.","\"Leader Mo Zun is truly powerful!\"","The others immediately reacted.","\"That’s right! Ran Juechen was simply overestimating himself!\"","\"What Peak Earth Immortal? He actually dared to challenge the almighty Leader!\"","Several people immediately began criticizing Ran Juechen.","\"That fool truly didn’t know the immensity of heaven and earth!\"","\"He actually thought he could challenge Leader Mo Zun?\"","\"What a joke!\"","Another Demonic Cultivator immediately stepped forward.","His expression was filled with anger.","\"Ran Juechen deserved to die!\"","Several people immediately nodded.","\"Exactly! He dared to challenge the Leader.\"","\"He was simply asking for death!\"","One of the Demonic Cultivators even pointed toward Ran Juechen’s corpse.","\"If Leader Mo Zun hadn’t killed him—\"","He raised his head proudly.","\"I would have killed him myself!\"","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators immediately looked at him.","Several people secretly rolled their eyes.","Just moments ago—","This same person had been shouting the loudest in support of Ran Juechen.","Yet now, he was claiming that he would have killed Ran Juechen himself?","What a shameless person!","However, no one dared to expose him.","After all, everyone was doing the same thing.","The tavern immediately became filled with voices praising Mo Zun.","\"Leader Mo Zun is truly wise!\"","\"How could someone like Ran Juechen possibly compare to the Leader?\"","\"The Leader has led us for so many years!\"","\"We have never doubted you!\"","Mo Zun quietly watched the scene.","A mocking smile slowly appeared on his face.","These Demonic Cultivators...","He knew their nature better than anyone.","When Ran Juechen had appeared powerful, they had immediately supported him.","Now that Ran Juechen was dead, they immediately turned around and began praising Mo Zun.","There was no loyalty among Demonic Cultivators.","Only strength.","Mo Zun slowly shook his head.","\"Kekeke...\"","His strange laughter echoed throughout the tavern.","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators immediately became silent.","Mo Zun’s gaze swept across everyone.","Then he scoffed.","\"So...\"","His voice was calm.","\"No one else wants to challenge me?\"","Silence!","No one dared to answer.","Challenge him?","After seeing Ran Juechen’s fate?","Who would dare?","Ran Juechen had been a Peak Earth Immortal.","And he had been killed instantly.","The remaining Demonic Cultivators were nowhere near his strength.","If they challenged Mo Zun, they would simply be seeking death.","Mo Zun waited for several moments.","No one spoke.","A faint smile appeared on his face.","Mo Zun slowly walked forward.","The Demonic Cultivators immediately moved aside.","No one dared to stand in his way.","Mo Zun stopped in the center of the tavern.","His hands remained behind his back.","\"Since none of you wish to challenge me...\"","His eyes slowly swept across everyone.","\"Then I have a few things to say.\"","The entire tavern became silent.","Everyone listened attentively.","Mo Zun’s expression gradually became colder.","\"Over the past few years...\"","His gaze stopped on several people.","\"I ordered all of you to remain hidden.\"","Several Demonic Cultivators lowered their heads.","They had complained about those orders countless times.","Ran Juechen had even attempted to overthrow him because of them.","Mo Zun sneered.","\"And all of you believed that I did so because I was afraid of the Bai Clan?\"","No one answered.","They did not dare to answer.","After all, that was exactly what they had believed. However, admitting it is adamant to insulting Mo Zun.","Mo Zun slowly shook his head.","\"What a group of fools!\"","His words caused several people’s expressions to change.","However, no one dared to refute him.","Mo Zun continued.","\"Do you truly believe that I would hide merely because I was afraid of the Bai Clan?\"","His eyes gradually became colder.","\"No!\"","The atmosphere suddenly changed.","Mo Zun slowly raised his head.","\"The reason I ordered all of you to remain hidden...\"","A faint smile appeared on his face.","\"Was because I was preparing to break through.\"","Silence!","Several Demonic Cultivators raised their heads.","Break through?","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators widened their eyes.","Mo Zun had been a Peak Earth Immortal.","If he broke through—","Then—","\"That’s right.\"","His voice was filled with amusement.","\"I was attempting to enter the Golden Immortal Realm.\"","Silence!","The entire tavern became completely still.","For several moments, no one reacted.","The Golden Immortal Realm?","Several Demonic Cultivators stared at Mo Zun in disbelief.","That realm was far beyond anything they could imagine.","A Golden Immortal!","An existence standing at the absolute peak!","Then, Mo Zun slowly spread his arms.","\"And...\"","His smile widened.","\"I succeeded!\"","Boom!!!","An overwhelming aura suddenly erupted from Mo Zun’s body.","The entire tavern violently shook.","Crack! Crack! Crack!","The ground beneath everyone’s feet immediately began breaking apart.","An unimaginable pressure descended.","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators’ expressions changed drastically.","Several people immediately fell to their knees.","Boom!","More people collapsed.","Their bodies trembled uncontrollably.","The terrifying pressure crushed down upon them.","They could not resist.","They did not even have the courage to resist.","This was—","The aura of a Golden Immortal!","\"Golden Immortal!\"","One Demonic Cultivator shouted in shock.","The next moment, everyone completely lost their composure.","\"Leader! Congratulations on entering the Golden Immortal Realm!\"","\"Leader Mo Zun is invincible!\"","Countless voices echoed throughout the tavern.","Everyone immediately knelt.","Their heads lowered toward the ground.","There was not even a shred of resistance remaining.","Ran Juechen’s rebellion?","It had completely disappeared from their minds.","What rebellion?","Who would dare to rebel against a Golden Immortal?","Even if they had ten thousand lives, they would not dare.","\"Congratulations, Leader!\"","\"Leader Mo Zun has entered the Golden Immortal Realm!\"","\"You are the strongest!\"","\"The Demonic Cultivators will undoubtedly rise under your leadership!\"","\"With the Leader here, who in the Eastern Region can oppose us?\"","Excited voices continued echoing.","The same people who had been insulting Mo Zun earlier were now praising him without restraint.","Mo Zun looked down at the kneeling Demonic Cultivators.","A satisfied smile appeared on his face.","This was exactly how things should be.","Fear!","Respect!","And Absolute obedience!","That was what strength brought.","Mo Zun slowly raised his head.","His eyes flashed with coldness.","For years, he had ignored the dissatisfaction of the Demonic Cultivators.","Because his attention had been focused on one thing.","Breaking through to the Golden Immortal Realm.","And now—","He had succeeded.","Mo Zun slowly looked around the tavern.","His cold gaze swept across the kneeling Demonic Cultivators.","Then, a faint smile appeared on his face.","\"All of you can stand.\"","Only after hearing his words did everyone finally dare to rise.","However, their expressions had completely changed.","There was no longer any dissatisfaction.","No longer any resentment.","And certainly—","No one dared to mention rebellion.","Instead, their eyes were filled with excitement.","A Golden Immortal!","Their leader had become a Golden Immortal!","Such an existence was enough to completely change the situation in the Eastern Region.","Mo Zun watched their expressions.","Then, he slowly opened his mouth.","\"From today onward...\"","Everyone immediately became silent.","They waited for his next words.","Mo Zun slowly raised his head.","\"There is no longer any need for us to hide.\"","Silence!","The next moment—","\"Hahaha! Finally!\"","\"We don’t have to hide anymore!\"","The faces of countless Demonic Cultivators were filled with excitement.","Mo Zun slowly raised his hand.","His expression remained calm. However, a terrifying coldness flashed within his eyes.","\"We have hidden long enough.\"","His voice echoed throughout the tavern.","\"We have waited long enough.\"","The Demonic Cultivators stared at him.","Mo Zun slowly clenched his fist.","\"Therefore...\"","An overwhelming killing intent slowly emerged from his body.","\"It’s time to prepare to take over those Empires for ourselves!\"","His gaze seemed to penetrate through the tavern and look toward the distant horizon.","\"And this time...\"","His voice gradually became colder.","\"We will not stop with the Desolate Heaven Empire.\"","Silence!","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators immediately looked toward him.","Mo Zun’s eyes flashed with ambition.","\"The entire Eastern Region...\"","A terrifying smile slowly appeared on his face.","\"Will fall before us!\"","Silence!","If Mo Zun had said those words before—","Many people might have believed that he was simply being arrogant and talking big.","The Eastern Region was enormous.","It contained countless powerful forces.","Countless sects.","Countless clans.","And countless powerful cultivators.","To conquer the entire Eastern Region?","That was simply an absurd dream.","However, things were different now.","Mo Zun was no longer a Peak Earth Immortal.","He was a Golden Immortal!","An existence standing at the absolute peak!","The Demonic Cultivators looked at Mo Zun.","Then their expressions gradually became filled with excitement.","Why couldn’t they?","With a Golden Immortal leading them—","Why couldn’t they conquer the Eastern Region?","\"Hahaha!\"","A Demonic Cultivator suddenly raised his fist.","\"That’s right!\"","His voice echoed throughout the tavern.","\"With Leader Mo Zun leading us, who can stop us?\"","\"Exactly!\"","Another Demonic Cultivator shouted.","\"The Desolate Heaven Empire will fall!\"","\"The Eastern Region will fall!\"","More and more people joined in.","The atmosphere immediately became increasingly heated.","\"We have a Golden Immortal!\"","\"Who can oppose us?\"","\"Hahaha!\"","Countless Demonic Cultivators raised their fists.","A future where the Demonic Cultivators would rise once again.","A future where no one would dare to oppose them.","\"This world shall belong to us!\"","\"The Demonic Cultivators shall rule!\"","\"The entire Eastern Region shall fall before us!\"","Their voices continued echoing.","The atmosphere had completely exploded.","The dissatisfaction from earlier had disappeared without a trace.","There was no longer any resentment toward Mo Zun.","There was only excitement.","Only fanaticism.","And—","Absolute confidence.","Mo Zun quietly watched everything.","The voices of the Demonic Cultivators continued echoing around him.","Yet Mo Zun’s thoughts had already drifted elsewhere.","The Bai Clan!","A cold light flashed within his eyes.","Years ago, he nearly died at Bai Zihan’s hands.","Even now, he could remember that battle clearly.","At that time, Bai Zihan had been far weaker than him.","Yet that young man had still managed to push him to the brink of death.","Mo Zun slowly clenched his fist.","Golden Immortal!","The overwhelming power within his body made him feel invincible.","The Bai Clan?","Bai Zihan?","A cold smile slowly appeared on Mo Zun’s face.","The excited voices continued echoing throughout the tavern.","However, Mo Zun only looked toward the distant horizon.","His killing intent gradually intensified.","Then, he spoke softly.","Almost like he was speaking to himself.","\"Bai Zihan...\"","A terrifying coldness flashed within his eyes.","\"When the time comes...\"","Mo Zun slowly clenched his fist.","\"I shall kill you with my own hands!\""]},{"number":717,"title":"Chapter 717: Bai Zihan Enters the Great Wilderness","paragraphs":["While Mo Zun was preparing for another invasion of the Desolate Heaven Empire, the Bai Clan was already on its way to destroy them.","Of course, the Demonic Cultivators had no idea.","Years ago, after the Demonic Cultivators disappeared into hiding, Bai Zihan had given Kong Zhanhong an order.","Keep an eye on them!","The Demonic Cultivators had attempted to conceal their movements as carefully as possible.","However, there were simply too many of them.","A small group could disappear without leaving any trace.","But an entire force consisting of countless Demonic Cultivators?","No matter how carefully they tried to conceal themselves, it was impossible to hide perfectly.","Especially when someone had been secretly watching them.","Kong Zhanhong had people to keep their eyes on them.","His people had followed every clue.","They had monitored suspicious movements.","They had investigated every possible location.","Of course, finding the exact location of the Demonic Cultivators was not easy.","Their hiding place was located somewhere within the Great Wilderness.","The Great Wilderness was enormous.","It was filled with countless mountains, forests, valleys, and dangerous regions.","Even more importantly, it was filled with powerful Demonic Beasts.","The deeper one entered the Great Wilderness, the more dangerous it became.","Therefore, Kong Zhanhong’s people had been unable to discover the Demonic Cultivators’ exact location.","Going too deep into the Great Wilderness would simply be too dangerous.","However, they had managed to determine one thing.","The general direction of the Demonic Cultivators’ territory!","And—","That was enough for Bai Zihan.","At this moment, a massive fleet of Flying Ships was rapidly moving through the Great Wilderness.","At the front of the leading Flying Ship stood Bai Zihan.","His expression remained calm.","Beside him were several powerful figures.","Bai Ren!","Bai Chu!","And numerous other experts of the Bai Clan.","Their movements were extremely fast.","However, the journey through the Great Wilderness was not peaceful.","Roar!!!","A terrifying roar suddenly echoed throughout the surrounding forest.","The ground violently trembled.","Several enormous trees collapsed.","The next moment, a massive beast suddenly emerged from the forest.","Its body was covered in black scales.","Its enormous eyes were filled with bloodlust.","A terrifying aura immediately spread through the surrounding area.","\"An Immortal Beast!\"","One of the Bai Clan disciples immediately spoke.","The beast roared.","Its enormous body charged toward the Bai Clan.","For an ordinary cultivator, encountering an Immortal Beast within the Great Wilderness would be an absolute disaster.","Such a beast was powerful enough to destroy a mid-sized clan.","However, the Bai Clan simply continued moving.","No one appeared concerned.","An elder casually looked toward the approaching beast.","Then—","Boom!","A powerful aura erupted.","The Immortal Beast suddenly stopped.","Its enormous eyes widened.","Before it could react, the Bai Clan elder casually raised his hand.","Bang!","The Immortal Beast was sent flying.","Its massive body crashed through countless trees.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","After crashing into several mountains, the beast finally stopped moving.","The Bai Clan members continued moving.","No one even bothered to look back.","An Immortal Beast?","That was nothing more than a minor inconvenience.","After all, the Bai Clan possessed numerous Earth Immortal experts.","An Immortal Beast was simply not enough to threaten them.","The Bai Clan continued moving deeper into the Great Wilderness.","Along the way, they encountered countless Demonic Beasts.","Immortal Beasts.","And even several powerful Earth Immortal Beasts.","However, none of them were able to stop the Bai Clan.","For most cultivators, entering the Great Wilderness was an extremely dangerous journey.","One wrong step could result in death.","A powerful Demonic Beast could suddenly emerge at any moment.","Even powerful sects would be extremely cautious.","However—","For the current Bai Clan?","It was simply a stroll through the wilderness.","Immortal Beasts?","The Bai Clan had numerous Earth Immortal experts.","Earth Immortal Beasts?","Bai Ren and Bai Chu would quickly show them who the boss was.","As for the weaker Demonic Beasts, they were not even worthy of being considered an obstacle.","They were barely enough for a warm-up.","The Bai Clan continued advancing.","Their destination remained clear.","Somewhere within the depths of the Great Wilderness, the Demonic Cultivators were hiding.","And Bai Zihan was coming for them.","He slowly raised his head.","His calm eyes looked toward the endless wilderness before him.","A faint, cold smile appeared on his face.","Mo Zun!","Years ago—","He had promised that he would return.","Now, he had finally entered the Immortal Realm.","And this time, he was not leaving without answers.","\"Luo Qing!\"","Bai Zihan’s eyes gradually became colder.","He needed to know what had happened to her.","And more importantly, he needed to know why the Demonic Cultivators had kidnapped her.","Just as the fleet passed through another enormous mountain range, Bai Chu suddenly signaled everyone to stop.","His expression changed slightly.","Bai Zihan immediately noticed his reaction.","\"Elder Bai Chu?\"","Bai Chu narrowed his eyes.","His Divine Sense spread into the distance.","Several moments passed.","Then, a faint smile appeared on his face.","\"I sensed something.\"","The surrounding Bai Clan experts immediately became alert.","\"What is it?\"","Bai Chu continued examining the distant area.","The aura he had sensed was extremely faint.","However, there was something familiar about it.","\"It isn’t a Demonic Beast.\"","Bai Chu slowly spoke.","\"That aura belongs to a Demonic Cultivator.\"","Bai Zihan’s eyes flashed.","\"Are you certain?\"","Bai Chu nodded.","\"There is no mistake.\"","He pointed toward the distance.","\"The aura came from that direction.\"","Bai Zihan immediately looked toward the endless wilderness ahead.","A cold smile slowly appeared on his face.","\"Then change direction.\"","His voice was calm.","\"Head toward that location.\"","\"Yes!\"","The Bai Clan fleet immediately changed direction.","The massive Flying Ships moved through the sky.","They rapidly approached the location Bai Chu had indicated.","The farther they traveled, the clearer the aura became.","Even those in the Great Ascension Realm could feel it.","\"That’s...\"","Between several mountains, a large territory appeared.","It resembled a small village.","Numerous buildings had been constructed throughout the area.","There were houses.","Training grounds.","And several other structures.","\"Found them!\"","Bai Zihan calmly looked at the settlement.","They had finally found them.","The hidden territory of the Demonic Cultivators!","A cold light flashed within Bai Zihan’s eyes.","The Bai Clan fleet slowly approached."]},{"number":718,"title":"Chapter 718: A Fleet in the Great Wilderness","paragraphs":["At the same time—","Within the Demonic Cultivators’ territory—","Several guards were standing near the entrance of their stronghold.","However, none of them appeared particularly serious.","One of them leaned against a large wooden structure.","His eyes were half-closed.","Another sat lazily on a nearby rock. A wine flask was held in his hand.","The atmosphere was extremely relaxed.","One of the guards yawned.","\"How boring!\"","Another Demonic Cultivator laughed.","\"What were you expecting?\"","He took another drink.","\"We’re in the depths of the Great Wilderness.\"","The first guard nodded.","That was true.","The Great Wilderness was an extremely dangerous place.","Ordinary cultivators would not dare to enter so deeply.","Even powerful cultivators would be extremely cautious.","There were countless Demonic Beasts.","And the deeper one entered, the more powerful the Demonic Beasts became.","Therefore, the guards had never truly worried about enemies.","Who would be foolish enough to enter this deeply into the Great Wilderness?","The guard slowly closed his eyes.","Furthermore, there was another strange matter.","For some unknown reason, the Demonic Beasts within the surrounding area rarely attacked them.","Of course, the Demonic Cultivators did not understand why.","However, they had gradually become accustomed to it.","As long as they did not actively provoke the powerful Demonic Beasts, most of them simply ignored the Demonic Cultivators.","This made their hidden territory even safer.","Therefore, the guards had gradually become lazy.","There was simply nothing to worry about.","The first guard stretched lazily.","\"At least, I heard that we can soon leave this forsaken place.\"","\"Yeah! I can’t wait. I’ll definitely need to kill at least a hundred women to satisfy my cravings.\"","Another said excitedly.","\"As for me—\"","However, at that moment—","A shadow suddenly passed over the ground.","The guard frowned.","He slowly opened his eyes.","\"What?\"","He looked toward the sky.","His expression immediately froze.","Far in the distance—","Something was approaching.","At first, he could not clearly see it.","The object was still too far away.","The guard narrowed his eyes.","\"What’s that?\"","The other guards immediately looked toward the distance.","One of them frowned.","\"Is that a Flying Ship?\"","The first guard remained silent.","He carefully examined the distant sky.","Then his expression changed.","\"It really is!\"","Several guards immediately became alert.","A Flying Ship?","Why would a Flying Ship appear here?","The guards immediately stood up.","However, none of them panicked.","Instead, strange expressions appeared on their faces.","One Demonic Cultivator sneered.","\"Interesting.\"","Another laughed.","\"Which fools dared to enter this deeply into the Great Wilderness?\"","The guards began laughing.","They were Demonic Cultivators, and this territory was their home.","Even if a powerful cultivator had somehow discovered this place—","So what?","There were countless Demonic Cultivators within the territory.","Furthermore, their leader was Mo Zun, who had entered the Golden Immortal Realm.","Why would they fear anyone?","One of the guards sneered.","\"Perhaps they got lost.\"","Another shook his head.","\"Then they are truly unlucky.\"","The approaching Flying Ship gradually became clearer.","However, the guards’ expressions slowly changed.","\"Wait...\"","One of them frowned.","The first Flying Ship was not alone.","Another Flying Ship appeared behind it.","Then another.","And another.","The guards gradually stopped laughing.","Their eyes widened.","\"What...\"","More and more Flying Ships emerged from the distant sky.","The fleet continued moving forward.","Its size gradually became clearer.","One of the guards swallowed.","\"That’s...\"","His face suddenly turned pale.","The other Demonic Cultivators also stared at the approaching fleet.","Their relaxed expressions had completely disappeared.","That was not a small group.","It was an enormous fleet!","And—","It was heading directly toward their territory!","\"Enemies!\"","One of the guards suddenly shouted.","The others immediately reacted.","\"Enemy attack!\"","His voice echoed throughout the settlement.","\"Enemy attack!!!\"","The previously peaceful territory instantly became chaotic.","Boom!","Several Demonic Cultivators immediately rushed out of the nearby buildings.","\"What happened?!\"","\"Who is attacking us? Is it Demonic Beasts?\"","More and more figures appeared.","The guards pointed toward the sky.","\"Look!\"","Everyone immediately raised their heads.","Then their expressions froze.","High above the Demonic Cultivators’ territory, a massive fleet was rapidly approaching.","Countless Flying Ships filled the sky.","Their enormous shadows gradually covered the entire settlement.","However—","After the initial shock—","Several powerful Demonic Cultivators quickly calmed down.","One of them stepped forward.","He was a tall, middle-aged man with a powerful aura.","His cultivation had already reached the Immortal Realm.","He looked toward the approaching fleet and snorted.","\"Hmph!\"","His voice echoed throughout the surrounding area.","\"Why are all of you panicking?\"","Several Demonic Cultivators looked toward him.","The man crossed his arms.","\"Have you forgotten who our leader is?\"","His words immediately caused several people to calm down.","The man’s expression was filled with confidence.","\"Leader Mo Zun has already entered the Golden Immortal Realm!\"","His voice grew louder.","\"Even if they have a fleet, so what?\"","A cold smile appeared on his face.","\"Can they possibly fight against a Golden Immortal?\"","Silence!","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators exchanged glances.","That was true.","A Golden Immortal!","What was there to fear?","Several powerful Demonic Cultivators gradually revealed confident expressions.","\"Hahaha! That’s right!\"","\"With Leader Mo Zun here, who would dare to cause trouble?\"","\"Even if a fleet dares attack, it is nothing before a Golden Immortal!\"","However, a weaker Demonic Cultivator suddenly pointed toward the sky.","His face was pale.","\"B-But...\"","Everyone turned toward him.","He swallowed.","\"Look at the size of that fleet!\"","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators looked toward the sky once again.","Their expressions gradually changed.","The fleet was still approaching.","However, its true size had become increasingly clear.","There were simply too many Flying Ships.","One after another—","They stretched across the distant sky.","The weaker Demonic Cultivator’s lips trembled.","\"T-That fleet...\"","He pointed toward the enormous formation of Flying Ships.","\"It’s almost the size of the Desolate Heaven Empire Alliance!\"","Silence!","Several Demonic Cultivators’ expressions changed.","That comparison was not an exaggeration.","The number of Flying Ships was terrifying.","Even from a distance, the fleet appeared endless.","A powerful Demonic Cultivator immediately snorted.","\"Hmph! So what?\"","His voice was filled with disdain.","\"No matter how large the fleet is, can they fight against a Golden Immortal?\"","A large army did not necessarily mean that it was powerful.","What truly mattered was the strength of its strongest experts.","And their side had a Golden Immortal!","The powerful Demonic Cultivator continued.","\"Furthermore...\"","He narrowed his eyes.","\"Who said that this fleet is even here for us?\"","The man sneered.","\"Think about it.\"","His gaze swept across everyone.","\"We have been hiding here for years. No one has discovered us.\"","\"Not a single major force has dared to enter this deeply into the Great Wilderness.\"","He pointed toward the approaching fleet.","\"So why would someone suddenly come to find us now?\"","The man smiled.","\"Perhaps they aren’t here for us at all.\"","Several people raised their eyebrows.","The powerful Demonic Cultivator continued.","\"This is the Great Wilderness.\"","His gaze moved toward the endless mountains and forests surrounding them.","\"It is filled with countless powerful Demonic Beasts.\"","A faint smile appeared on his face.","\"Perhaps this is a large clan or sect that has come here to hunt Demonic Beasts.\"","Another Demonic Cultivator nodded.","\"That makes sense.\"","\"Or perhaps they are training their disciples.\"","\"Exactly!\"","More people began agreeing.","A large sect or clan bringing its disciples into the Great Wilderness to train was not unusual.","Powerful Demonic Beasts could also provide valuable materials.","Demonic Beast cores.","Bones.","Blood.","And other precious resources.","While it could also temper the mindset of those naive disciples who have not fought against the Demonic Beasts.","There were countless reasons for a powerful force to enter the Great Wilderness.","The approaching fleet might have nothing to do with them.","The powerful Demonic Cultivator crossed his arms.","\"Don’t panic over nothing.\"","Several people gradually calmed down.","However, they knew that even if the approaching fleet was not here for them—","That did not mean there wouldn’t be any conflict.","After all, they were Demonic Cultivators.","And when righteous cultivators encountered them, there was no need for any reason to attack them other than that they are Demonic Cultivators.","And vice versa.","A clash might be inevitable.","\"Regardless of why they are here, we must remain cautious.\"","Several people nodded.","That was obvious.","Therefore, the Demonic Cultivators began gathering their strength.","More and more powerful figures emerged from the settlement.","The guards remained near the entrance.","Their eyes remained fixed on the approaching fleet.","Meanwhile, the Flying Ships continued moving closer.","And closer.","The massive fleet gradually became clearer.","Then one of the Demonic Cultivators’ eyes narrowed.","\"Wait...\"","The surrounding people turned toward him.","The man continued staring at the leading Flying Ship.","At first, he thought he had seen something incorrectly.","However—","As the fleet approached—","The symbol became increasingly clear.","His pupils suddenly contracted.","\"No...\"","His expression instantly changed.","The man slowly raised his trembling hand.","He pointed toward the leading Flying Ship.","\"Look at that!\"","Everyone immediately looked toward the direction he was pointing.","Their eyes focused on the enormous flag flying above the leading Flying Ship.","A familiar symbol was engraved upon it.","\"IT’S THE BAI CLAN!\""]},{"number":719,"title":"Chapter 719: Leveling the Demonic Cultivators’ Territory","paragraphs":["The moment the words echoed throughout the settlement—","The confident expressions on the Demonic Cultivators’ faces gradually disappeared.","Their eyes remained fixed on the enormous fleet approaching from the distance.","The Bai Clan!","No matter how much they had cursed Mo Zun in the past—","No matter how often they had mocked him for supposedly being afraid of the Bai Clan—","Deep down—","They also feared the Bai Clan as well.","Perhaps, they feared them even more than they were willing to admit.","Every Demonic Cultivator clearly remembered what had happened years ago.","The battle against the Desolate Heaven Empire Alliance!","At that time, the Demonic Cultivators had faced countless powerful experts.","The battle had been extremely fierce and the advantage was on their side.","If only it wasn’t for the Bai Clan, the Desolate Heaven Empire might very well have been conquered by them.","However, The Bai Clan changed everything. Their strength had been overwhelming.","The Bai Clan cultivators had charged directly into the battlefield.","They had killed Demonic Cultivators as easily as cutting down grass.","One after another, countless Demonic Cultivators had fallen beneath their attacks.","The memory of that battle had remained deeply engraved within the minds of countless Demonic Cultivators.","And—","Bai Zihan!","The moment they thought of him, several Demonic Cultivators unconsciously shivered.","Compared to the ordinary Bai Clan experts, Bai Zihan had been even more terrifying.","No, terrifying was not enough to describe him.","During that battle, Bai Zihan had personally hunted them down.","He had chased all the Demonic Cultivators under the Immortal Realm across the battlefield.","No matter what scheme they cooked or how many there were, Bai Zihan was able to kill each and every one of them easily.","Many Demonic Cultivators still remembered the terrifying scene.","Bai Zihan calmly walked across the battlefield.","His expression remained calm. Yet—","Everywhere he went, Demonic Cultivators died in large numbers.","One after another.","Many of those present had personally witnessed it.","And some were among the lucky few who had managed to escape alive.","However, surviving had not meant that they had forgotten.","On the contrary, they remembered it even more clearly.","The terrifying image of Bai Zihan chasing them down had become deeply engraved within their minds.","Even after all these years, some of them still remembered that day.","They remembered it every single day.","At night, when they closed their eyes—","Some of them could still see that battlefield.","They could still see Bai Zihan happily slaughter their comrades.","Therefore, when the Bai Clan’s flag appeared above the approaching fleet—","The confidence of countless Demonic Cultivators immediately disappeared.","\"Why...\"","One Demonic Cultivator’s lips trembled.","\"Why is the Bai Clan here?\"","Another person’s expression turned pale.","\"They found us?\"","\"We’ve been hiding for years!\"","\"How could they possibly find this place?\"","The powerful Immortal Realm Demonic Cultivator who had been confidently speaking earlier also frowned.","His expression gradually became serious.","Just moments ago, he had believed that the fleet might simply be passing through the Great Wilderness.","Perhaps they were hunting Demonic Beasts.","Perhaps they were training their disciples.","Perhaps they had another reason for entering the Great Wilderness.","However, wow that the Bai Clan’s insignia had become visible—","Those thoughts completely disappeared.","The Bai Clan!","Why would they bring such an enormous fleet into the depths of the Great Wilderness?","There was only one possible answer.","They had come for them!","The man’s expression gradually darkened.","\"They found us...\"","Silence!","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators’ expressions changed.","For a moment, several people still wanted to believe that it was merely a coincidence.","Perhaps the Bai Clan was not here for them.","Perhaps they had simply encountered their territory by accident.","However, when they looked at the enormous fleet—","Everyone knew the truth.","The Bai Clan had not come here by coincidence.","That massive fleet had been sent specifically for them!","\"Everyone, prepare for battle!\"","A powerful Demonic Cultivator suddenly shouted.","His voice echoed throughout the settlement.","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators immediately reacted.","Even though fear had appeared within their hearts, they were still Demonic Cultivators.","And the enemy had already arrived at their doorstep.","There was no escaping now!","\"Attack!\"","Boom!!!","A powerful aura suddenly erupted.","Several Demonic Cultivators immediately rushed into the sky.","More and more figures followed.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Demonic Qi erupted throughout the entire territory.","The previously peaceful settlement instantly transformed into a battlefield.","Powerful Demonic Cultivators gathered above the territory.","Their eyes remained fixed on the approaching Bai Clan fleet.","\"Kill them!\"","One of them suddenly shouted.","\"Don’t let them get any closer!\"","The next moment, countless attacks were launched.","Boom!!!","Black Demonic Qi filled the sky.","Massive attacks shot toward the Bai Clan fleet.","\"Attack!!!\"","The Demonic Cultivators roared.","Their attacks rapidly approached the enormous fleet.","However, the Bai Clan had not remained idle.","The moment the Demonic Cultivators launched their attack, the Bai Clan immediately responded.","Bai Zihan stood calmly on the leading Flying Ship.","His eyes remained cold.","He slowly raised his hand.","\"Destroy them!\"","The moment his command was given, the entire Bai Clan fleet moved.","Boom!!!","One after another, powerful cannons emerged from the sides of the ships.","The surrounding Qi immediately gathered.","The next moment—","Fire!","Boom!!! Boom!!! Boom!!!","Countless beams of energy erupted from the Bai Clan fleet.","The Flying Ship cannons fired without restraint.","One after another, terrifying attacks shot toward the Demonic Cultivators’ territory.","The two sides’ attacks collided in the sky.","BOOOOOOM!!!","A deafening explosion echoed throughout the Great Wilderness.","The entire sky shook violently.","Shockwaves spread in every direction.","Several nearby mountains immediately collapsed.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The attacks of the Demonic Cultivators were directly destroyed.","However, the Bai Clan’s attacks did not stop.","The Flying Ship cannons continued firing.","Boom!!!","Boom!!!","Boom!!!","Countless attacks descended from the sky.","The Demonic Cultivators’ expressions immediately changed.","\"Defend!\"","Several powerful Demonic Cultivators shouted.","Powerful barriers immediately appeared.","Boom!!!","The first attack struck.","Crack!","The barrier immediately began shaking.","Then—","Boom!!!","Another attack descended.","Crack!!!","The barrier shattered.","Several Demonic Cultivators widened their eyes.","However, they had no time to react.","More attacks were already approaching.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Terrifying explosions erupted throughout the settlement.","Several buildings were immediately destroyed.","Wooden structures collapsed.","The ground cracked apart.","Demonic Cultivators desperately scattered in every direction.","\"Run!\"","\"Get out of the way!\"","The previously organized territory immediately descended into chaos.","The Bai Clan fleet continued advancing.","Their Flying Ship cannons fired nonstop.","Boom! Boom! Boom!!!","There was no hesitation.","No mercy.","The Bai Clan had come here for one reason.","To destroy the Demonic Cultivators!","Bai Zihan stood calmly at the front of the leading Flying Ship.","His cold eyes looked down at the chaotic territory.","\"Continue.\"","Bai Zihan’s voice was cold.","The surrounding Bai Clan members immediately responded.","\"Yes!\"","Boom!!!","The Flying Ship cannons fired once again.","Countless attacks descended toward the Demonic Cultivators’ territory.","Explosions echoed throughout the Great Wilderness.","Today, the Bai Clan was going to level the Demonic Cultivators’ hidden territory!"]},{"number":720,"title":"Chapter 720: One Against the Bai Clan","paragraphs":["The Bai Clan’s attacks continued without stopping.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Countless beams of energy descended from the sky.","The entire Demonic Cultivators’ territory shook violently.","The Flying Ship cannons showed no signs of stopping.","One attack after another continued raining down from the sky.","Several Demonic Cultivators barely managed to escape.","Their expressions were filled with fear.","At this rate—","If the Bai Clan’s attacks were not stopped—","The entire hideout was really going to be destroyed!","Of course, no one truly cared about those cheap houses themselves.","This place was nothing more than a temporary shelter.","The Demonic Cultivators had never intended to remain here.","In fact, they had already been preparing to leave since Mo Zun’s seclusion ended.","Therefore, even if the entire territory was destroyed—","So what?","They could simply find another place.","However, their greatest concern was not the territory.","It was themselves!","If the attacks continued, they might be buried alongside their hideout!","\"Stop them!\"","Several Demonic Cultivators shouted desperately.","However—","Who could stop the Bai Clan’s fleet?","Then—","\"STOP!\"","A thunderous voice suddenly echoed throughout the entire Great Wilderness.","Boom!!!","An overwhelming aura suddenly descended.","The surrounding space violently trembled.","The next moment, a powerful wave of Qi swept across the sky.","All of the Bai Clan’s attacks were instantly blocked.","BOOOOOOM!!!","Countless explosions erupted.","The attacks disappeared into the distance.","The Demonic Cultivators immediately raised their heads.","Their eyes widened.","Then excitement appeared on their faces.","\"Leader!\"","A figure slowly appeared in the sky.","His hands were behind his back.","His robes fluttered in the wind.","An overwhelming aura surrounded his body.","There was no need to guess who he was.","Mo Zun!","Boom!!!","His aura spread throughout the entire area.","The terrifying pressure of a Golden Immortal descended upon the battlefield.","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators immediately became excited.","\"Leader Mo Zun!\"","\"Our Leader has arrived!\"","\"Hahaha! Now let’s see how arrogant the Bai Clan can remain!\"","Excited voices immediately echoed throughout the territory.","Just moments ago, they had been desperately fleeing.","Now... Their confidence had immediately returned.","After all, Mo Zun had arrived!","And he was a Golden Immortal!","What was there to fear?","Mo Zun looked toward the Bai Clan fleet.","He expected to see terrified expressions.","Perhaps some Bai Clan cultivators would even fall to their knees.","After all, they were facing a Golden Immortal!","An existence standing at the absolute peak of the Eastern Region!","However, Mo Zun’s expression gradually changed.","Because the Bai Clan showed no change in their expressions, nor did they seem to care much.","The Bai Clan cultivators simply looked at Mo Zun.","There was not even the slightest trace of fear.","Silence!","What was happening?","A Golden Immortal had appeared!","Why were they not afraid?","(What was going on? Had these people not sensed my aura?)","Mo Zun thought about it but quickly dismissed the idea.","Those below the Immortal Realm might not know, but how could even those Earth Immortal Cultivators fail to recognize his realm after he had deliberately showed off his cultivation realm?","Several Bai Clan members exchanged strange looks.","A Golden Immortal?","Was this their first time seeing one?","Of course not!","At this point, they were practically sick of seeing Golden Immortals.","The Bai Clan had Golden Immortal experts.","Furthermore, they had recently fought against several Golden Immortal Cultivators.","By now, most of them were practically immune to seeing Golden Immortal Cultivators.","Meanwhile, neither Mo Zun nor the Demonic Cultivators below had any idea about this.","The Demonic Cultivators had remained hidden for too long.","They had no information about what was happening in the outside world.","Of course, since they had only been hiding for less than three years, they assumed that the outside world was still the same as before.","What could change within three years?","How could they possibly imagine that the Bai Clan had produced Golden Immortals?","For thousands of years, the Desolate Heaven Empire hadn’t managed to produce even one.","In fact, even if someone had told them, they might not have believed it.","A Golden Immortal was simply something that couldn’t be produced in the Eastern Region because of the lack of the pill needed to help one survive the Heavenly Tribulation.","Those who attempted to do so without a Grade-8 Pill to help resist Heavenly Tribulation had all been killed.","Therefore, neither Mo Zun nor the surrounding Demonic Cultivators could understand the Bai Clan’s reaction.","However, although the scene was completely different from what Mo Zun had expected—","His mood remained excellent.","A cold smile slowly appeared on his face.","After all, he had been thinking about taking revenge on the Bai Clan and Bai Zihan.","It was because of them that he had failed to conquer the Desolate Heaven Empire.","Just as he had been preparing to take revenge, the Bai Clan had actually brought themselves directly to his doorstep.","Wasn’t this perfect?","A cold smile slowly appeared on Mo Zun’s face.","\"Interesting...\"","His voice echoed throughout the battlefield.","\"You actually dared to come here.\"","His eyes gradually became colder.","\"Bai Clan...\"","A powerful killing intent slowly emerged from his body.","\"I will destroy you today!\"","Mo Zun’s voice echoed throughout the battlefield.","The Demonic Cultivators immediately became excited.","Their Leader had finally spoken!","However, the reaction of the Bai Clan was completely different from what Mo Zun had expected.","\"Hahaha...\"","A loud laugh suddenly echoed from the Bai Clan fleet.","More and more Bai Clan cultivators began laughing.","Several elders shook their heads.","Others simply looked at Mo Zun with strange expressions.","It was as though they had heard something extremely amusing.","Mo Zun’s expression gradually darkened.","Then, Bai Ren stepped forward.","\"Hahaha! You’re killing me with laughter, that’s for sure!\"","His laughter was particularly loud.","Then he looked directly at Mo Zun.","\"Destroy us?\"","Bai Ren shook his head.","A mocking smile appeared on his face.","\"You?\"","The surrounding Bai Clan cultivators immediately began laughing once again.","\"Hahaha!\"","Mo Zun’s face darkened.","The laughter echoed throughout the battlefield.","Not a single person from the Bai Clan appeared afraid of him.","On the contrary—","They were mocking him!","The Demonic Cultivators below also became silent.","Their expressions gradually changed.","What was wrong with the Bai Clan?","Their Leader was a Golden Immortal!","Yet they were actually laughing at him?","Mo Zun’s killing intent intensified.","\"Enough!\"","Boom!!!","His voice exploded throughout the Great Wilderness.","The Bai Clan’s laughter gradually stopped.","However, the mocking expressions on their faces remained.","This only caused Mo Zun to become even angrier.","He slowly looked across the massive fleet.","His cold eyes swept across every Bai Clan cultivator.","\"You truly have become arrogant.\"","His voice was filled with killing intent.","He had never imagined that the Bai Clan would not fear him.","Much less that they would not even show him the slightest respect.","Boom!!!","Mo Zun stepped forward.","His terrifying aura swept across the entire battlefield.","Mo Zun looked directly at the enormous Bai Clan fleet.","\"Come!\"","His voice echoed throughout the Great Wilderness.","\"I will give all of you an opportunity.\"","He pointed toward the Bai Clan.","\"All of you—\"","His voice was filled with arrogance.","\"Fight me together!\"","Silence!","Then—","\"Hahaha!\"","The Bai Clan suddenly burst into laughter once again.","Mo Zun’s expression completely darkened.","What was so funny?","Bai Ren covered his forehead.","He looked as though he could barely stop himself from laughing.","\"All of us?\"","Bai Ren shook his head.","\"Hahaha!\"","The surrounding Bai Clan cultivators also had strange expressions.","Mo Zun had actually challenged the entire Bai Clan by himself?","One Golden Immortal against the entire Bai Clan?","Did he truly believe that the Bai Clan was the same as before?","Bai Ren slowly looked toward Mo Zun.","His expression was filled with amusement.","\"You really are confident.\"","Mo Zun’s face became increasingly cold.","\"Are you afraid?\"","Bai Ren smiled.","\"Afraid?\"","He slowly shook his head.","\"You’re not worthy.\"","Mo Zun’s killing intent instantly erupted.","\"YOU!\"","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators immediately stepped backward.","Everyone could clearly feel Mo Zun’s anger.","However, before Mo Zun could say anything else—","A calm voice suddenly echoed.","\"Enough!\"","The entire battlefield became silent.","Bai Ren immediately stopped laughing.","The surrounding Bai Clan cultivators also turned toward the source of the voice.","At the front of the leading Flying Ship, Bai Zihan slowly stepped forward.","His eyes were fixed directly on Mo Zun.","Bai Zihan’s appearance immediately caused Mo Zun’s expression to change.","Bai Zihan!","Mo Zun’s eyes flashed with killing intent.","\"Bai Zihan!\"","Bai Zihan calmly looked at him.","Then, he slowly spoke.","\"There is no need for anyone else to fight you.\"","Bai Zihan slowly stepped forward.","\"Today...\"","A faint cold smile appeared on his face.","\"I will kill you myself!\""]},{"number":721,"title":"Chapter 721: The Battle Against Mo Zun Begins","paragraphs":["Hearing those words, Mo Zun was momentarily stunned.","\"Hahahaha!\"","Then he suddenly burst into laughter.","It was as though he had just heard the funniest joke in the world.","\"Bai Zihan...\"","Mo Zun looked at him with a mocking smile.","\"Do you truly think you can kill me?\"","His eyes were filled with disdain.","\"Don’t forget who you’re facing.\"","Mo Zun slowly raised his head.","\"I am now a Golden Immortal!\"","His voice was filled with absolute confidence.","\"A Golden Immortal!\"","He emphasized the words.","He admitted that Bai Zihan was a genius unlike anyone he knew.","Back then, he was only in the Void Refinement Realm. Yet Bai Zihan was able to use some forbidden technique to forcibly increase his strength.","With that technique, Bai Zihan was actually able to fight against him when he was an Earth Immortal.","However, against his current strength, Bai Zihan didn’t stand a chance at all.","Much less Bai Zihan—even if he were to face the Half-Qilin, he thought that he could kill it within fifty moves.","His aura surged.","Boom!!!","The terrifying pressure of a Golden Immortal spread throughout the battlefield.","\"You have no chance.\"","At the same time, there were worried expressions on the Bai Clan members.","Several of them exchanged glances.","Their expressions were slightly solemn.","If Mo Zun had remained an Earth Immortal—","They would not have been particularly worried.","After all, Bai Zihan had already possessed the ability to kill Earth Immortals while he was still in the Great Ascension Realm.","Now that Bai Zihan had entered the Immortal Realm, his strength had naturally increased tremendously.","An Earth Immortal would not be enough to make them worry.","But a Golden Immortal was a different story.","The gap between an Earth Immortal and a Golden Immortal was enormous.","Even though Bai Zihan had already ascended into the Immortal Realm, no one could confidently say that he could defeat a Golden Immortal.","They were worried. However, they did not stop him.","Because they understood Bai Zihan’s character.","Once he had made a decision, he would not change it.","If Bai Zihan had said that he would kill Mo Zun himself—","Then he would certainly do it.","Meanwhile, Mo Zun continued looking at Bai Zihan.","A mocking smile appeared on his face.","\"Come.\"","He spread his arms slightly.","\"I’ll give you a chance. If you can even make me take a single step backward...\"","Mo Zun chuckled.","\"Then I’ll consider you a worthy opponent.\"","His words were filled with arrogance.","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators immediately laughed.","However, Bai Zihan did not respond.","He simply looked at Mo Zun.","Then—","He moved.","Whoosh!!!","His figure instantly disappeared.","The next moment, a dazzling sword light flashed across the sky.","Slash!!!","The sword descended directly toward Mo Zun.","Mo Zun’s pupils suddenly contracted.","He had originally intended to casually block the attack.","After all, he was a Golden Immortal.","Why would he need to take Bai Zihan seriously?","Mo Zun raised his hand.","Boom!!!","A terrifying amount of Immortal Qi gathered around his palm.","He casually struck toward the incoming sword light.","\"Break!\"","Boom!!!","The sword and palm collided.","Mo Zun’s expression suddenly changed.","\"What?!\"","An unimaginable force erupted from Bai Zihan’s sword.","BOOM!!!","Mo Zun’s arm violently trembled.","The terrifying force surged through his body.","His expression changed drastically.","He had completely underestimated this attack!","\"Impossible!\"","Mo Zun’s pupils contracted.","The next moment, his body was forcibly pushed backward.","One step!","Two steps!","Three steps!","Mo Zun was forced backward more than five meters before he finally managed to stabilize himself.","Silence!","The entire battlefield became deathly quiet.","The laughter of the Demonic Cultivators stopped.","The excited expressions on their faces froze.","Everyone stared at Mo Zun in disbelief.","He had been pushed backward.","By Bai Zihan.","With a single sword strike!","And Bai Zihan had not even used any forbidden technique to increase his cultivation either!","Mo Zun stood there motionless.","His face had become extremely ugly.","His earlier words suddenly echoed within his mind.","\"If you can even make me take a single step backward...\"","Yet Bai Zihan had not merely made him take one step.","He had forced him backward more than five meters!","The words that had sounded so arrogant moments ago had instantly become a joke.","Mo Zun’s face burned with humiliation.","He had been the one who had overestimated himself.","The surrounding Bai Clan cultivators finally reacted.","\"Hahaha!\"","Loud laughter erupted from the fleet.","Bai Ren was the first to laugh.","\"I thought you were going to show us the strength of a Golden Immortal.\"","He shook his head.","\"Is this it?\"","More Bai Clan cultivators began laughing.","The Demonic Cultivators remained completely silent.","No one knew what to say.","Their Leader—","Their invincible Golden Immortal—","Had just been forced backward by Bai Zihan with a single sword strike.","Mo Zun’s expression became even more distorted.","His eyes were filled with rage.","\"Good! Good!\"","Mo Zun suddenly laughed.","\"Bai Zihan, you are really good!\"","Although his words sounded like praise, there was no trace of genuine admiration in his voice.","Beneath those words was burning anger and intense hatred.","His eyes were filled with murderous intent as he stared at Bai Zihan.","However, there was something else in his eyes now.","Shock!","Because that single exchange had allowed Mo Zun to realize something he had completely overlooked.","Bai Zihan’s cultivation!","It was actually in the Immortal Realm!","The last time they had met, Bai Zihan had still been in the Void Refinement Realm.","At that time, Bai Zihan had already been terrifying enough to make him wary.","Yet now, Bai Zihan has actually stepped into the Immortal Realm!","How long has it been?","Mo Zun’s heart trembled.","Such cultivation speed was simply more insane than anything he had ever witnessed.","Even among the countless geniuses he had encountered throughout his life, he had never seen anyone cultivate at such a terrifying speed.","\"I already told you.\"","Bai Zihan was filled with intense killing intent.","\"When I ascend into the Immortal Realm...\"","A cold light flashed through his eyes.","\"...that will be the day you die.\"","Mo Zun’s expression instantly became ugly.","Those words once again echoed in his mind.","Back then, he had not taken them seriously.","He had believed that Bai Zihan was merely making an empty threat.","But now, Bai Zihan has actually stepped into the Immortal Realm.","And his strength had already reached such a terrifying level.","However, he too has ascended to Golden Immortal Realm which can be considered invincible in the Eastern Region.","\"Then try me!\"","Mo Zun suddenly roared.","BOOM!!!","His Immortal Qi exploded outward.","A terrifying aura swept across the entire battlefield.","The heavens trembled.","The surrounding space distorted violently.","The smile on Mo Zun’s face had completely disappeared.","There was no longer any arrogance or contempt in his eyes.","Only killing intent remained.","He was serious now!","\"Since you want to die so badly...\"","Mo Zun’s eyes became cold.","\"Then I will personally send you to the afterlife!\""]},{"number":722,"title":"Chapter 722: Bai Zihan Vs Mo Zun: Rematch!","paragraphs":["Whoosh!","The moment Mo Zun’s voice fell, his figure suddenly disappeared.","The next instant, a terrifying saber light tore through the heavens.","Slash!!!","The saber descended with overwhelming force.","Mo Zun had no intention of testing Bai Zihan anymore.","He wanted to end this battle with a single move!","\"Die!\"","Mo Zun roared.","His Golden Immortal strength erupted without the slightest reservation.","The surrounding space shattered under the terrifying force of his saber.","However, Bai Zihan remained completely calm.","He gently raised his sword.","The sword in his hand moved with incredible elegance.","It was as though he were not fighting a life-and-death battle.","Instead, he was simply performing a beautiful dance.","\"Eternal Flowing Water Sword!\"","Whoosh!","His sword moved like flowing water.","The terrifying saber light descended.","Clang!!!","The sword and saber collided.","A terrifying shockwave instantly erupted.","BOOM!!!","The surrounding space cracked.","Bai Zihan’s figure slid backward several meters.","However, he remained completely composed.","His wrist turned slightly.","His sword followed the momentum of the saber and redirected the overwhelming force.","Then his sword suddenly changed direction.","Swish!","A sharp sword light flashed toward Mo Zun’s chest.","Mo Zun’s pupils contracted.","He immediately moved his saber to block.","Clang!!!","The sword struck against his saber.","A terrifying force traveled through his arm.","Mo Zun’s expression became slightly solemn.","If it were anyone else—","He would not even bother defending against such a small attack.","To him, those attacks were nothing more than the struggles of insignificant ants.","But Bai Zihan was different.","Every single one of his attacks contained an extremely terrifying Sword Intent.","And combined with his Primordial Chaos Body, even a casual sword strike could make someone like Mo Zun feel threatened.","\"Interesting!\"","Mo Zun’s eyes flashed with excitement.","He swung his saber again.","Boom!!!","The saber swept across the battlefield with overwhelming force.","Bai Zihan’s sword moved elegantly.","Swish! Clang! Slash!","The two figures continuously clashed.","Mo Zun relied on his overwhelming Golden Immortal strength and the terrifying power of his saber.","Every single strike was powerful enough to destroy mountains and shatter space.","Bai Zihan, on the other hand, moved with incredible elegance.","His Eternal Flowing Water Sword constantly flowed between offense and defense.","However, despite this, Mo Zun did not feel that he would lose.","On the contrary, he became more excited with every passing moment.","\"Hahaha!\"","Mo Zun laughed loudly.","\"Bai Zihan! You’re really interesting!\"","His saber collided with Bai Zihan’s sword once again.","BOOM!!!","The shockwave spread across the heavens.","Mo Zun’s eyes were filled with excitement.","\"Once I kill you... I will personally find out what secret you’re hiding!\"","Bai Zihan’s expression remained indifferent.","He calmly blocked another saber strike.","Clang!!!","However, Mo Zun soon realized that no matter what he did, he still wasn’t able to kill Bai Zihan.","It wasn’t that it was easy for Bai Zihan to defend himself against his attacks, but one fact stuck with him—","Bai Zihan had yet to use his Forbidden Technique to increase his cultivation by several folds.","If he used it, wouldn’t he be at a disadvantage?","Mo Zun thought about this, though he didn’t know why Bai Zihan wasn’t using it.","Perhaps he couldn’t use it, or perhaps he was saving it for the last moment.","Regardless, until Bai Zihan was dead, Mo Zun still felt a bit uneasy.","Slash!","\"I can still give you an opportunity to live.\"","Bai Zihan said.","\"Tell me.\"","Bai Zihan’s eyes became cold.","\"Why did you kidnap Luo Qing? And where is she now?\"","Hearing this, Mo Zun was momentarily stunned.","Then—","\"Hmph!\"","He sneered.","\"All this for just a little maid?\"","Mo Zun’s saber erupted with terrifying power.","Boom!!!","He forcibly pushed Bai Zihan’s sword away.","\"Bai Zihan, how can you become a ruler who can conquer the world if you can’t even let go of insignificant people?\"","His voice echoed throughout the heavens.","\"All that strength... yet you still care so much about a single insignificant person?\"","Mo Zun’s eyes were filled with disdain.","\"You disappoint me!\"","BOOM!!!","His Golden Immortal aura erupted once again.","The surrounding space violently distorted.","Bai Zihan’s eyes gradually became colder.","Mo Zun tightened his grip around his saber.","\"I didn’t think I would need to show this so soon.\"","A sinister smile appeared on his face.","\"But you...\"","His eyes locked onto Bai Zihan.","\"You deserve to witness this before your death.\"","The moment those words fell—","An enormous amount of Immortal Qi suddenly erupted from Mo Zun’s body.","Even Bai Zihan narrowed his eyes slightly.","Mo Zun’s aura was changing.","The Immortal Qi surrounding his body began to surge violently.","\"Demonic Ghost Step!\"","The next moment, his figure blurred.","Whoosh!!!","He disappeared from his original position.","\"What?!\"","Several Bai Clan cultivators’ expressions changed.","Even some Earth Immortal Realm cultivators had difficulty seeing Mo Zun’s movement clearly.","His speed was simply too fast!","Whoosh!","A streak of light flashed across the battlefield.","Mo Zun appeared hundreds of meters away.","Then—","Whoosh!!!","He disappeared again.","In the blink of an eye, he appeared on Bai Zihan’s left.","Then behind him.","Then above him.","His movements were so fast that only afterimages remained in the air.","\"Such speed!\"","They could barely capture Mo Zun’s movements with their Divine Sense.","And that was only because they were watching from afar.","If they were standing in the middle of the battlefield—","They might not even be able to see him!","Mo Zun’s eyes were filled with excitement.","\"Hahaha!\"","His laughter echoed across the battlefield.","\"Bai Zihan! Did you really think that my speed was limited to that?\"","Whoosh!","His figure suddenly accelerated again.","His speed increased several times!","The surrounding space seemed to be torn apart by his movement.","A terrifying sonic boom erupted.","Mo Zun’s speed had already reached an unimaginable level.","This was his trump card.","A High Heaven Grade movement technique—","Demonic Ghost Step!","The moment he activated it, his speed increased several folds.","And Mo Zun was already extremely fast to begin with.","With the Demonic Ghost Step, his speed became terrifying!","Even someone in the Golden Immortal Realm would find it extremely difficult to clearly see his movements.","Mo Zun looked at Bai Zihan from a distance.","A confident smile appeared on his face.","\"This is my Demonic Ghost Step. A High Heaven Grade movement technique.\"","His voice was filled with pride.","\"With my Golden Immortal cultivation, how many people in the entire Eastern Region do you think can keep up with me?\"","Whoosh!!!","His figure disappeared again.","The next instant—","He appeared directly in front of Bai Zihan.","Slash!!!","His saber suddenly descended.","Bai Zihan’s pupils contracted slightly.","Clang!!!","His sword immediately moved upward.","The saber and sword collided.","BOOM!!!","The terrifying force sent shockwaves in every direction.","However, Mo Zun did not stop.","Whoosh!!!","His body instantly disappeared again.","Bai Zihan’s eyes narrowed.","He turned around.","Clang!!!","Another saber strike was blocked.","But Mo Zun had already disappeared again.","Whoosh!","Slash! Clang!","One saber strike after another came from different directions.","Mo Zun’s speed had become incredibly terrifying.","He attacked from every direction.","Sometimes from the front.","Sometimes from the side.","Sometimes from behind.","And sometimes, he appeared directly above Bai Zihan.","\"Bai Zihan! Today, I’d like to compare my movement technique against the Bai Clan’s famous technique, the Nine Shadows Flowing Light Sword!\"","Mo Zun’s eyes flashed with excitement.","\"Can your speed keep up with me?\"","Mo Zun felt that with this technique, taking out Bai Zihan would be as easy as taking candy from a child.","He was just playing with Bai Zihan because he didn’t want to end Bai Zihan too soon. He wanted him to feel the despair of being unable to do anything.","As for the Bai Clan’s Nine Shadows Flowing Light Sword, although it was good, he knew that compared to his Demonic Ghost Step, it was slower.","Bai Zihan looked at the overconfident Mo Zun and smirked.","\"Since you want to feel humiliated, then I shall fulfill your wish!\""]},{"number":723,"title":"Chapter 723: Speed Vs Extreme Speed!","paragraphs":["Mo Zun sneered at Bai Zihan’s response.","\"Too arrogant!\"","In his eyes, Bai Zihan was simply too arrogant for his own good.","He actually dared to claim that he wanted to humiliate him?","\"Since you want to court death...\"","Mo Zun’s eyes flashed with coldness.","\"Then I’ll grant your wish!\"","Whoosh!!!","The moment his voice fell, his figure disappeared once again.","Demonic Ghost Step!","In an instant, Mo Zun appeared directly behind Bai Zihan.","His saber was already raised.","Without the slightest hesitation—","Slash!!!","The terrifying saber descended toward Bai Zihan’s back.","Mo Zun was completely confident.","With his current speed, Bai Zihan would not even have time to react.","However, when Mo Zun’s saber was about to reach Bai Zihan—","His eyes suddenly widened.","There was nothing in front of him.","Only air.","\"What?!\"","Mo Zun’s heart shook violently.","Bai Zihan had disappeared!","No!","That wasn’t right.","Just moments ago, he had clearly seen Bai Zihan standing there.","How could he suddenly disappear?","Mo Zun’s eyes quickly swept across the surroundings.","Nothing!","There was no trace of Bai Zihan.","His expression became increasingly ugly.","\"Impossible...\"","He had perfect vision.","With his cultivation, even the smallest movement within his field of vision could not escape his eyes.","How could he have failed to see Bai Zihan disappear?","Could he have been mistaken?","Could it be that what he had seen before was merely an illusion?","But how?","His eyes had never deceived him before!","\"If it wasn’t my eyes...\"","Mo Zun’s expression became solemn.","\"Then where is Bai Zihan?\"","Suddenly—","\"What are you looking for?\"","A calm voice sounded from behind him.","Mo Zun’s pupils instantly contracted.","He turned around violently.","\"Bai Zihan!\"","He was stunned.","Bai Zihan was standing behind him.","Mo Zun’s mind went completely blank for a moment.","He couldn’t understand what had happened.","From his perspective, he had used his extreme speed to catch Bai Zihan off guard.","He had appeared directly behind him.","He had been certain that his saber would strike Bai Zihan before he could react.","Yet when he reached him, there was nothing there.","And now, Bai Zihan was standing behind him.","The exact position he had originally occupied.","Mo Zun’s face became extremely solemn.","\"What... happened?\"","He stared at Bai Zihan.","His eyes were filled with disbelief.","\"How did you...\"","Mo Zun suddenly narrowed his eyes.","\"What deception did you use?\"","There was only one explanation he could think of.","Everything he had seen must have been some kind of trick.","A deception!","Perhaps Bai Zihan had created an illusion that made him believe he was standing there.","\"What deception?\"","Bai Zihan looked at Mo Zun with a faint smirk.","\"With your slow movement, do I even need to use such petty tricks?\"","Mo Zun’s expression instantly darkened.","Bai Zihan continued calmly.","\"If you don’t believe it, you can try again and see for yourself.\"","Mo Zun gritted his teeth.","\"I don’t believe it!\"","He refused to accept what had just happened.","He had used the Demonic Ghost Step.","A High Heaven Grade movement technique!","Combined with his Golden Immortal cultivation, his speed had already reached an astonishing level.","There was no way Bai Zihan could move faster than him without him noticing.","\"I’ll see how you dodge this time!\"","Mo Zun’s Immortal Qi erupted once again.","He concentrated every bit of his strength into the Demonic Ghost Step.","The surrounding space trembled violently.","Whoosh!!!","His figure disappeared again.","This time, Mo Zun did not hold anything back.","His Divine Sense locked firmly onto Bai Zihan.","His eyes remained fixed on him.","He wanted to see exactly how Bai Zihan would move.","In the next instant—","Swish!!!","Mo Zun appeared directly in front of Bai Zihan.","He was certain.","This time, Bai Zihan was right in front of him.","He had seen him the entire time.","He had not missed even the slightest movement.","\"Got you!\"","Mo Zun’s eyes flashed with excitement.","However—","The moment he reached Bai Zihan’s position—","Nothing again!","There was nothing in front of him.","Only empty air.","Mo Zun’s pupils instantly contracted.","\"What?!\"","His entire body froze.","He had seen Bai Zihan standing there!","He had watched him the entire time!","There was absolutely no way he could have disappeared without him noticing.","Yet Bai Zihan was gone.","\"Impossible...\"","Mo Zun’s breathing became heavy.","He immediately turned around.","Nothing.","He swept his gaze across the surroundings.","Still nothing.","Then—","\"See?\"","A calm voice suddenly sounded from behind him.","\"I just walked in front of you, and you still couldn’t respond.\"","Mo Zun’s eyes widened.","His body became completely stiff.","Slowly, he turned his head.","Bai Zihan was standing behind him.","Mo Zun’s pupils trembled violently.","\"This...\"","He couldn’t believe it.","He had kept his eyes on Bai Zihan the entire time.","His Divine Sense had also been locked onto him.","He had watched Bai Zihan from beginning to end.","Yet somehow, Bai Zihan had still appeared behind him.","Without him noticing.","How?!","\"What’s happening?\"","Mo Zun’s mind was in complete chaos.","The surrounding spectators were just as confused as Mo Zun.","After all, they had witnessed everything from beginning to end.","At first, when Mo Zun activated the Demonic Ghost Step, everyone was shocked by his speed.","The High Heaven Grade movement technique had drastically increased Mo Zun’s already terrifying speed.","Even from a distance, tracking his movements was extremely difficult.","Some of the Bai Clan cultivators had initially believed that Bai Zihan would be at a disadvantage.","After all, Mo Zun’s Demonic Ghost Step was even faster than their famous Nine Shadows Flowing Light Sword Technique.","Bai Ren and Bai Chu had even prepared themselves to intervene if the situation became dangerous.","But then—","Bai Zihan moved.","And what happened next completely exceeded their expectations.","\"How...?\"","Bai Ren’s eyes widened.","He had been carefully watching the battlefield.","When Mo Zun tried to appear behind Bai Zihan and catch him off guard, Bai Zihan had moved even faster.","By the time Mo Zun realized what had happened—","Bai Zihan was already standing behind him.","The entire process had happened so quickly that even the spectators could barely understand it.","They knew that Mo Zun must be even more confused than them.","\"What technique did Zihan’er use?\"","Bai Chu couldn’t hide the confusion in his voice.","\"It is too fast!\"","Bai Ren also stared at the battlefield in disbelief.","\"Yes! Too fast.\"","His brows furrowed deeply.","\"It isn’t the Nine Shadows Flowing Light Sword Technique, though it seemed somewhat similar.\"","Although they had previously believed that their movement technique was the best in the Desolate Heaven Empire, they had to admit that Mo Zun’s Demonic Ghost Step was better.","But whatever Bai Zihan had used was far superior to even the Demonic Ghost Step.","Even though they could sense some resemblance between Bai Zihan’s technique and the Nine Shadows Flowing Light Sword Technique, it was still different enough for them to know immediately that it was not the same technique.","Bai Chu’s expression became increasingly solemn.","\"I couldn’t even see how he moved.\"","Bai Ren remained silent.","His gaze was fixed firmly on Bai Zihan.","Even with his cultivation, he couldn’t understand what had just happened.","\"This...\"","A nearby Bai Clan elder couldn’t help but swallow.","\"Could it be that Bai Zihan has created a new technique?\""]},{"number":724,"title":"Chapter 724: A Fleeting Shadow","paragraphs":["Mo Zun’s expression became increasingly furious.","He simply couldn’t believe it.","He refused to believe that Bai Zihan’s speed could actually surpass his own.","How could this be possible?","He was a Golden Immortal!","And he was using a High Heaven Grade movement technique!","The Demonic Ghost Step had already pushed his speed to an unimaginable level.","Yet Bai Zihan—","He was actually faster!","\"Impossible!\"","Mo Zun roared.","He raised his saber once again.","Boom!!!","His Golden Immortal aura erupted violently.","The surrounding space trembled under his terrifying pressure.","\"Die!\"","Mo Zun swung his saber.","Slash!!!","A terrifying saber light tore through the heavens.","But Bai Zihan simply moved.","Whoosh!","His figure vanished from Mo Zun’s sight.","The saber struck nothing but empty air.","Mo Zun immediately turned around.","Slash!!!","Another saber strike followed.","Bai Zihan casually stepped aside.","The saber passed inches beside his body.","Mo Zun’s expression became even more furious.","\"Stand still!\"","He roared.","Slash! Slash!","His saber swept across the battlefield.","Slash! Slash! Slash!","Mo Zun attacked with all his strength.","He continuously activated the Demonic Ghost Step, appearing from different directions and launching attacks at Bai Zihan.","Yet—","None of them could touch Bai Zihan.","Bai Zihan’s figure continuously flickered across the battlefield.","Sometimes he appeared in front of Mo Zun.","Sometimes beside him.","Sometimes behind him.","And sometimes, he seemed to have simply disappeared.","Mo Zun’s attacks became increasingly frantic.","\"Get back here!\"","He roared furiously.","Slash!!!","Another saber descended.","Bai Zihan tilted his body slightly.","The saber passed directly beside him.","Then—","Swish!!!","A sword light flashed.","Mo Zun’s pupils suddenly contracted.","\"What—\"","Slash!!!","Bai Zihan’s sword tore across Mo Zun’s abdomen.","A deep wound instantly appeared.","Blood sprayed into the air.","\"ARGH!\"","Mo Zun’s face twisted in pain.","He immediately retreated.","Grit!","He clenched his teeth tightly.","A sharp pain surged through his abdomen.","Blood continuously flowed from the wound.","But Mo Zun barely cared about the injury.","His eyes were fixed on Bai Zihan.","His expression was filled with disbelief.","\"How...\"","His breathing became heavy.","\"How are you even faster than me?\"","He had not seen the attack coming.","Before he could react, he was already injured.","Mo Zun’s hands trembled slightly.","\"No...\"","His eyes became bloodshot.","\"I refuse to believe this!\"","Boom!!!","His aura erupted once again.","\"I will drag you down with me even if I have to die!\"","Mo Zun roared.","He raised his saber.","However, Bai Zihan simply looked at him.","\"Do you even have the ability to do that?\"","The moment his voice fell—","Whoosh!!!","Bai Zihan disappeared.","Mo Zun’s pupils contracted.","He immediately looked behind.","Nothing.","He couldn’t see Bai Zihan.","Then—","Swish!!!","A sword light suddenly flashed across his body.","Slash!!!","Another wound appeared.","Mo Zun didn’t even see where the attack came from.","His body staggered.","Blood sprayed into the air once again.","\"What is this?!\"","Mo Zun’s face was filled with shock.","Bai Zihan appeared several meters away.","He stood there calmly, his sword still in his hand.","His expression remained indifferent.","It was as though he hadn’t even exerted himself.","To Mo Zun, Bai Zihan was like a fleeting shadow.","Coming and going as he pleased.","Impossible to catch.","Impossible to touch.","If the Bai Zihan he was seeing was merely some kind of deception, then the pain from those sword strikes was far too real.","He looked down at the blood flowing from his abdomen.","His expression became extremely ugly.","\"This can’t be...\"","Meanwhile, the Demonic Cultivators who were once full of confidence were becoming increasingly restless.","Disbelief appeared on their faces.","None of them could understand what they were witnessing.","\"What’s happening?\"","\"How can this be?\"","\"Leader Mo Zun is a Golden Immortal!\"","\"How can he not even touch Bai Zihan?\"","Their voices became increasingly anxious.","They had originally believed that this battle was already as good as won.","After all, Mo Zun had broken through to the Golden Immortal Realm.","Even the strongest member of the Bai Clan shouldn’t have been able to fight against a Golden Immortal in their opinion.","Yet now, reality was completely different.","Their invincible leader couldn’t even defeat a brat from the Bai Clan.","No!","It was even worse than that.","Mo Zun was losing. And he was losing pathetically.","He couldn’t even touch Bai Zihan.","Bai Zihan had already had several opportunities to kill Mo Zun.","If he truly wanted to end this battle, Mo Zun would have already been dead.","But Bai Zihan had deliberately held back.","Before killing Mo Zun, there was one thing he needed to know.","Luo Qing!","He needed to know why Mo Zun had kidnapped her.","More importantly—","Was she still alive?","Bai Zihan refused to believe that these Demonic Cultivators would risk their lives simply to kidnap Luo Qing from the Bai Clan estate and then kill her.","There had to be another reason.","Bai Zihan looked coldly at the furious Mo Zun.","\"Feel like talking now?\"","Those words immediately made Mo Zun’s face turn red with humiliation.","His expression became even more furious.","\"BAI ZIHAN!\"","He gritted his teeth.","\"Don’t think you’ve already won!\"","The moment his voice fell—","Whoosh!!!","Bai Zihan’s figure disappeared.","Before Mo Zun could react—","BANG!!!","Bai Zihan suddenly appeared above him.","His foot slammed directly onto Mo Zun’s head.","BOOM!!!","Mo Zun’s entire body was smashed into the ground.","The earth beneath him violently collapsed.","Dust and debris exploded in every direction.","Bai Zihan remained standing above him.","His foot was firmly planted on Mo Zun’s head.","Mo Zun’s face was pressed against the ground.","The humiliation was unbearable.","\"I’LL KILL YOU!\"","BOOM!!!","Mo Zun erupted with terrifying Immortal Qi.","His entire body shook violently as he tried to break free. But Bai Zihan had already disappeared.","Whoosh!","In the blink of an eye, he appeared several meters away.","Mo Zun immediately rose from the ground.","His hair was disheveled.","His clothes were covered in dust.","His face was filled with fury and humiliation.","\"Dammit! Dammit! How is this possible?!\"","His voice trembled with rage.","He was losing his mind.","How could this be happening?","How could someone in his twenties—","Someone who was merely at the Immortal Ascension Realm—","Completely overpower him?","He was Mo Zun!","The leader of the Demonic Cultivators!","A Golden Immortal!","He had spent countless years cultivating.","He had endured unimaginable hardships.","And after finally breaking through to the Golden Immortal Realm, he had believed that he would become the undisputed overlord of the Eastern Region.","He had believed that no one could stop him.","Yet now, a young man barely in his twenties was standing before him.","And he couldn’t even touch him.","Mo Zun stared at Bai Zihan with bloodshot eyes.","His eyes were filled with intense killing intent.","The humiliation he had suffered had completely enraged him.","He had never imagined that he would be forced into such a miserable state by someone in the Immortal Ascension Realm.","His pride as a Golden Immortal had been completely trampled.","But he still had not given up.","A sinister smile slowly appeared on Mo Zun’s face.","\"Bai Zihan...\"","His voice was filled with killing intent.","\"Don’t think I only have one trump card.\"","Mo Zun’s killing intent surged into the heavens.","\"You will regret making me use this!\""]},{"number":725,"title":"Chapter 725: Demonic Blood Frenzy!","paragraphs":["Mo Zun slowly lowered his head.","His eyes fell upon the blood dripping from his wounds.","Then he suddenly reached out and grabbed the blood flowing from his abdomen.","His fingers were instantly stained crimson.","\"This blood...\"","Mo Zun’s voice became strangely calm.","\"...should be enough.\"","The moment his voice fell—","BOOM!!!","The blood in his hand suddenly began to boil.","A terrifying energy erupted from his body.","His Golden Immortal aura violently surged.","Boom! Boom! Boom!!!","The surrounding space trembled violently.","The ground beneath Mo Zun’s feet cracked apart.","His aura continued rising at an astonishing speed.","Golden Immortal Early Stage...","Golden Immortal Mid Stage...","Golden Immortal Late Stage...","His cultivation continued to rise!","Mo Zun slowly raised his head.","His eyes had become completely bloodshot.","The sinister aura surrounding him had become several times more terrifying than before.","Countless veins bulged across his body.","The blood flowing from his wounds no longer dripped onto the ground.","Instead, it was absorbed back into his body.","His flesh began to tremble.","His aura continued to rise.","\"Demonic Blood Frenzy!\"","Mo Zun suddenly roared.","BOOM!!!","An enormous wave of demonic energy erupted from his body.","The entire battlefield was enveloped by an oppressive and sinister aura.","His cultivation had already surpassed the Golden Immortal Realm’s Late stage.","Even his physical strength had risen tremendously.","The pressure he released was completely different from before.","More importantly, his presence had become incredibly dangerous.","The Mo Zun standing before them no longer seemed like the same person.","His eyes were filled with madness.","His killing intent was so intense that it seemed capable of swallowing everything around him.","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators immediately began to panic.","\"Lord Mo actually used the Demonic Blood Frenzy?!\"","\"Quick! Let’s get away from him!\"","Several Demonic Cultivators immediately retreated.","Their expressions were filled with fear.","They clearly knew how terrifying this technique was.","The Demonic Blood Frenzy could forcibly burn and consume the cultivator’s own blood essence, causing their cultivation and physical strength to rise dramatically for a short period of time.","But there was a terrifying price.","The technique would severely affect the user’s mind.","The stronger the technique became, the more difficult it was for the user to distinguish between friend and foe.","Once Mo Zun completely lost control, anyone who appeared within his sight could become his target.","Whether they were enemies...","Or his own subordinates...","He would kill them all.","\"Lord Mo has completely lost control!\"","\"We need to leave!\"","\"Run!\"","Several Demonic Cultivators immediately began fleeing.","They didn’t dare to stay anywhere near Mo Zun.","After all, they had seen the consequences of Mo Zun using this technique before.","Once he entered this state, there was no longer any concept of allies in his eyes.","Only killing remained.","However, not everyone was frightened.","Some of the stronger and more arrogant Demonic Cultivators remained where they were.","\"What are you panicking about?\"","One of them sneered.","\"Lord Mo has only just used the technique.\"","\"He hasn’t even started fighting Bai Zihan yet. Why should we run?\"","Another Demonic Cultivator nodded.","\"Exactly. Once Lord Mo Zun kills Bai Zihan, the Bai Clan will certainly send people to avenge him.\"","\"By then, Lord Mo Zun will need to fight them as well.\"","A sinister smile appeared on his face.","\"We should at least watch how Bai Zihan dies under Lord Mo’s hand.\"","\"Quick! Someone bring me a Memory Crystal Mirror to record this moment!\"","Many believed that Mo Zun would be occupied fighting the Bai Clan before he could set his eyes on them.","So, there was still time before they could make their exit.","Mo Zun’s terrifying aura suddenly stopped rising.","For a brief moment, the entire battlefield became strangely silent.","Then—","Whoosh!!!","Mo Zun’s figure disappeared.","Bai Zihan’s pupils suddenly contracted.","So fast!","Mo Zun appeared directly before him.","There was no hesitation.","No playing around.","He simply raised his saber and struck, caring about nothing but to kill the person before him.","The saber descended with terrifying force.","Bai Zihan’s expression changed slightly.","He hadn’t expected Mo Zun to attack so suddenly and with such speed.","There was no time to dodge.","He raised his sword instead to block the incoming attack.","CLANG!!!","The saber and sword collided. A terrifying shockwave erupted.","Bai Zihan’s body was instantly sent flying backward.","His feet barely touched the ground before his body was forced backward several meters.","Before he could stabilize himself—","Whoosh!!!","Mo Zun was already before him.","Mo Zun’s saber descended once again.","Bai Zihan hurriedly raised his sword to block.","The terrifying force of the saber struck him directly.","His body was sent flying once again.","BANG!!!","Bai Zihan crashed into the ground.","The earth violently cracked beneath him.","However, before he could regain his posture—","Whoosh!!!","Mo Zun appeared above him. His saber descended like a bolt of destruction.","Bai Zihan immediately rolled to the side.","BOOM!!!","The saber struck the ground.","The earth exploded.","Countless rocks and debris shot into the air.","Bai Zihan’s figure flashed away. But Mo Zun was already chasing him.","Whoosh!","Slash!","The saber swept across the battlefield.","Bai Zihan raised his sword to block again.","Clang!!!","The terrifying impact forced him backward.","Mo Zun followed immediately with another strike.","Slash!","Bai Zihan barely managed to evade the saber’s edge.","However, the saber’s force still tore open a wound across his shoulder.","Blood instantly flowed down his arm.","Bai Zihan’s expression became slightly serious.","Mo Zun’s strength had increased tremendously.","His speed had also risen to an unbelievable level.","Before, Bai Zihan could completely suppress Mo Zun with his speed.","But now—","The situation had completely reversed.","Clang! Clang! Clang!!!","Mo Zun seemed to care about nothing other than killing Bai Zihan, and Bai Zihan couldn’t do anything other than block the incoming attacks.","Mo Zun didn’t give Bai Zihan any chance to breathe at all.","Bai Zihan’s body was forced backward.","Slash! Slash! Slash!","Every strike carried terrifying power.","Bai Zihan continuously retreated.","His sword moved rapidly as he desperately blocked each incoming attack.","Clang! Clang! Clang!","The sound of weapons colliding continuously echoed across the battlefield.","Bai Zihan was continuously being pushed back.","He couldn’t find an opportunity to counterattack or dodge.","Mo Zun’s strength had become too overwhelming.","Every time their weapons collided, Bai Zihan could feel an enormous pressure on his arms.","\"This is...\"","Bai Zihan’s eyes narrowed.","The Demonic Blood Frenzy had truly transformed Mo Zun.","Whoosh!!!","Mo Zun suddenly sped up again.","Bai Zihan immediately used the Shadowless Step.","His figure vanished.","However—","Whoosh!!!","Mo Zun appeared beside him at almost the exact same moment.","Bai Zihan’s expression changed.","Slash!!!","The saber swept toward his waist.","Bai Zihan hurriedly twisted his body.","The saber passed dangerously close to him.","Yet the saber’s force still tore through his clothes and left a bloody wound across his side.","However, the wound on Bai Zihan’s side suddenly began to heal.","The bleeding stopped almost instantly.","The torn flesh rapidly regenerated.","In just a few breaths, the wound had completely disappeared.","Bai Zihan’s body had already recovered.","His expression remained completely calm.","The injuries that would have seriously affected an ordinary cultivator were almost meaningless to him.","The power of his physique was simply too terrifying.","Whoosh!!!","Bai Zihan’s figure suddenly disappeared.","Shadowless Step!","He no longer tried to fight Mo Zun head-on.","Instead, he completely abandoned the idea of confronting him directly.","His only goal now was—","Avoid Mo Zun’s attacks.","Whoosh!!!","Mo Zun appeared where Bai Zihan had been standing.","His saber slashed through empty air.","Whoosh!!!","Bai Zihan appeared hundreds of meters away.","Mo Zun’s expression became even more sinister.","Whoosh!!!","His figure disappeared once again.","He chased after Bai Zihan at terrifying speed.","Slash!!!","His saber swept toward Bai Zihan’s back. But Bai Zihan’s figure flickered.","\"Shadowless Step!\"","He vanished once again.","The saber missed again.","Boom!!!","The terrifying saber energy tore through the ground, creating a massive ravine.","Mo Zun immediately turned around. But Bai Zihan was already somewhere else.","Swish! Swish! Swish!","The two figures continuously flashed across the battlefield.","Mo Zun chased relentlessly.","Bai Zihan continuously avoided him.","Every time Mo Zun attacked, Bai Zihan would use Shadowless Step to disappear before the saber could reach him.","Mo Zun immediately turned around and launched another attack.","Slash!!!","Bai Zihan vanished again.","Mo Zun roared furiously.","His killing intent surged wildly.","He launched attack after attack.","But none of them could touch Bai Zihan who was hell-bent on avoiding direct confrontation.","Bai Zihan’s expression remained calm.","Although he had been forced into a defensive position, he showed no signs of panic.","Normally, a technique like Shadowless Step consumes an enormous amount of Qi.","If an ordinary cultivator continuously used a Saint-Grade movement technique at such a terrifying speed, their Qi would have been exhausted long ago.","Even their physical body would struggle to withstand the burden.","But Bai Zihan was different.","He possessed the Supreme Dao Bone and Primordial Chaos Body.","The Supreme Dao Bone continuously replenished his Qi.","Every time his Qi was consumed, it was rapidly replenished.","Every time his body suffered damage from the extreme movement, it rapidly recovered due to his physique.","As a result, Bai Zihan could continuously use Shadowless Step without worrying about exhausting himself.","Swish!!!","He disappeared again.","Mo Zun chased after him.","Mo Zun became completely restless.","He launched attack after attack.","He chased Bai Zihan relentlessly.","He even unleashed massive waves of demonic energy to seal the surrounding space.","But Bai Zihan continued to escape.","Shadowless Step allowed him to move through the battlefield like a fleeting shadow.","Mo Zun’s eyes became completely bloodshot.","The madness within them grew even stronger.","His Demonic Blood Frenzy was already pushing his mind toward the brink of losing control.","All he wanted was to kill Bai Zihan at any cost.","Nothing else mattered.","He suddenly raised his saber.","BOOM!!!","An enormous amount of demonic energy erupted from his body.","The surrounding space trembled violently.","Mo Zun suddenly charged forward.","His speed erupted to its absolute limit.","Whoosh!!!","His figure disappeared.","The next moment—","He appeared directly before Bai Zihan.","Slash!!!","His saber descended with enough power to split the heavens.","But this time, Bai Zihan didn’t immediately use Shadowless Step.","He stood there calmly.","His eyes were completely cold.","His hand tightened around his sword.","Mo Zun’s saber was already approaching yet Bai Zihan remained motionless.","His sword slowly rose.","A terrifying Sword Intent suddenly erupted from Bai Zihan’s body.","The surrounding air seemed to freeze.","Bai Zihan’s eyes flashed with coldness.","\"Fate Severing Slash!\""]},{"number":726,"title":"Chapter 726: Mo Zun’s Descent into Madness","paragraphs":["Fate Severing Slash!","It was Bai Zihan’s strongest attack.","And he had deliberately used it at the last possible moment when Mo Zun was close enough.","Mo Zun had been relentlessly chasing him.","For such a long time, Bai Zihan had done nothing except use Shadowless Step to avoid his attacks.","He had never tried to fight back.","He had never even shown the slightest intention of attacking.","Therefore, Mo Zun shouldn’t have anticipated that Bai Zihan would suddenly counterattack.","By the time Mo Zun realized something was up—","It was already too late.","Slash!!!","The attack tore through the heavens.","It instantly reached Mo Zun.","There was no time to dodge.","There was no time to block.","The attack was simply too fast.","And the distance between them was too close.","Even if Mo Zun wanted to retreat, he couldn’t escape the range of the Sword Technique.","However, at the final possible moment!","Mo Zun’s pupils suddenly contracted.","His body instinctively reacted.","His terrifying strength, speed, and reaction ability had all increased tremendously after using Demonic Blood Frenzy.","Even though his mind had already been consumed by madness, his body still reacted to the danger.","Mo Zun violently twisted his body.","Slash!!!","Fate Severing Slash tore through his body.","But instead of piercing directly through his chest, it severed his arm.","Blood sprayed into the sky.","His entire arm, along with his saber, was sent flying.","Thud!","It landed several meters away.","If Mo Zun had been even slightly slower, Fate Severing Slash would have pierced directly through his heart.","He would have died.","An ordinary person would have been terrified after narrowly escaping death.","But the current Mo Zun was different.","He looked at his missing arm.","There was no fear.","No pain.","There was only madness.","Whoosh!!!","He still lunged directly toward Bai Zihan.","Bai Zihan had just used Fate Severing Slash.","His entire focus had been placed on counterattacking.","He hadn’t expected Mo Zun to continue attacking him after suffering such a severe injury.","Therefore, he didn’t have time to block or dodge.","BANG!!!","Mo Zun’s fist slammed directly into Bai Zihan’s chest.","The terrifying force exploded.","Bai Zihan’s body was sent flying backward.","THUD!","He crashed into the ground.","A mouthful of blood instantly sprayed from his mouth.","Bai Zihan quickly stabilized his body and wiped the blood from the corner of his mouth.","His eyes became slightly colder.","He had succeeded in severely injuring Mo Zun.","But he had also underestimated Mo Zun’s madness.","In the first place, Bai Zihan had never truly intended to kill Mo Zun with that attack.","Otherwise, at such a close distance, with Mo Zun completely exposed—","How could he have missed his fatal point?","Bai Zihan had deliberately aimed to severely injure him.","He wanted to force Mo Zun into submission.","But now, he finally realized something.","With Mo Zun in his current state, he was no longer capable of reasoning normally.","The Demonic Blood Frenzy had already consumed too much of his mind.","Even after losing an arm and nearly losing his life—","He still continued attacking without the slightest hesitation.","It seemed that Mo Zun had truly lost his mind.","\"Looks like trying to make him submit in this state is impossible.\"","Bai Zihan slowly stood up.","His eyes became calm once again.","Since Mo Zun could no longer be subdued—","Then there was no need to continue fighting him. Otherwise, he might accidentally kill him.","He needed to change his tactics immediately.","Whoosh!","Mo Zun charged toward him again.","His bloodshot eyes were filled with nothing but killing intent.","Bai Zihan turned around.","Whoosh!","His figure disappeared.","\"Shadowless Step!\"","Mo Zun immediately chased after him.","Whoosh!","The two figures once again crossed the battlefield at terrifying speed.","Meanwhile, the surrounding Demonic Cultivators were in high spirits.","Ever since Mo Zun had activated Demonic Blood Frenzy, the situation had completely changed.","Before, they had been terrified when Bai Zihan repeatedly suppressed Mo Zun.","But now, Mo Zun has completely turned the tables.","Even when Bai Zihan used his strongest attack, Fate Severing Slash, Mo Zun had still managed to survive.","Although he had lost an arm—","He was still alive.","The Demonic Cultivators believed that Bai Zihan’s strongest trump card had failed to kill Mo Zun.","Therefore, Bai Zihan’s time was running out.","\"Lord Mo is truly terrifying!\"","\"Hahaha! Bai Zihan can’t even fight back anymore!\"","\"Just wait. Bai Zihan will definitely die!\"","The Demonic Cultivators continued watching the battle excitedly.","However, their expressions soon changed.","The two figures were getting closer.","And closer.","And closer...","One of the Demonic Cultivators suddenly froze.","\"A-Aren’t... Aren’t they coming in our direction?\"","His eyes widened.","The other Demonic Cultivators immediately looked toward the approaching figures.","Their expressions changed drastically.","\"Bai Zihan is bringing Lord Mo here?!\"","\"What the hell is that bastard doing?!\"","\"That damn bastard wants to involve us in his fight!\"","\"Run!\"","The Demonic Cultivators immediately scattered.","They had finally realized what Bai Zihan was planning to do.","Bai Zihan knew very well that fighting the current Mo Zun head-on was pointless.","Mo Zun had already lost his mind.","He no longer cared about his own life.","Even after losing an arm and nearly being killed by Fate Severing Slash, he still continued attacking without hesitation.","Bai Zihan also couldn’t simply kill him, not yet.","He still needed an answer from Mo Zun.","He needed to know why Luo Qing had been kidnapped.","Therefore, the only thing he could do was wait.","Wait until the effects of Demonic Blood Frenzy wore off.","But simply dodging Mo Zun’s attacks and wasting time was extremely boring.","So Bai Zihan came up with another idea.","Since Mo Zun had already lost his mind...","Why not bring him to the Demonic Cultivators?","Perhaps Mo Zun would attack them as well.","Whoosh!!!","Bai Zihan’s figure flashed forward.","Mo Zun immediately followed.","Soon, Bai Zihan entered the group of fleeing Demonic Cultivators.","\"He’s here!\"","\"Run!\"","\"Don’t let Lord Mo catch us!\"","The Demonic Cultivators desperately tried to escape.","But how could they possibly escape?","Bai Zihan and Mo Zun were both moving at terrifying speeds.","Compared to them, these Demonic Cultivators were simply too slow.","Whoosh!!!","Bai Zihan flashed past one group.","Mo Zun followed immediately.","The moment several Demonic Cultivators stood in his path—","Mo Zun’s bloodshot eyes suddenly locked onto them.","Killing intent erupted.","He raised his remaining arm.","BOOM!!!","A terrifying fist instantly descended.","\"Lord Mo!\"","One of the Demonic Cultivators’ faces turned pale.","\"Spare me! I am your loyal follower!\"","BOOM!!!","His body instantly exploded.","He was directly reduced to a pool of blood.","The surrounding Demonic Cultivators froze.","Their faces became deathly pale, knowing full well that the current Mo Zun didn’t care who they were.","The Demonic Cultivators scattered in panic. But Mo Zun didn’t stop.","His eyes were completely devoid of reason.","Anyone who appeared before him was simply a target.","Whether they were enemies—","Or his own subordinates—","It made no difference.","BOOM!!!","Another Demonic Cultivator was struck by Mo Zun.","His body exploded instantly.","Blood splattered across the ground.","\"Lord Mo! It’s me!\"","\"Don’t kill me!\"","\"I’ve followed you for hundreds of years!\"","BOOM!!!","Anyone who stood between him and Bai Zihan were killed without any mercy.","Whoosh!!!","Bai Zihan flashed past another group.","Mo Zun followed closely behind.","The moment several Demonic Cultivators appeared before him—","BOOM!!!","Another terrifying attack descended.","Blood sprayed across the battlefield.","The Demonic Cultivators screamed and desperately fled.","\"Bai Zihan!\"","\"You bastard!\"","\"Stop bringing Lord Mo toward us!\"","Bai Zihan ignored them.","His expression remained completely calm.","He deliberately changed direction.","Mo Zun followed.","Another group of Demonic Cultivators appeared ahead.","The moment Mo Zun saw them—","He attacked.","BOOM!!!","Several figures were instantly blasted apart.","The battlefield had completely descended into chaos.","The Demonic Cultivators who had previously been cheering for Mo Zun were now desperately fleeing from him.","They finally understood how terrifying Demonic Blood Frenzy was.","It had turned him into a killing machine.","And Bai Zihan was taking full advantage of it.","\"Catch Bai Zihan!\"","\"Stop him!\"","\"Don’t let him bring Lord Mo toward us!\"","A few stronger Demonic Cultivators gritted their teeth and attempted to intercept Bai Zihan.","If they could capture Bai Zihan, perhaps they could stop this nightmare.","Several figures immediately rushed toward him.","But—","Whoosh!!!","Bai Zihan disappeared.","Their attacks struck empty air.","\"What?!\"","Before they could react, Bai Zihan had already appeared several hundred meters away.","The Demonic Cultivators’ expressions became extremely ugly.","How could they possibly catch him?","Even Mo Zun—","Who had already reached a terrifying level of speed after using Demonic Blood Frenzy—","Could only barely keep up with Bai Zihan.","These Demonic Cultivators weren’t even Golden Immortal Realm experts.","Trying to catch Bai Zihan was simply impossible.","Whoosh!!!","Bai Zihan disappeared again.","Mo Zun immediately chased after him.","The Demonic Cultivators watched the two figures rapidly approaching another group.","Their faces turned pale.","\"No... No...\"","\"Not me!\"","\"Run!\"","Bai Zihan’s eyes remained calm.","He continued moving.","Mo Zun followed.","And another massacre began."]}]);
